"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/multi-server.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຈັດການລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/multi-server.adoc[]."

