#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:23
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-install-requirements.adoc:11
msgid ""
"{productname} Proxy caches packages in the [path]``/var/cache/`` directory.  "
"If there is not enough space available in [path]``/var/cache/``, the proxy "
"will remove old, unused packages and replace them with newer packages."
msgstr "{productname} ພຣັອກຊີ ຈະແຄຊ (cache) ແພັກເກດໄວ້ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/var/cache/``. ຫາກມີພື້ນທີ່ບໍ່ພຽງພໍໃນ [path]``/var/cache/``, ພຣັອກຊີຈະລຶບແພັກເກດເກົ່າທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ອອກ ແລ້ວແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍແພັກເກດໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:24
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-install-requirements.adoc:12
msgid "As a result of this behavior:"
msgstr "ຈາກພຶດຕິກຳນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:25
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-install-requirements.adoc:13
msgid ""
"The larger [path]``/var/cache/`` directory is on the proxy, the less traffic "
"there will be between it and the {productname} Server."
msgstr "ຍິ່ງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/var/cache/`` ໃນພຣັອກຊີມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ເທົ່າໃດ, ປະລິມານການຮັບສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ (traffic) ລະຫວ່າງມັນກັບ {productname} ເຊີເວີ ກໍ່ຈະຍິ່ງໜ້ອຍລົງເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:26
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-install-requirements.adoc:14
msgid ""
"By making the [path]``/var/cache/`` directory on the proxy the same size as "
"[path]``/var/spacewalk/`` on the {productname} Server, you avoid a large "
"amount of traffic after the first synchronization."
msgstr "ໂດຍການກຳນົດໃຫ້ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/var/cache/`` ໃນພຣັອກຊີ ມີຂະໜາດດຽວກັນກັບ [path]``/var/spacewalk/`` ໃນ {productname} ເຊີເວີ, ທ່ານຈະສາມາດຫຼີກເວັ້ນ traffic ຈຳນວນມະຫາສານຫຼັງຈາກການຊິ້ງຂໍ້ມູນຄັ້ງທຳອິດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:27
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-install-requirements.adoc:15
msgid ""
"The [path]``/var/cache/`` directory can be small on the {productname} Server "
"compared to the proxy."
msgstr "ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/var/cache/`` ໃນ {productname} ເຊີເວີ ສາມາດມີຂະໜາດນ້ອຍກວ່າໃນພຣັອກຊີໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:28
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-install-requirements.adoc:16
msgid ""
"For a guide to size estimation, see the <<server-hardware-requirements>> "
"section."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຄູ່ມືການປະເມີນຂະໜາດ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ພາກສ່ວນ <<server-hardware-requirements>>."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:29
msgid ""
"In general, {suse} recommends to adjust the value for the cache directory to "
"about 60 % of available free space.  Users can set the [option]``cache_dir`` "
"option in the [path]``squid.conf`` manually."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:30
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/tuning.adoc#tune_proxy[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Storage Devices and Permissions"
msgstr "ອຸປະກອນຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ການກຳນົດສິດ (Permissions)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:32
msgid ""
"We recommend that the repositories and the database for {productname} are "
"stored on separate storage devices.  This will help to avoid data loss."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:33
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:18
msgid ""
"You must set up the storage devices before you run the YaST {productname} "
"setup procedure."
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມຂັ້ນຕອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ YaST {productname}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Do not use NFS for {cobbler} or {postgresql} storage, neither NFS on SELinux "
"environments.  These scenarios are not supported."
msgstr "ຫ້າມໃຊ້ NFS ສຳລັບບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ {cobbler} ຫຼື {postgresql}, ລວມທັງຫ້າມໃຊ້ NFS ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ SELinux. ສະຖານະການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:35
msgid "{productname} requires three different volumes:"
msgstr "{productname} ຕ້ອງການສາມໂວນລູມ (volumes) ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:36
msgid "Database volume: [path]``/var/lib/pgsql``"
msgstr "ໂວນລູມຖານຂໍ້ມູນ: [path]``/var/lib/pgsql``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:37
msgid "Channel volume: [path]``/var/spacewalk``"
msgstr "ໂວນລູມຊ່ອງທາງ (Channel volume): [path]``/var/spacewalk``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:38
msgid "Cache: [path]``/var/cache``"
msgstr "ແຄຊ (Cache): [path]``/var/cache``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:39
msgid ""
"We recommend you use XFS as the filesystem type for all volumes.  "
"Additionally, for on-premise installations, consider using logical volume "
"management (LVM) to manage the disks.  The size of the disk for repositories "
"storage is dependent on the number of distributions and channels you intend "
"to manage with {productname}.  See the tables in this section for guides to "
"estimate the size required."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານໃຊ້ XFS ເປັນປະເພດລະບົບໄຟລ໌ສຳລັບທຸກໂວນລູມ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ ພາຍໃນອົງກອນ (on-premise), ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາໃຊ້ logical volume management (LVM) ເພື່ອຈັດການດິສກ໌. ຂະໜາດຂອງດິສກ໌ສຳລັບເກັບຄັງເກັບຊອບແວແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບຈຳນວນ distributions ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ທ່ານ ຕັ້ງໃຈຈະຈັດການດ້ວຍ {productname}. ເບິ່ງຕາຕະລາງໃນພາກສ່ວນນີ້ເພື່ອເປັນແນວທາງໃນການປະເມີນຂະໜາດທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:40
msgid ""
"On your {productname} Server, use this command to find all available storage "
"devices:"
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} ເຊີເວີ ຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອຊອກຫາອຸປະກອນຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຢູ່ທັງໝົດ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:41
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "hwinfo --disk | grep -E \"Device File:\"\n"
msgstr "hwinfo --disk | grep -E \"Device File:\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:42
msgid "Use the [command]``lsblk`` command to see the name and size of each device."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``lsblk`` ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຊື່ ແລະ ຂະໜາດຂອງແຕ່ລະອຸປະກອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:43
msgid ""
"Use the [command]``suma-storage`` command with the device names to set up "
"the external disks as the locations for the database and repositories:"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``suma-storage`` ພ້ອມກັບຊື່ອຸປະກອນ ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າດິສກ໌ພາຍນອກ ໃຫ້ເປັນຕຳແໜ່ງສຳລັບຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "suma-storage <channel_devicename> [<database_devicename>]\n"
msgstr "suma-storage <channel_devicename> [<database_devicename>]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:45
msgid ""
"The external storage volumes are set up as XFS partitions mounted at "
"[path]``/manager_storage`` and [path]``/pgsql_storage``."
msgstr "ໂວນລູມຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນພາຍນອກຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນພາທິຊັນ XFS ທີ່ເມົາທ໌ (mounted) ຢູ່ທີ່ [path]``/manager_storage`` ແລະ [path]``/pgsql_storage``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:46
msgid ""
"It is possible to use the same storage device for both channel data and the "
"database.  This is not recommended, as growing channel repositories might "
"fill up the storage, which poses a risk to database integrity.  Using "
"separate storage devices may also increase performance.  If you want to use "
"a single storage device, run [command]``suma-storage`` with a single device "
"name parameter."
msgstr "ມັນເປັນໄປໄດ້ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ອຸປະກອນຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນດຽວກັນສຳລັບທັງຂໍ້ມູນຊ່ອງທາງ ແລະ ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ. ແຕ່ບໍ່ແນະນຳ, ເນື່ອງຈາກຄັງເກັບຊອບແວທີ່ໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ພື້ນທີ່ເຕັມ, ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຄວາມສ່ຽງຕໍ່ຄວາມສົມບູນຂອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນ. ການໃຊ້ອຸປະກອນຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແຍກກັນຍັງຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບອີກດ້ວຍ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ອຸປະກອນຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນດຽວ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``suma-storage`` ໂດຍລະບຸພຽງຊື່ອຸປະກອນດຽວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:47
msgid ""
"If you are installing a proxy, the [command]``suma-storage`` command only "
"takes a single device name parameter and will set up the external storage "
"location as the Squid cache."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງຕິດຕັ້ງພຣັອກຊີ, ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``suma-storage`` ຈະຮັບພຽງແຕ່ພາມິເຕີຊື່ອຸປະກອນດຽວ ແລະ ຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າຕຳແໜ່ງຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນພາຍນອກໃຫ້ເປັນ Squid cache."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:48
msgid ""
"When you create disk partitions for the {productname} Server and Proxy, "
"ensure you set the permissions correctly."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງພາທິຊັນດິສກ໌ສຳລັບ {productname} ເຊີເວີ ແລະ ພຣັອກຊີ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານ ກຳນົດສິດ (permissions) ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:49
msgid "For [path]``/var/lib/pgsql``:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບ [path]``/var/lib/pgsql``:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:50
msgid "Owner: Read, Write, Execute"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຂອງ (Owner): ອ່ານ, ຂຽນ, ປະຕິບັດງານ (Read, Write, Execute)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:51
msgid "Group: Read, Execute"
msgstr "ກຸ່ມ (Group): ອ່ານ, ປະຕິບັດງານ (Read, Execute)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:52
msgid "User: None"
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ (User): ບໍ່ມີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:53
msgid "For [path]``/var/spacewalk``:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບ [path]``/var/spacewalk``:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:54
msgid "Owner: Read, Write, Execute"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຂອງ (Owner): ອ່ານ, ຂຽນ, ປະຕິບັດງານ (Read, Write, Execute)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:55
msgid "Group: Read, Write, Execute"
msgstr "ກຸ່ມ (Group): ອ່ານ, ຂຽນ, ປະຕິບັດງານ (Read, Write, Execute)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:56
msgid "User: Read, Execute"
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ (User): ອ່ານ, ປະຕິບັດງານ (Read, Execute)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:57
msgid "Check the permissions with this command:"
msgstr "ກວດສອບສິດດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "ls -l /var/lib/pgsql /var/spacewalk\n"
msgstr "ls -l /var/lib/pgsql /var/spacewalk\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:59
msgid "The output should look like this:"
msgstr "ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຄວນຈະເປັນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:60
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"drwxr-x--- 1 postgres postgres /var/lib/pgsql\n"
"drwxrwxr-x 1 wwwrun   www      /var/spacewalk\n"
msgstr ""
"drwxr-x--- 1 postgres postgres /var/lib/pgsql\n"
"drwxrwxr-x 1 wwwrun   www      /var/spacewalk\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:61
msgid "If required, change the permissions with these commands:"
msgstr "ຖ້າຈຳເປັນ, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນສິດດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"chmod 750 /var/lib/pgsql\n"
"chmod 775 /var/spacewalk\n"
msgstr ""
"chmod 750 /var/lib/pgsql\n"
"chmod 775 /var/spacewalk\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:63
msgid "And owners with:"
msgstr "ແລະ ປ່ຽນເຈົ້າຂອງດ້ວຍ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"chown postgres:postgres /var/lib/pgsql\n"
"chown wwwrun:www /var/spacewalk\n"
msgstr ""
"chown postgres:postgres /var/lib/pgsql\n"
"chown wwwrun:www /var/spacewalk\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ibmz.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installing on {ibmz}"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງໃນ {ibmz}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ibmz.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section is intended for z/VM systems programmers responsible for "
"operating the {ibmz} mainframes.  It assumes that you are a z/VM systems "
"programmer trained on {ibmz} operating protocols, and steps you through "
"installing {productname} onto an existing mainframe system.  This section "
"does not cover the variety of hardware configuration profiles available on "
"{ibmz}, but provides a foundational overview of the procedure and "
"requirements necessary for a successful {productname} Server deployment on "
"{ibmz}."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ແມ່ນມີຈຸດປະສົງສຳລັບນັກຂຽນໂປຣແກຣມລະບົບ z/VM ທີ່ຮັບຜິດຊອບໃນການດຳເນີນງານ mainframe ຂອງ {ibmz}. ມັນສົມມຸດວ່າທ່ານເປັນນັກຂຽນໂປຣແກຣມລະບົບ z/VM ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຝຶກອົບຮົມ ກ່ຽວກັບໂປຣໂຕຄໍການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ {ibmz}, ແລະ ຈະພາທ່ານໄປແຕ່ລະຂັ້ນຕອນໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ລົງໃນລະບົບ mainframe ທີ່ມີຢູ່. ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ກວມເອົາໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ຮາດແວທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ {ibmz}, ແຕ່ຈະໃຫ້ພາບລວມພື້ນຖານຂອງຂັ້ນຕອນ ແລະ ຂໍ້ກຳນົດ ທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການວາງລະບົບ {productname} ເຊີເວີ ໃຫ້ສຳເລັດໃນ {ibmz}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ibmz.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This section describes how to install {susemgr} Server using {sle} "
"installation media.  You must have already registered your {susemgr} product "
"with {scc}, and have obtained a registration code."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ອະທິບາຍວິທີການຕິດຕັ້ງ {susemgr} ເຊີເວີ ໂດຍໃຊ້ສື່ການຕິດຕັ້ງ {sle}. ທ່ານຕ້ອງໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນຜະລິດຕະພັນ {susemgr} ຂອງທ່ານກັບ {scc} ຮຽບຮ້ອຍແລ້ວ, ແລະ ໄດ້ຮັບລະຫັດລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ibmz.adoc:4
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-unified.adoc:3
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-server-unified.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For information on registering with {scc}, retrieving your organization "
"credentials from {scc}, or obtaining installation media, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:general-requirements.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການລົງທະບຽນກັບ {scc}, ການດຶງຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງອົງກອນຈາກ {scc}, ຫຼື ການຮັບສື່ການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:general-requirements.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ibmz.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "System Requirements"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂອງລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ibmz.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Before you begin, check that your environment meets the base system "
"requirements."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານກົງຕາມຂໍ້ກຳນົດພື້ນຖານຂອງລະບົບ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ibmz.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compatible {ibmz} Systems:"
msgstr "ລະບົບ {ibmz} ທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ibmz.adoc:8
msgid "IBM zEnterprise EC12"
msgstr "IBM zEnterprise EC12"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ibmz.adoc:9
msgid "IBM zEnterprise BC12"
msgstr "IBM zEnterprise BC12"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ibmz.adoc:10
msgid "IBM z13"
msgstr "IBM z13"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ibmz.adoc:11
msgid "LinuxONE Rockhopper"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ibmz.adoc:12
msgid "LinuxONE Emperor"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ibmz.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Hardware     | Recommended\n"
"| CPU          | Minimum 4 dedicated 64-bit CPU cores\n"
"| RAM:         | Test Server: Minimum 16{nbsp}GB RAM and 2{nbsp}GB Swap "
"space\n"
"|              | Base Installation: Minimum 16{nbsp}GB\n"
"|              | Production Server: Minimum 32{nbsp}GB\n"
"| Disk Space:  | Root Partition: Minimum 100{nbsp}GB\n"
"|              | [path]``/var/lib/pgsql``: Minimum 50{nbsp}GB\n"
"|              | [path]``/var/spacewalk``: Minimum 50{nbsp}GB per SUSE "
"product and 360{nbsp}GB per Red Hat product\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຮາດແວ        | ຄຳແນະນຳ\n"
"| CPU          | ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 4 dedicated 64-bit CPU cores\n"
"| RAM:         | ເຊີເວີທົດສອບ: ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 16{nbsp}GB RAM ແລະ 2{nbsp}GB ພື້ນທີ່ Swap\n"
"|              | ການຕິດຕັ້ງພື້ນຖານ: ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 16{nbsp}GB\n"
"|              | ເຊີເວີໃຊ້ງານຈິງ: ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 32{nbsp}GB\n"
"| ພື້ນທີ່ດິສກ໌:  | Root Partition: ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 100{nbsp}GB\n"
"|              | [path]``/var/lib/pgsql``: ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 50{nbsp}GB\n"
"|              | [path]``/var/spacewalk``: ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 50{nbsp}GB ຕໍ່ຜະລິດຕະພັນ SUSE ແລະ 360{nbsp}GB ຕໍ່ຜະລິດຕະພັນ Red Hat\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ibmz.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Memory should be split across available RAM, VDISK, and swap to suit your "
"environment.  On a production system the ratio of physical memory to VDISK "
"will need to be evaluated based on the number of clients you will be "
"installing."
msgstr "ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຄວນຖືກແບ່ງລະຫວ່າງ RAM, VDISK, ແລະ swap ທີ່ມີຢູ່ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບ ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ. ໃນລະບົບໃຊ້ງານຈິງ, ອັດຕາສ່ວນຂອງ physical memory ຕໍ່ VDISK ຈະຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການປະເມີນໂດຍອີງຕາມຈຳນວນລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ທ່ານຈະຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ibmz.adoc:16
msgid ""
"You will require an additional disk for database storage.  This should be an "
"[systemitem]``zFCP`` or [systemitem]``DASD`` device as these are preferred "
"for use with [systemitem]``HYPERPAV``.  The database storage disk should "
"have:"
msgstr "ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງມີດິສກ໌ເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບຈັດເກັບຖານຂໍ້ມູນ. ນີ້ຄວນເປັນອຸປະກອນ [systemitem]``zFCP`` ຫຼື [systemitem]``DASD`` ເນື່ອງຈາກພວກມັນເໝາະສຳລັບໃຊ້ກັບ [systemitem]``HYPERPAV``. ດິສກ໌ຈັດເກັບຖານຂໍ້ມູນຄວນມີ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ibmz.adoc:17
msgid "At least 50{nbsp}GB for [path]``/var/lib/pgsql``"
msgstr "ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 50{nbsp}GB ສຳລັບ [path]``/var/lib/pgsql``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ibmz.adoc:18
msgid "At least 50{nbsp}GB for each SUSE product in [path]``/var/spacewalk``"
msgstr "ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 50{nbsp}GB ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຜະລິດຕະພັນ SUSE ໃນ [path]``/var/spacewalk``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ibmz.adoc:19
msgid "At least 360{nbsp}GB for each Red Hat product in [path]``/var/spacewalk``"
msgstr "ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 360{nbsp}GB ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຜະລິດຕະພັນ Red Hat ໃນ [path]``/var/spacewalk``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ibmz.adoc:20
msgid ""
"You will need to ensure you have sufficient disk storage for {productname} "
"before running [command]``yast2 susemanager_setup``.  By default, the "
"{productname} file system, including the embedded database and patch "
"directories, reside within the root directory.  While adjustments are "
"possible when installation is complete, it is important that you specify and "
"monitor these adjustments closely.  For information on storage management "
"and reclaiming disk space, see the troubleshooting section in the "
"{productname} Administration Guide."
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີພື້ນທີ່ຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນພຽງພໍສຳລັບ {productname} ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``yast2 susemanager_setup``. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ {productname}, ລວມທັງຖານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຝັງຢູ່ ແລະ ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ patch, ແມ່ນຢູ່ໃນ root directory. ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະສາມາດປັບປ່ຽນໄດ້ເມື່ອການຕິດຕັ້ງສຳເລັດ, ແຕ່ມັນສຳຄັນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງລະບຸ ແລະ ຕິດຕາມການປັບປ່ຽນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຢ່າງໃກ້ຊິດ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການຈັດການບ່ອນຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ການເອົາພື້ນທີ່ດິສກ໌ຄືນ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ພາກສ່ວນການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາໃນ {productname} Administration Guide."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ibmz.adoc:21
msgid ""
"If your {productname} runs out of disk space, this can have a severe impact "
"on its database and file structure.  A full recovery is only possible with a "
"previous backup or a new {productname} installation.  {suse} technical "
"services will not be able to provide support for systems suffering from low "
"disk space conditions."
msgstr "ຖ້າ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານໝົດພື້ນທີ່ດິສກ໌, ມັນອາດຈະສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຮ້າຍແຮງຕໍ່ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ໂຄງສ້າງໄຟລ໌. ການກູ້ຄືນແບບສົມບູນແມ່ນເປັນໄປໄດ້ພຽງແຕ່ຫາກມີການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ ຫຼື ຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ໃໝ່ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ບໍລິການດ້ານເຕັກນິກຂອງ {suse} ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດ ໃຫ້ການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອສຳລັບລະບົບທີ່ປະສົບບັນຫາພື້ນທີ່ດິສກ໌ໜ້ອຍ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ibmz.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Network Requirements:"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດດ້ານເຄືອຂ່າຍ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ibmz.adoc:23
msgid "OSA Express Ethernet (including Fast and Gigabit Ethernet)"
msgstr "OSA Express Ethernet (ລວມທັງ Fast ແລະ Gigabit Ethernet)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ibmz.adoc:24
msgid "HiperSockets or Guest LAN"
msgstr "HiperSockets ຫຼື Guest LAN"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ibmz.adoc:25
msgid "10{nbsp}GBE, VSWITCH"
msgstr "10{nbsp}GBE, VSWITCH"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ibmz.adoc:26
msgid "RDMA over Converged Ethernet (RoCE)"
msgstr "RDMA over Converged Ethernet (RoCE)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ibmz.adoc:27
msgid "These interfaces are still included but no longer supported:"
msgstr "ອິນເຕີເຟດ (interfaces) ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຍັງລວມຢູ່ ແຕ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບແລ້ວ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ibmz.adoc:28
msgid "CTC or virtual CTC"
msgstr "CTC ຫຼື virtual CTC"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ibmz.adoc:29
msgid "IP network interface for IUCV"
msgstr "IP network interface ສຳລັບ IUCV"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ibmz.adoc:30
msgid ""
"The z/VM guest you want to run {productname} from will require a static IP "
"address and hostname before you begin, as these cannot easily be changed "
"after initial installation.  The hostname should contain less than "
"eight characters and must not contain any upper case letters."
msgstr "z/VM guest ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ລັນ {productname} ຈະຕ້ອງມີທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຄົງທີ່ (static IP) ແລະ ຊື່ໂຮສ (hostname) ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ເພາະວ່າສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ງ່າຍ ຫຼັງຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງຄັ້ງທຳອິດ. ຊື່ໂຮສຄວນມີຄວາມຍາວໜ້ອຍກວ່າແປດຕົວອັກສອນ ແລະ ຕ້ອງບໍ່ມີຕົວອັກສອນພິມໃຫຍ່."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ibmz.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install {productname} on {ibmz}"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ໃນ {ibmz}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ibmz.adoc:32
msgid ""
"This section covers the installation of {productname} as a product of the "
"{sle} family.  For general information about deploying a product on {ibmz} "
"hardware, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sles/15-SP4/html/SLES-all/cha-zseries.html."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ກວມເອົາການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ເຊິ່ງເປັນຜະລິດຕະພັນໜຶ່ງໃນຕະກູນ {sle}. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນທົ່ວໄປກ່ຽວກັບການວາງລະບົບຜະລິດຕະພັນໃນຮາດແວ {ibmz}, ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://documentation.suse.com/sles/15-SP4/html/SLES-all/cha-zseries.html."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ibmz.adoc:33
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-server-unified.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing {susemgr} Server from a DVD Image"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງ {susemgr} ເຊີເວີ ຈາກ DVD Image"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ibmz.adoc:34
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-server-unified.adoc:11
msgid "Boot your system with the {unifiedinstaller}."
msgstr "ບູດ (Boot) ລະບົບຂອງທ່ານດ້ວຍ {unifiedinstaller}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ibmz.adoc:35
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-server-unified.adoc:12
msgid "If booting fails you might need to adjust the boot order in the BIOS."
msgstr "ຖ້າການບູດຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງປັບລຳດັບການບູດໃນ BIOS."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ibmz.adoc:36
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-unified.adoc:13
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-server-unified.adoc:13
msgid "When prompted, select [guimenu]``Installation``."
msgstr "ເມື່ອລະບົບຖາມ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Installation``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ibmz.adoc:37
msgid ""
"Then continue as described in "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-server-unified.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຈາກນັ້ນດຳເນີນການຕໍ່ຕາມທີ່ໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນ xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-server-unified.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ibmz.adoc:38
msgid ""
"To finalize the {productname} installation see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:server-setup.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ສຳເລັດສົມບູນ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:server-setup.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ignition.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Boot Image Configuration Tools"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ignition.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} VM images are prepared with JeOS firstboot configuration "
"dialogs.  Using a boot image configuration tool such as "
"[systemitem]``Ignition`` is optinal now."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ignition.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "{productname} Basic Configuration Using [systemitem]``Ignition``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ignition.adoc:4
msgid ""
"[systemitem]``Ignition`` is a provisioning tool that enables you to "
"configure a system according to your specification on the first boot.  When "
"the system is booted for the first time, [systemitem]``Ignition`` is loaded "
"as part of an initramfs and searches for a configuration file within a "
"specific directory (on a USB flash disk, or you can provide a URL)."
msgstr "[systemitem]``Ignition`` ແມ່ນເຄື່ອງມືໃນການຈັດກຽມລະບົບ (provisioning tool) ທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດຄ່າລະບົບຕາມທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃນການບູດຄັ້ງທຳອິດ. ເມື່ອລະບົບບູດຂຶ້ນມາເປັນຄັ້ງທຳອິດ, [systemitem]``Ignition`` ຈະຖືກໂຫລດເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງ initramfs ແລະ ຈະຄົ້ນຫາໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າພາຍໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ (ໃນ USB flash disk ຫຼື ຜ່ານ URL)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ignition.adoc:5
msgid ""
"[systemitem]``Ignition`` uses a configuration file in the JSON format.  The "
"file is called [path]``config.ign``."
msgstr "[systemitem]``Ignition`` ໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າໃນຮູບແບບ JSON ເຊິ່ງມີຊື່ວ່າ [path]``config.ign``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ignition.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The [path]``config.ign`` is a JSON configuration file that provides "
"prescriptions for Ignition.  You can either create the file manually in "
"JSON, or you can use the Fuel Ignition tool to generate a basic set of "
"prescriptions.  The Fuel Ignition tool does not provide a full set of "
"options, so you might have to modify the file manually.  For more "
"information, see https://ignite.opensuse.org/."
msgstr "[path]``config.ign`` ແມ່ນໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າ JSON ທີ່ໃຫ້ຄຳສັ່ງແກ່ Ignition. ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງໄຟລ໌ນີ້ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໃນຮູບແບບ JSON ຫຼື ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື Fuel Ignition ເພື່ອສ້າງຊຸດຄຳສັ່ງພື້ນຖານກໍໄດ້. ເນື່ອງຈາກເຄື່ອງມື Fuel Ignition ບໍ່ມີຕົວເລືອກໃຫ້ຄົບຖ້ວນ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງປັບແກ້ໄຟລ໌ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ https://ignite.opensuse.org/."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ignition.adoc:7
msgid ""
"When installing, the configuration file [path]``config.ign`` must reside in "
"the [path]``ignition`` subdirectory on the configuration media labeled "
"[systemitem]``ignition``.  The directory structure must look as follows:"
msgstr "ໃນເວລາຕິດຕັ້ງ, ໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າ [path]``config.ign`` ຈະຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຍ່ອຍ [path]``ignition`` ເທິງສື່ກຳນົດຄ່າທີ່ມີປ້າຍຊື່ (label) ວ່າ [systemitem]``ignition``. ໂຄງສ້າງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຈະຕ້ອງເປັນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ignition.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<root directory>\n"
"└── ignition\n"
"    └── config.ign\n"
msgstr ""
"<root directory>\n"
"└── ignition\n"
"    └── config.ign\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ignition.adoc:9
msgid ""
"If you intend to configure a QEMU/KVM virtual machine, provide the path to "
"the [path]``config.ign`` file as an attribute of the qemu command.  For "
"example:"
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການກຳນົດຄ່າເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນ QEMU/KVM, ໃຫ້ລະບຸເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ [path]``config.ign`` ເປັນແອດທຣິບິວ (attribute) ຂອງຄຳສັ່ງ qemu. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ignition.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "-fw_cfg name=opt/com.coreos/config,file=PATH_TO_config.ign\n"
msgstr "-fw_cfg name=opt/com.coreos/config,file=PATH_TO_config.ign\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ignition.adoc:11
msgid ""
"The [path]``config.ign`` file contains various data types: objects, strings, "
"integers, booleans, and lists of objects.  For the complete specification, "
"see https://coreos.github.io/ignition/configuration-v3_3/."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ [path]``config.ign`` ປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນຫຼາຍປະເພດ ເຊັ່ນ: objects, strings, integers, booleans, ແລະ lists of objects. ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດທັງໝົດ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://coreos.github.io/ignition/configuration-v3_3/."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ignition.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set Root Password Using [systemitem]``Ignition``"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງລະຫັດຜ່ານ Root ໂດຍໃຊ້ [systemitem]``Ignition``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ignition.adoc:13
msgid ""
"The {productname} VM image does not set up root or any other user account.  "
"User or [systemitem]``root`` authentications need to be set up during first "
"boot.  The [literal]``passwd`` attribute is used to add users.  If you "
"intend to log in the system, create root and set the root's password and/or "
"add the SSH key to the [systemitem]``Ignition`` configuration.  You need to "
"hash the root password, for example, by using the [command]``openssl`` "
"command:"
msgstr "{productname} VM image ບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ root ຫຼື ບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້ອື່ນໆໄວ້. ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ ຫຼື root ໃນລະຫວ່າງການບູດຄັ້ງທຳອິດ. ໂດຍໃຊ້ແອດທຣິບິວ [literal]``passwd`` ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຜູ້ໃຊ້. ທ່ານຕ້ອງເຮັດການ hash ລະຫັດຜ່ານ root ກ່ອນ, ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ ໂດຍການໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``openssl``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ignition.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "openssl passwd -6\n"
msgstr "openssl passwd -6\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ignition.adoc:15
msgid ""
"The command creates a hash of the password you chose.  Use this hash as the "
"value of the [literal]``passwordHash`` attribute."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະສ້າງ hash ຂອງລະຫັດຜ່ານທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄ່າ hash ນີ້ເປັນຄ່າຂອງແອດທຣິບິວ [literal]``passwordHash``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ignition.adoc:16
msgid ""
"The users attribute must contain at least one [literal]``name`` attribute.  "
"[literal]``ssh_authorized_keys`` is a list of ssh keys for the user."
msgstr "ແອດທຣິບິວ users ຈະຕ້ອງມີຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງແອດທຣິບິວ [literal]``name``. ສ່ວນ [literal]``ssh_authorized_keys`` ແມ່ນລາຍການຂອງ ssh keys ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ignition.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Create the [path]``root/ignition/config.ign`` file with the following "
"content:"
msgstr "ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ [path]``root/ignition/config.ign`` ທີ່ມີເນື້ອໃນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ignition.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"ignition\": {\n"
"    \"version\": \"3.2.0\"\n"
"  },\n"
"  \"passwd\": {\n"
"    \"users\": [\n"
"      {\n"
"        \"name\": \"root\",\n"
"        \"passwordHash\": "
"\"$2a$10$qV298UV11u9lCFDjpHpCUe1cErBiVR.G3shukxs3.2PAO1xhJWs0K\"\n"
"      }\n"
"    ]\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"{\n"
"  \"ignition\": {\n"
"    \"version\": \"3.2.0\"\n"
"  },\n"
"  \"passwd\": {\n"
"    \"users\": [\n"
"      {\n"
"        \"name\": \"root\",\n"
"        \"passwordHash\": \"$2a$10$qV298UV11u9lCFDjpHpCUe1cErBiVR.G3shukxs3.2PAO1xhJWs0K\"\n"
"      }\n"
"    ]\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ignition.adoc:19
msgid "Prepare the [systemitem]``Ignition`` ISO file using the command:"
msgstr "ກະກຽມໄຟລ໌ [systemitem]``Ignition`` ISO ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ignition.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "mkisofs -full-iso9660-filenames -o suma_ignition.iso -V ignition root\n"
msgstr "mkisofs -full-iso9660-filenames -o suma_ignition.iso -V ignition root\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ignition.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Attach the created [path]``suma_ignition.iso`` file as a volume to the "
"virtual machine at first boot.  This particular example is setting the "
"[systemitem]``root`` password to `linux`.  Substitute your password hash for "
"the one in this example."
msgstr "ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄຟລ໌ [path]``suma_ignition.iso`` ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນເປັນ volume ໃຫ້ກັບເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນໃນການບູດຄັ້ງທຳອິດ. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ແມ່ນການຕັ້ງລະຫັດຜ່ານ [systemitem]``root`` ເປັນ `linux`. ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນຄ່າ password hash ຂອງທ່ານແທນທີ່ຄ່າໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-ignition.adoc:22
msgid ""
"For more information about [systemitem]``Ignition``, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sle-micro/5.4/single-html/SLE-Micro-deployment/#cha-images-ignition."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ [systemitem]``Ignition``, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://documentation.suse.com/sle-micro/5.4/single-html/SLE-Micro-deployment/#cha-images-ignition."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-intro.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-intro.adoc:2
msgid "This section describes the process to install {productname} components."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ອະທິບາຍຂະບວນການຕິດຕັ້ງສ່ວນປະກອບຕ່າງໆຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-intro.adoc:3
msgid ""
"It is possible to use a public cloud instance to install {productname}.  For "
"more information on using {productname} on a public cloud, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:public-cloud-guide/overview.adoc[]."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຄລາວສາທາລະນະເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ໄດ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ {productname} ໃນຄລາວສາທາລະນະ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:specialized-guides:public-cloud-guide/overview.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-unified.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install {productname} {productnumber} Proxy"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} {productnumber} ພຣັອກຊີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-unified.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{susemgr} Proxy is a {suse} product within the {sle} product family.  This "
"section describes how to install {susemgr} Proxy from {sle} installation "
"media.  It assumes you already have obtained a registration code for your "
"{susemgr} Proxy, for example from a \"SUSE Manager Lifecycle Management+\" "
"subscription."
msgstr "{susemgr} ພຣັອກຊີ ແມ່ນຜະລິດຕະພັນ SUSE ພາຍໃຕ້ຕະກູນຜະລິດຕະພັນ {sle}. ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ອະທິບາຍ ວິທີການຕິດຕັ້ງ {susemgr} ພຣັອກຊີ ຈາກສື່ການຕິດຕັ້ງ {sle}. ມັນສົມມຸດວ່າທ່ານມີ ລະຫັດລົງທະບຽນສຳລັບ {susemgr} ພຣັອກຊີ ຂອງທ່ານແລ້ວ, ຕົວຢ່າງຈາກການສະໝັກໃຊ້ \"SUSE Manager Lifecycle Management+\"."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-unified.adoc:4
msgid ""
"If you want to install {susemgr} Proxy on a virtual machine, ensure your "
"virtual machine has enough disk space and RAM by checking the requirements "
"at xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງ {susemgr} ພຣັອກຊີ ໃນເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນ (VM), ໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າ VM ຂອງທ່ານ ມີພື້ນທີ່ດິສກ໌ ແລະ RAM ພຽງພໍ ໂດຍກວດສອບຂໍ້ກຳນົດໄດ້ທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-unified.adoc:5
msgid ""
"{productname} Proxy is the {productname} component that caches software "
"packages on an internal server.  The proxy also caches patch updates from "
"{suse} or custom RPMs generated by third-party organizations.  A proxy "
"allows you to use bandwidth more effectively because client systems connect "
"to the proxy for updates, and the {productname} server is no longer required "
"to handle all client requests.  A {susemgrproxy} can serve both Traditional "
"and Salt clients.  The proxy also supports transparent custom package "
"deployment."
msgstr "{productname} ພຣັອກຊີ ແມ່ນສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ {productname} ທີ່ເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ແຄຊ (cache) ແພັກເກດຊອບແວ ໄວ້ໃນເຊີເວີພາຍໃນ. ພຣັອກສີຍັງແຄຊການອັບເດດ patch ຈາກ {suse} ຫຼື RPM ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ ເຊິ່ງສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອົງກອນພາຍນອກ. ພຣັອກຊີຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານໃຊ້ບຣິດວິດ (bandwidth) ໄດ້ຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິພາບ ເພາະລູກຂ່າຍຈະເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາພຣັອກຊີເພື່ອອັບເດດ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ {productname} ເຊີເວີ ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງ ຈັດການຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍທັງໝົດຈາກລູກຂ່າຍ. {susemgrproxy} ສາມາດໃຫ້ບໍລິການໄດ້ທັງລູກຂ່າຍ ແບບ Traditional ແລະ Salt. ພຣັອກສີຍັງຮອງຮັບການວາງລະບົບແພັກເກດທີ່ກຳນົດເອງແບບໂປ່ງໃສ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-unified.adoc:6
msgid ""
"{productname} Proxy is an open source (GPLv2) solution that provides the "
"following features:"
msgstr "{productname} ພຣັອກຊີ ແມ່ນໂຊລູຊັນແບບໂອເພັນຊອດ (GPLv2) ທີ່ໃຫ້ຄຸນສົມບັດດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-unified.adoc:7
msgid "Cache software packages within a Squid proxy."
msgstr "ແຄຊແພັກເກດຊອບແວພາຍໃນ Squid ພຣັອກຊີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-unified.adoc:8
msgid "Client systems see the {susemgrproxy} as the {productname} server instance."
msgstr "ລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍຈະເຫັນ {susemgrproxy} ເປັນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງ {productname} ເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-unified.adoc:9
msgid ""
"The {susemgrproxy} is registered as a client system with the {productname} "
"server."
msgstr "{susemgrproxy} ຖືກລົງທະບຽນເປັນລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍກັບ {productname} ເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-unified.adoc:10
msgid ""
"The primary goal of a {susemgrproxy} is to improve {productname} performance "
"by reducing bandwidth requirements and accelerating response time."
msgstr "ເປົ້າໝາຍຫຼັກຂອງ {susemgrproxy} ແມ່ນເພື່ອປັບປຸງປະສິດທິພາບຂອງ {productname} ໂດຍການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຄວາມຕ້ອງການບຣິດວິດ ແລະ ເລັ່ງເວລາໃນການຕອບສະໜອງ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-unified.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing {susemgr} Proxy with the {unifiedinstaller}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງ {susemgr} ພຣັອກຊີ ດ້ວຍ {unifiedinstaller}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-unified.adoc:12
msgid ""
"To boot the {unifiedinstaller} from the installation image, you might need "
"to adjust the boot order in the BIOS."
msgstr "ເພື່ອບູດ {unifiedinstaller} ຈາກອິມເມຈການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງປັບລຳດັບການບູດໃນ BIOS."

#.  image::unifiedinstaller-install.png[scaledwidth=80%] (this image is with server selected.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-unified.adoc:14
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Language, Keyboard and Product Selection`` screen, check "
"the [guimenu]``SUSE Manager Proxy`` checkbox, and click btn:[Next]."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າຈໍ [guimenu]``Language, Keyboard and Product Selection``, ໃຫ້ໝາຍເລືອກ [guimenu]``SUSE Manager Proxy``, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Next]."

#.  image::unifiedinstaller-install.png[scaledwidth=80%]
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-unified.adoc:15
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-server-unified.adoc:15
msgid "Read and agree to the End User Licence Agreement, and click btn:[Next]."
msgstr "ອ່ານ ແລະ ຍອມຮັບຂໍ້ຕົກລົງໃບອະນຸຍາດສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ (EULA), ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Next]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-unified.adoc:16
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-server-unified.adoc:16
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Registration`` screen, check the [guimenu]``Register "
"System via scc.suse.com`` checkbox, enter your {scc} credentials, and click "
"btn:[Next]."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າຈໍ [guimenu]``Registration``, ໃຫ້ໝາຍເລືອກ [guimenu]``Register System via scc.suse.com``, ປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ {scc} ຂອງທ່ານ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Next]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-unified.adoc:17
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Available Extensions and Modules`` screen, select any "
"extensions or modules you require, and click btn:[Next]."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າຈໍ [guimenu]``Available Extensions and Modules``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍ ຫຼື ໂມດູນ ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Next]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-unified.adoc:18
msgid ""
"[systemitem]``Basesystem``, [systemitem]``SUSE Manager Proxy``, and "
"[systemitem]``Server Applications`` are pre-selected and mandatory for the "
"{productname} Proxy installation.  OPTIONAL: In the following [guimenu]``Add "
"On Product`` screen, select any additional or add-on products you require, "
"and click btn:[Next]."
msgstr "[systemitem]``Basesystem``, [systemitem]``SUSE Manager Proxy``, ແລະ [systemitem]``Server Applications`` ຈະຖືກເລືອກໄວ້ໃຫ້ແລ້ວ ແລະ ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ ການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ພຣັອກຊີ. ເພີ່ມເຕີມ: ໃນໜ້າຈໍ [guimenu]``Add On Product`` ຖັດໄປ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຜະລິດຕະພັນເສີມທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Next]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-unified.adoc:19
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``System Role`` screen, check the [guimenu]``SUSE Manager "
"Proxy`` checkbox, and click btn:[Next]."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າຈໍ [guimenu]``System Role``, ໃຫ້ໝາຍເລືອກ [guimenu]``SUSE Manager Proxy``, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Next]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-unified.adoc:20
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Suggested Partitioning`` screen, accept the default "
"values, or use the btn:[Guided Setup] or btn:[Expert Partitioner] options to "
"customize your partitioning model, and click btn:[Next]."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າຈໍ [guimenu]``Suggested Partitioning``, ໃຫ້ຍອມຮັບຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຫຼື ໃຊ້ btn:[Guided Setup] ຫຼື btn:[Expert Partitioner] ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງຮູບແບບພາທິຊັນຂອງທ່ານ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Next]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-unified.adoc:21
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-server-unified.adoc:22
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Clock and Time Zone`` screen, enter your region and "
"timezone, and click btn:[Next]."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າຈໍ [guimenu]``Clock and Time Zone``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນພາກພື້ນ ແລະ ເຂດເວລາຂອງທ່ານ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Next]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-unified.adoc:22
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-server-unified.adoc:23
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Local Users`` screen, create a new user, and click "
"btn:[Next]."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າຈໍ [guimenu]``Local Users``, ໃຫ້ສ້າງຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃໝ່, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Next]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-unified.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Review the settings on the [guimenu]``Installation Settings`` screen, and "
"then click btn:[Install]."
msgstr "ກວດສອບການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນໜ້າຈໍ [guimenu]``Installation Settings``, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Install]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-unified.adoc:24
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:16
msgid ""
"When the installation procedure has finished, you can check that you have "
"all the required modules.  At the command prompt, enter:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອຂັ້ນຕອນການຕິດຕັ້ງສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດກວດສອບໄດ້ວ່າທ່ານມີໂມດູນທີ່ຈຳເປັນຄົບຖ້ວນຫຼືບໍ່. ຢູ່ທີ່ command prompt, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ:"

