msgstr "ສຳລັບ {productname} ພຣັອກຊີ, ໂມດູນທີ່ຄວນຈະມີແມ່ນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-unified.adoc:27
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-server-unified.adoc:29
