#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-uyuni.adoc:17
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-uyuni.adoc:19
msgid ""
"For more information about the development version of {productname}, see "
"https://www.uyuni-project.org/pages/devel-version.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບເວີຊັນກຳລັງພັດທະນາ (development version) ຂອງ {productname}, ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://www.uyuni-project.org/pages/devel-version.html."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-uyuni.adoc:18
msgid ""
"When the installation is complete, you can continue with {productname} "
"setup.  For more information, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:uyuni-proxy-registration.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອການຕິດຕັ້ງສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດດຳເນີນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ຕໍ່ໄດ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:uyuni-proxy-registration.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Install {productname} Proxy in a Virtual Machine Environment Using "
"{productname} Proxy KVM Image"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:2
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Virtual Machine Manager Settings"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວຈັດການເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນ (Virtual Machine Manager)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This chapter provides the required Kernel Virtual Machine (KVM) settings for "
"{productname} Proxy.  KVM combined with Virtual Machine Manager "
"(_virt-manager_) will be used as a sandbox for this installation."
msgstr "ບົດນີ້ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Kernel Virtual Machine (KVM) ທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ {productname} ພຣັອກຊີ. KVM ທີ່ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ Virtual Machine Manager (_virt-manager_) ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນ sandbox ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:4
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vmdk.adoc:3
msgid ""
"You will find the VM images for {productname} {productnumber} Proxy in "
"various formats.  It includes {sles} {sles-version} {sp-base} as the "
"underlying operating system and the {productname} Proxy software current at "
"the time of build.  Download the appropriate {productname} Proxy image for "
"your environment from https://download.suse.com/."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈະພົບອິມເມຈ VM ສຳລັບ {productname} {productnumber} ພຣັອກຊີ ໃນຫຼາຍຮູບແບບ. ມັນລວມມີ {sles} {sles-version} {sp-base} ເປັນລະບົບປະຕິບັດການພື້ນຖານ ແລະ ຊອບແວ {productname} ພຣັອກຊີ ເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດໃນເວລາທີ່ສ້າງ. ດາວໂຫຼດອິມເມຈ {productname} ພຣັອກຊີ ທີ່ເໝາະສົມກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ທີ່ https://download.suse.com/."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:5
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vmdk.adoc:4
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:7
msgid ""
"This table specifies the minimum requirements.  These are suitable for a "
"quick test installation, such as a server with one client.  If you want to "
"use a production environment, review the requirements listed in "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຕາຕະລາງນີ້ລະບຸຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂັ້ນຕ່ຳ. ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເໝາະສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງເພື່ອທົດສອບແບບໄວໆ ເຊັ່ນ ເຊີເວີທີ່ມີລູກຂ່າຍເຄື່ອງດຽວ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມການໃຊ້ງານຈິງ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບຂໍ້ກຳນົດທີ່ມີລາຍຊື່ໃນ xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc[]."

