#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:9
msgid ""
"For more information on {sle} Virtualization, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sles/15-SP4/html/SLES-all/book-virtualization.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ {sle} Virtualization, ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://documentation.suse.com/sles/15-SP4/html/SLES-all/book-virtualization.html."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install {productname} Proxy Virtual Machine"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນ (VM) {productname} ພຣັອກຊີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-proxy-vm.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Create virtual machine with additional virtual disks required for the "
"{productname} Proxy storage partitions."
