#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:50
msgid ""
"Prepare {productname} storage: [path]``suma-storage`` command automatically "
"prepares and configures previously created external storage for use with "
"{productname}.  In the following command the first parameter is the device "
"for {productname} data, the second parameter is the device for the database."
msgstr "ກະກຽມໜ່ວຍຈັດເກັບ {productname}: ຄຳສັ່ງ [path]``suma-storage`` ຈະກະກຽມ ແລະ ກຳນົດຄ່າໜ່ວຍຈັດເກັບພາຍນອກທີ່ສ້າງໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ກັບ {productname} ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ໃນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້, ພາຣາມິເຕີທຳອິດແມ່ນອຸປະກອນສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ {productname}, ພາຣາມິເຕີທີສອງແມ່ນອຸປະກອນສຳລັບຖານຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/install-vm.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "suma-storage /dev/vdb /dev/vdc\n"
msgstr "suma-storage /dev/vdb /dev/vdc\n"

