#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/installation-and-upgrade-overview.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation and Upgrade Guide Overview"
msgstr "ພາບລວມຂອງຄຳແນະນຳການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ອັບເກຣດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/installation-and-upgrade-overview.adoc:2
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/upgrade-intro.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Updated:** {docdate}\n"
msgstr "**ອັບເດດເມື່ອ:** {docdate}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/installation-and-upgrade-overview.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This book provides guidance on installing and upgrading {productname} Server "
"and Proxy.  It is split into the following sections:"
msgstr "ປຶ້ມຫົວນີ້ໃຫ້ຄຳແນະນຳກ່ຽວກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ອັບເກຣດ {productname} Server ແລະ Proxy. ເຊິ່ງແບ່ງອອກເປັນພາກສ່ວນຕ່າງໆດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/installation-and-upgrade-overview.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Requirements: Describes the hardware, software, and networking requirements "
"that you require before you begin."
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການ (Requirements): ອະທິບາຍເຖິງຄວາມຕ້ອງການດ້ານຮາດແວ, ຊອບແວ ແລະ ເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີກ່ອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/installation-and-upgrade-overview.adoc:5
msgid "Installation: Describes the process to install {productname} components."
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງ (Installation): ອະທິບາຍຂັ້ນຕອນການຕິດຕັ້ງອົງປະກອບຕ່າງໆຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/installation-and-upgrade-overview.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Setting Up: Describes the initial steps you need to take after installation "
"to make your {productname} environment ready to use."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ (Setting Up): ອະທິບາຍຂັ້ນຕອນເບື້ອງຕົ້ນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງເຮັດຫຼັງຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/installation-and-upgrade-overview.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Upgrade: Describes upgrading of the {productname} components, including the "
"underlying database."
msgstr "ການອັບເກຣດ (Upgrade): ອະທິບາຍການອັບເກຣດອົງປະກອບຕ່າງໆຂອງ {productname}, ລວມທັງຖານຂໍ້ມູນພື້ນຖານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/installation-and-upgrade-overview.adoc:8
msgid ""
"It is possible to use a public cloud instance to install {productname}.  For "
"more information on using {productname} on a public cloud, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:public-cloud-guide/overview.adoc[].  For more "
"information on upgrading clients, see "
"xref:client-configuration:client-upgrades.adoc[]."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ public cloud instance ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ໄດ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ {productname} ເທິງ public cloud, ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:public-cloud-guide/overview.adoc[]. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການອັບເກຣດ clients, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:client-upgrades.adoc[]."

