#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:2
msgid "This section details the networking and port requirements for {productname}."
msgstr "ສ່ວນນີ້ຈະໃຫ້ລາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການດ້ານເຄືອຂ່າຍ ແລະ ພອດ (port) ສຳລັບ {productname}."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fully Qualified Domain Name (FQDN)"
msgstr "ຊື່ໂດເມນແບບເຕັມ (Fully Qualified Domain Name - FQDN)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The {productname} server must resolve its FQDN correctly.  If the FQDN "
"cannot be resolved, it can cause serious problems in a number of different "
"components."
msgstr "{productname} server ຈະຕ້ອງສາມາດແປ (resolve) FQDN ຂອງມັນໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. ຖ້າບໍ່ສາມາດແປ FQDN ໄດ້, ມັນອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາຮ້າຍແຮງໃນຫຼາຍອົງປະກອບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For more information about configuring the hostname and DNS, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sles/15-SP4/html/SLES-all/cha-network.html#sec-network-yast-change-host."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ hostname ແລະ DNS, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://documentation.suse.com/sles/15-SP4/html/SLES-all/cha-network.html#sec-network-yast-change-host."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hostname and IP Address"
msgstr "Hostname ແລະ ທີ່ຢູ່ IP"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:7
msgid ""
"To ensure that the {productname} domain name can be resolved by its clients, "
"both server and client machines must be connected to a working DNS server.  "
"You also need to ensure that reverse lookups are correctly configured."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ clients ສາມາດແປຊື່ໂດເມນຂອງ {productname} ໄດ້, ທັງເຄື່ອງ server ແລະ client ຈະຕ້ອງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ DNS server ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ ທ່ານຕ້ອງໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ reverse lookups ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:8
msgid ""
"For more information about setting up a DNS server, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sles/15-SP4/html/SLES-all/cha-dns.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ DNS server, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://documentation.suse.com/sles/15-SP4/html/SLES-all/cha-dns.html."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using a Proxy When Installing from {sle} Media"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ Proxy ໃນເວລາຕິດຕັ້ງຈາກສື່ {sle}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:10
msgid ""
"If you are on an internal network and do not have access to {scc}, you can "
"set up and use a proxy during installation."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຢູ່ໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍພາຍໃນ ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ {scc} ໄດ້, ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ໃຊ້ proxy ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:11
msgid ""
"For more information about configuring a proxy for access to {scc} during a "
"{sle} installation, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sles/15-SP4/html/SLES-all/cha-boot-parameters.html#sec-boot-parameters-advanced-proxy."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ proxy ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງ {scc} ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ {sle}, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://documentation.suse.com/sles/15-SP4/html/SLES-all/cha-boot-parameters.html#sec-boot-parameters-advanced-proxy."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:12
msgid ""
"The hostname of {productname} must not contain uppercase letters as this may "
"cause _jabberd_ to fail.  Choose the hostname of your {productname} server "
"carefully.  Although changing the server name is possible and supported, it "
"is important to plan for this change before going ahead with it.  When you "
"change the hostname of the server, all clients attached to the server must "
"be made aware of the change."
msgstr "Hostname ຂອງ {productname} ຕ້ອງບໍ່ມີຕົວອັກສອນໃຫຍ່ ເພາະອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ _jabberd_ ເຮັດວຽກຜິດພາດ. ກະລຸນາເລືອກ hostname ຂອງ {productname} server ຢ່າງລະມັດລະວັງ. ເຖິງວ່າການປ່ຽນຊື່ server ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ ແລະ ມີການຮອງຮັບ, ແຕ່ສິ່ງສຳຄັນແມ່ນຕ້ອງມີການວາງແຜນກ່ອນການປ່ຽນແປງ. ເມື່ອທ່ານປ່ຽນ hostname ຂອງ server, clients ທັງໝົດທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ server ຈະຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການແຈ້ງໃຫ້ຊາບກ່ຽວກັບການປ່ຽນແປງນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In a production environment, the {productname} Server and clients should "
"always use a firewall.  For a comprehensive list of the required ports, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:ports.adoc[]."
msgstr "ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມການໃຊ້ງານຈິງ, {productname} Server ແລະ clients ຄວນໃຊ້ໄຟວໍ (firewall) ສະເໝີ. ສຳລັບລາຍການພອດທີ່ຈຳເປັນທັງໝົດ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:ports.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:14
msgid ""
"For more information on disconnected setup and port configuration, see "
"xref:administration:disconnected-setup.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (disconnected setup) ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າພອດ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:disconnected-setup.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deployment behind HTTP or HTTPS OSI level 7 proxy"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງພາຍໃຕ້ HTTP ຫຼື HTTPS OSI level 7 proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Some environment enforce internet access through a HTTP or HTTPS proxy.  "
"This could be a Squid server or similar.  To allow the {productname} Server "
"internet access in such configuration, you need to configure the following."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring HTTP or HTTPS OSI level 7 proxy"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ HTTP ຫຼື HTTPS OSI level 7 proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:18
msgid ""
"For operating system internet access, modify [path]``/etc/sysconfig/proxy`` "
"according to your needs:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງອິນເຕີເນັດຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ, ໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂ [path]``/etc/sysconfig/proxy`` ຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"PROXY_ENABLED=\"no\"\n"
"HTTP_PROXY=\"\"\n"
"HTTPS_PROXY=\"\"\n"
"NO_PROXY=\"localhost, 127.0.0.1\"\n"
msgstr ""
"PROXY_ENABLED=\"no\"\n"
"HTTP_PROXY=\"\"\n"
"HTTPS_PROXY=\"\"\n"
"NO_PROXY=\"localhost, 127.0.0.1\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:20
msgid ""
"For Java application internet access, modify [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` "
"according to your needs.  For example, set:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Use proxy FQDN, or FQDN:port\n"
"server.satellite.http_proxy =\n"
"server.satellite.http_proxy_username =\n"
"server.satellite.http_proxy_password =\n"
"# no_proxy is a comma seperated list\n"
"server.satellite.no_proxy =\n"
msgstr ""
"# ໃຊ້ proxy FQDN, ຫຼື FQDN:port\n"
"server.satellite.http_proxy =\n"
"server.satellite.http_proxy_username =\n"
"server.satellite.http_proxy_password =\n"
"# no_proxy ແມ່ນລາຍຊື່ທີ່ຂັ້ນດ້ວຍຈຸດ\n"
"server.satellite.no_proxy =\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:22
msgid "Restart spacewalk services to enforce the new configuration:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacewalk-services restart\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Required Network Ports"
msgstr "ພອດເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ຈຳເປັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section contains a comprehensive list of ports that are used for "
"various communications within {productname}."
msgstr "ສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍລາຍການພອດທັງໝົດທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສື່ສານຕ່າງໆພາຍໃນ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:3
msgid ""
"You will not need to open all of these ports.  Some ports only need to be "
"opened if you are using the service that requires them."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເປີດພອດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ທັງໝົດ. ບາງພອດຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເປີດສະເພາະເມື່ອທ່ານໃຊ້ບໍລິການທີ່ຕ້ອງການພອດນັ້ນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#.  This image shows the main ports used in {productname}:
#.  image::ports_diagram.png[]
#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "External Inbound Server Ports"
msgstr "ພອດຂາເຂົ້າພາຍນອກຂອງ Server"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:5
msgid ""
"External inbound ports must be opened to configure a firewall on the "
"{productname} Server to protect the server from unauthorized access."
msgstr "ພອດຂາເຂົ້າພາຍນອກຈະຕ້ອງຖືກເປີດເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າໄຟວໍເທິງ {productname} Server ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນ server ຈາກການເຂົ້າເຖິງທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Opening these ports allows external network traffic to access the "
"{productname} Server."
msgstr "ການເປີດພອດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການຈະລາຈອນທາງເຄືອຂ່າຍພາຍນອກສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ {productname} Server ໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:7
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "External Port Requirements for {productname} Server"
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການພອດພາຍນອກສຳລັບ {productname} Server"

#. type: Table
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Port number | Protocol | Used By | Notes\n"
"| 22          |          |         | Required for ssh-push and "
"ssh-push-tunnel contact methods.\n"
"| 67          | TCP/UDP  | DHCP    | Required only if clients are requesting "
"IP addresses from the server.\n"
"| 69          | TCP/UDP  | TFTP    | Required if server is used as a PXE "
"server for automated client installation.\n"
"| 80          | TCP      | HTTP    | Required temporarily for some bootstrap "
"repositories and automated installations.\n"
"Port 80 is not used to serve the {webui}.\n"
"| 443         | TCP      | HTTPS   | {webui}, client, and server and proxy "
"(``tftpsync``) requests.\n"
"| 4505        | TCP      | salt    | Required to accept communication "
"requests from clients.\n"
"The client initiates the connection, and it stays open to receive commands "
"from the Salt master.\n"
"| 4506        | TCP      | salt    | Required to accept communication "
"requests from clients.\n"
"The client initiates the connection, and it stays open to report results "
"back to the Salt master.\n"
"| 5222        | TCP      | osad    | Required to push OSAD actions to "
"clients.\n"
"| 5269        | TCP      | jabberd | Required to push actions to and from a "
"proxy.\n"
"| 25151       | TCP      | Cobbler |\n"
msgstr ""
"| ເລກພອດ | ໂປຣໂຕຄໍ | ໃຊ້ໂດຍ | ໝາຍເຫດ\n"
"| 22          |          |         | ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ແບບ ssh-push ແລະ ssh-push-tunnel.\n"
"| 67          | TCP/UDP  | DHCP    | ຈຳເປັນສະເພາະເມື່ອ clients ຮ້ອງຂໍທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຈາກ server.\n"
"| 69          | TCP/UDP  | TFTP    | ຈຳເປັນຖ້າ server ຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນ PXE server ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ client ແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"
"| 80          | TCP      | HTTP    | ຈຳເປັນຊົ່ວຄາວສຳລັບບາງ bootstrap repositories ແລະ ການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"
"ພອດ 80 ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ບໍລິການ {webui}.\n"
"| 443         | TCP      | HTTPS   | ສຳລັບການຮ້ອງຂໍຈາກ {webui}, client, server ແລະ proxy (``tftpsync``).\n"
"| 4505        | TCP      | salt    | ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອຮັບການຮ້ອງຂໍການສື່ສານຈາກ clients.\n"
"client ຈະເປັນຜູ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ແລະ ມັນຈະເປີດຄ້າງໄວ້ເພື່ອຮັບຄຳສັ່ງຈາກ Salt master.\n"
"| 4506        | TCP      | salt    | ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອຮັບການຮ້ອງຂໍການສື່ສານຈາກ clients.\n"
"client ຈະເປັນຜູ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ແລະ ມັນຈະເປີດຄ້າງໄວ້ເພື່ອລາຍງານຜົນການເຮັດວຽກກັບໄປຍັງ Salt master.\n"
"| 5222        | TCP      | osad    | ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອພຸຊ (push) OSAD actions ໄປຍັງ clients.\n"
"| 5269        | TCP      | jabberd | ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອພຸຊ actions ໄປ ແລະ ກັບ ຈາກ proxy.\n"
"| 25151       | TCP      | Cobbler |\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "External Outbound Server Ports"
msgstr "ພອດຂາອອກພາຍນອກຂອງ Server"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:10
msgid ""
"External outbound ports must be opened to configure a firewall on the "
"{productname} Server to restrict what the server can access."
msgstr "ພອດຂາອອກພາຍນອກຈະຕ້ອງຖືກເປີດເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າໄຟວໍເທິງ {productname} Server ເພື່ອກຳນົດຂອບເຂດສິ່ງທີ່ server ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Opening these ports allows network traffic from the {productname} Server to "
"communicate with external services."
msgstr "ການເປີດພອດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການຈະລາຈອນທາງເຄືອຂ່າຍຈາກ {productname} Server ສາມາດສື່ສານກັບບໍລິການພາຍນອກໄດ້."

#. type: Table
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Port number | Protocol | Used By | Notes\n"
"| 80          | TCP | HTTP       | Required for {scc}.\n"
"Port 80 is not used to serve the {webui}.\n"
"| 443         | TCP | HTTPS      | Required for {scc}.\n"
"| 5269        | TCP | jabberd    | Required to push actions to and from a "
"proxy.\n"
msgstr ""
"| ເລກພອດ | ໂປຣໂຕຄໍ | ໃຊ້ໂດຍ | ໝາຍເຫດ\n"
"| 80          | TCP | HTTP       | ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ {scc}.\n"
"ພອດ 80 ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ບໍລິການ {webui}.\n"
"| 443         | TCP | HTTPS      | ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ {scc}.\n"
"| 5269        | TCP | jabberd    | ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອພຸຊ actions ໄປ ແລະ ກັບ ຈາກ proxy.\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Internal Server Ports"
msgstr "ພອດພາຍໃນຂອງ Server"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Internal ports are used internally by the {productname} Server.  Internal "
"ports are only accessible from [literal]``localhost``."
msgstr "ພອດພາຍໃນແມ່ນໃຊ້ສຳລັບການເຮັດວຽກພາຍໃນຂອງ {productname} Server. ພອດພາຍໃນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ສະເພາະຈາກ [literal]``localhost`` ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:16
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:34
msgid "In most cases, you will not need to adjust these ports."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ທ່ານບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປັບແຕ່ງພອດເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Internal Port Requirements for {productname} Server"
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການພອດພາຍໃນສຳລັບ {productname} Server"

#. type: Table
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Port number | Notes\n"
"| 2828        | Satellite-search API, used by the RHN application in Tomcat "
"and Taskomatic.\n"
"| 2829        | Taskomatic API, used by the RHN application in Tomcat.\n"
"| 8005        | Tomcat shutdown port.\n"
"| 8009        | Tomcat to Apache HTTPD (AJP).\n"
"| 8080        | Tomcat to Apache HTTPD (HTTP).\n"
"| 9080        | Salt-API, used by the RHN application in Tomcat and "
"Taskomatic.\n"
"| 25151       | Cobbler's XMLRPC API\n"
"| 32000       | Port for a TCP connection to the Java Virtual Machine (JVM) "
"that runs Taskomatic and satellite-search.\n"
msgstr ""
"| ເລກພອດ | ໝາຍເຫດ\n"
"| 2828        | Satellite-search API, ໃຊ້ໂດຍແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ RHN ໃນ Tomcat ແລະ Taskomatic.\n"
"| 2829        | Taskomatic API, ໃຊ້ໂດຍແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ RHN ໃນ Tomcat.\n"
"| 8005        | ພອດສຳລັບປິດ Tomcat (Tomcat shutdown port).\n"
"| 8009        | Tomcat ໄປ Apache HTTPD (AJP).\n"
"| 8080        | Tomcat ໄປ Apache HTTPD (HTTP).\n"
"| 9080        | Salt-API, ໃຊ້ໂດຍແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ RHN ໃນ Tomcat ແລະ Taskomatic.\n"
"| 25151       | Cobbler's XMLRPC API\n"
"| 32000       | ພອດສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ TCP ໄປຍັງ Java Virtual Machine (JVM) ທີ່ໃຊ້ Taskomatic ແລະ satellite-search.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Port 32768 and higher are used as ephemeral ports.  These are most often "
"used to receive TCP connections.  When a TCP connection request is received, "
"the sender will choose one of these ephemeral port numbers to match the "
"destination port."
msgstr "ພອດ 32768 ແລະ ສູງກວ່າ ແມ່ນຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນ ephemeral ports. ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແມ່ນໃຊ້ເພື່ອຮັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ TCP. ເມື່ອມີການຮ້ອງຂໍການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ TCP, ຜູ້ສົ່ງຈະເລືອກໜຶ່ງໃນເລກ ephemeral port ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃຫ້ກົງກັບພອດປາຍທາງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:20
msgid "You can use this command to find out which ports are ephemeral ports:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອເບິ່ງວ່າພອດໃດແດ່ທີ່ເປັນ ephemeral ports:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "cat /proc/sys/net/ipv4/ip_local_port_range\n"
msgstr "cat /proc/sys/net/ipv4/ip_local_port_range\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "External Inbound Proxy Ports"
msgstr "ພອດຂາເຂົ້າພາຍນອກຂອງ Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:23
msgid ""
"External inbound ports must be opened to configure a firewall on the "
"{productname} Proxy to protect the proxy from unauthorized access."
msgstr "ພອດຂາເຂົ້າພາຍນອກຈະຕ້ອງຖືກເປີດເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າໄຟວໍເທິງ {productname} Proxy ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນ proxy ຈາກການເຂົ້າເຖິງທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Opening these ports allows external network traffic to access the "
"{productname} proxy."
msgstr "ການເປີດພອດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການຈະລາຈອນທາງເຄືອຂ່າຍພາຍນອກສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ {productname} proxy ໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:25
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "External Port Requirements for {productname} Proxy"
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການພອດພາຍນອກສຳລັບ {productname} Proxy"

#. type: Table
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Port number | Protocol | Used By | Notes\n"
"| 22          |          |         | Required for ssh-push and "
"ssh-push-tunnel contact methods.\n"
"Clients connected to the proxy initiate check in on the server and hop "
"through to clients.\n"
"| 67          | TCP/UDP  | DHCP    | Required only if clients are requesting "
"IP addresses from the server.\n"
"| 69          | TCP/UDP  | TFTP    | Required if the server is used as a PXE "
"server for automated client installation.\n"
"| 443         | TCP      | HTTPS   | {webui}, client, and server and proxy "
"(``tftpsync``) requests.\n"
"| 4505        | TCP      | salt    | Required to accept communication "
"requests from clients.\n"
"The client initiates the connection, and it stays open to receive commands "
"from the Salt master.\n"
"| 4506        | TCP      | salt    | Required to accept communication "
"requests from clients.\n"
"The client initiates the connection, and it stays open to report results "
"back to the Salt master.\n"
"| 5222        | TCP      |         | Required to push OSAD actions to "
"clients.\n"
"| 5269        | TCP      |         | Required to push actions to and from "
"the server.\n"
msgstr ""
"| ເລກພອດ | ໂປຣໂຕຄໍ | ໃຊ້ໂດຍ | ໝາຍເຫດ\n"
"| 22          |          |         | ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ແບບ ssh-push ແລະ ssh-push-tunnel.\n"
"clients ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ proxy ຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການ check in ທີ່ server ແລະ ສົ່ງຕໍ່ໄປຍັງ clients.\n"
"| 67          | TCP/UDP  | DHCP    | ຈຳເປັນສະເພາະເມື່ອ clients ຮ້ອງຂໍທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຈາກ server.\n"
"| 69          | TCP/UDP  | TFTP    | ຈຳເປັນຖ້າ server ຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນ PXE server ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ client ແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"
"| 443         | TCP      | HTTPS   | ສຳລັບການຮ້ອງຂໍຈາກ {webui}, client, server ແລະ proxy (``tftpsync``).\n"
"| 4505        | TCP      | salt    | ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອຮັບການຮ້ອງຂໍການສື່ສານຈາກ clients.\n"
"client ຈະເປັນຜູ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ແລະ ມັນຈະເປີດຄ້າງໄວ້ເພື່ອຮັບຄຳສັ່ງຈາກ Salt master.\n"
"| 4506        | TCP      | salt    | ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອຮັບການຮ້ອງຂໍການສື່ສານຈາກ clients.\n"
"client ຈະເປັນຜູ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ແລະ ມັນຈະເປີດຄ້າງໄວ້ເພື່ອລາຍງານຜົນການເຮັດວຽກກັບໄປຍັງ Salt master.\n"
"| 5222        | TCP      |         | ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອພຸຊ OSAD actions ໄປຍັງ clients.\n"
"| 5269        | TCP      |         | ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອພຸຊ actions ໄປ ແລະ ກັບ ຈາກ server.\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "External Outbound Proxy Ports"
msgstr "ພອດຂາອອກພາຍນອກຂອງ Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:28
msgid ""
"External outbound ports must be opened to configure a firewall on the "
"{productname} Proxy to restrict what the proxy can access."
msgstr "ພອດຂາອອກພາຍນອກຈະຕ້ອງຖືກເປີດເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າໄຟວໍເທິງ {productname} Proxy ເພື່ອກຳນົດຂອບເຂດສິ່ງທີ່ proxy ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Opening these ports allows network traffic from the {productname} Proxy to "
"communicate with external services."
msgstr "ການເປີດພອດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການຈະລາຈອນທາງເຄືອຂ່າຍຈາກ {productname} Proxy ສາມາດສື່ສານກັບບໍລິການພາຍນອກໄດ້."

#. type: Table
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Port number | Protocol | Used By | Notes\n"
"| 80          |          |         | Used to reach the server.\n"
"| 443         | TCP      | HTTPS   | Required for {scc}.\n"
"| 4505        | TCP      | salt    | Required to connect to Salt master "
"either directly or via proxy.\n"
"| 4506        | TCP      | salt    | Required to connect to Salt master "
"either directly or via proxy.\n"
"| 5269        | TCP      |         | Required to push actions to and from "
"the server.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "External Client Ports"
msgstr "ພອດພາຍນອກຂອງ Client"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:33
msgid ""
"External client ports must be opened to configure a firewall between the "
"{productname} Server and its clients."
msgstr "ພອດພາຍນອກຂອງ client ຈະຕ້ອງຖືກເປີດເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າໄຟວໍລະຫວ່າງ {productname} Server ແລະ clients ຂອງມັນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "External Port Requirements for {productname} Clients"
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການພອດພາຍນອກສຳລັບ {productname} Clients"

#. type: Table
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Port number | Direction | Protocol | Notes\n"
"| 22          | Inbound   | SSH      | Required for ssh-push and "
"ssh-push-tunnel contact methods.\n"
"| 80          | Outbound  |          | Used to reach the server or proxy.\n"
"| 443         | Outbound  |          | Used to reach the server or proxy.\n"
"| 4505        | Outbound  | TCP      | Required to connect to Salt master "
"either directly or via proxy.\n"
"| 4506        | Outbound  | TCP      | Required to connect to Salt master "
"either directly or via proxy.\n"
"| 5222        | Outbound  | TCP      | Required to push OSAD actions to the "
"server or proxy.\n"
"| 9090        | Outbound  | TCP      | Required for Prometheus user "
"interface.\n"
"| 9093        | Outbound  | TCP      | Required for Prometheus alert "
"manager.\n"
"| 9100        | Outbound  | TCP      | Required for Prometheus node "
"exporter.\n"
"| 9117        | Outbound  | TCP      | Required for Prometheus Apache "
"exporter.\n"
"| 9187        | Outbound  | TCP      | Required for Prometheus PostgreSQL.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Required URLs"
msgstr "URLs ທີ່ຈຳເປັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:38
msgid ""
"There are some URLs that {productname} must be able to access to register "
"clients and perform updates.  In most cases, allowing access to these URLs "
"is sufficient:"
msgstr "ມີບາງ URLs ທີ່ {productname} ຕ້ອງສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນ clients ແລະ ດຳເນີນການອັບເດດ. ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ການອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງ URLs ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນພຽງພໍແລ້ວ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:39
msgid "[literal]``scc.suse.com``"
msgstr "[literal]``scc.suse.com``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:40
msgid "[literal]``updates.suse.com``"
msgstr "[literal]``updates.suse.com``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:41
msgid "[literal]``installer-updates.suse.com``"
msgstr "[literal]``installer-updates.suse.com``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:42
msgid ""
"If you are using non-{suse} clients you might also need to allow access to "
"other servers that provide specific packages for those operating systems.  "
"For example, if you have {ubuntu} clients, you will need to be able to "
"access the {ubuntu} server."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ clients ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ {suse}, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງ server ອື່ນໆທີ່ໃຫ້ບໍລິການແພັກເກັດສະເພາະສຳລັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ. ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ ຖ້າທ່ານມີ {ubuntu} clients, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ {ubuntu} server ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/ports.adoc:43
msgid ""
"For more information about troubleshooting firewall access for non-{suse} "
"clients, see xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການເຂົ້າເຖິງໄຟວໍສຳລັບ clients ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ {suse}, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/postgresql-requirements.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{postgresql} Requirements"
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການສຳລັບ {postgresql}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/postgresql-requirements.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{postgresql} is the only supported database.  Using a remote {postgresql} "
"database or remote file systems (such as NFS) with the {postgresql} database "
"is not supported.  In other words, {postgresql} should be on the fastest "
"available storage device for {productname}."
msgstr "{postgresql} ແມ່ນຖານຂໍ້ມູນດຽວທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບ. ການໃຊ້ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ {postgresql} ແບບຣີໂມດ (remote) ຫຼື ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ແບບຣີໂມດ (ເຊັ່ນ NFS) ຮ່ວມກັບຖານຂໍ້ມູນ {postgresql} ແມ່ນບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບ. ເວົ້າອີກຢ່າງໜຶ່ງຄື, {postgresql} ຄວນຢູ່ໃນອຸປະກອນຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ໄວທີ່ສຸດທີ່ມີຢູ່ສຳລັບ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/postgresql-requirements.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Additional background information:**\n"
msgstr "**ຂໍ້ມູນພື້ນຖານເພີ່ມເຕີມ:**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/postgresql-requirements.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Because of potential performance issues, running a {postgresql} database "
"remotely from {productname} is discouraged in general.  While it does work "
"and is stable in many cases, there is always a risk of data loss if "
"something goes wrong."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກບັນຫາດ້ານປະສິດທິພາບທີ່ອາດຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນ, ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ {postgresql} ແບບຣີໂມດຈາກ {productname}. ເຖິງວ່າມັນຈະສາມາດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ ແລະ ມີຄວາມສະຖຽນໃນຫຼາຍກໍລະນີ, ແຕ່ກໍມີຄວາມສ່ຽງທີ່ຈະສູນເສຍຂໍ້ມູນສະເໝີຖ້າມີຂໍ້ຜິດພາດເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/postgresql-requirements.adoc:5
msgid "{suse} might not be able to provide assistance in such cases."
msgstr "{suse} ອາດຈະບໍ່ສາມາດໃຫ້ຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອໄດ້ໃນກໍລະນີດັ່ງກ່າວ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Containerized {productname} Proxy"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} Proxy ໃນຮູບແບບ Container"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "ບົດນຳ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{productname} Proxy containers are supported only on {sles} 15 SP3 and newer "
"versions."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To be used as a base for {productname} Proxy, the container first needs to "
"be registered as a {salt} client to the {productname} Server.  "
"[literal]``Containers Module`` is also required to be available for the "
"container host."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Connecting the container host as a traditional client will not work because "
"required packages are not available."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:6
msgid ""
"For more information about registering {salt} client to the {productname} "
"Server, see xref:client-configuration:registration-overview.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Container Host Requirements"
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງ Container Host"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:8
msgid ""
"To ensure that the domain name of the {productname} Server can be resolved "
"by the clients:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ clients ສາມາດແປຊື່ໂດເມນຂອງ {productname} Server ໄດ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:9
msgid "Both container proxy and client machines must be connected to a DNS server"
msgstr "ທັງເຄື່ອງ container proxy ແລະ ເຄື່ອງ client ຈະຕ້ອງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ DNS server"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-container-installation.adoc:10
msgid "Reverse lookup must work"
msgstr "Reverse lookup ຈະຕ້ອງສາມາດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້"

