#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:36
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Use this if your proxy can be accessed through various DNS CNAME aliases.  "
"Otherwise it can be left empty."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຫາກ proxy ຂອງທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຜ່ານ DNS CNAME aliases ຕ່າງໆ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ສາມາດປ່ອຍຫວ່າງໄວ້ໄດ້."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:37
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:39
