msgstr "ລະຫັດຜ່ານ CA"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:38
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:40
msgid ""
"Enter the password that was used for the certificate of your {productname} "
"Server."
msgstr "ປ້ອນລະຫັດຜ່ານທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ certificate ຂອງ {productname} Server ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:39
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "Do You Want to Use an Existing SSH Key for Proxying SSH-Push Salt Minion?"
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ SSH Key ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວສຳລັບການເຮັດ Proxying SSH-Push Salt Minion ບໍ່?"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:40
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:42
msgid ""
"Use this option if you want to reuse a SSH key that was used for SSH-Push "
"Salt clients on the server."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ SSH key ອັນເກົ່າທີ່ເຄີຍໃຊ້ສຳລັບ SSH-Push Salt clients ເທິງ server."

#. type: Labeled list
