msgstr "ສ້າງ ແລະ ເພີ່ມຂໍ້ມູນໃນ Configuration Channel rhn_proxy_config_1000010001 ຫຼື ບໍ່?"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:42
