msgstr "ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ (Username) ຂອງ SUSE Manager"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/proxy-setup.adoc:44
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:46
msgid "Use same user name and password as on the {productname} server."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານອັນດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນ {productname} server."

