#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Public Cloud Requirements"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດສຳລັບຄລາວສາທາລະນະ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section provides the requirements for installing {productname} on "
"public cloud infrastructure.  We have tested these instructions on Amazon "
"EC2, Google Compute Engine, and Microsoft Azure, but they should work on "
"other providers as well, with some variation."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບຂໍ້ກຳນົດສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ໃນໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານຄລາວສາທາລະນະ. ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ທົດສອບຄຳແນະນຳເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃນ Amazon EC2, Google Compute Engine, ແລະ Microsoft Azure, ແຕ່ພວກມັນກໍຄວນຈະໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ກັບຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການອື່ນໆຄືກັນ ໂດຍອາດມີຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງບາງຢ່າງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:3
msgid "Before you begin, here are some considerations:"
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ນີ້ແມ່ນບາງສິ່ງທີ່ຄວນພິຈາລະນາ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The {productname} setup procedure performs a forward-confirmed reverse DNS "
"lookup.  This must succeed in order for the setup procedure to complete and "
"for {productname} to operate as expected.  It is important to perform "
"hostname and IP configuration before you set up {productname}."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ຈະມີການກວດສອບ forward-confirmed reverse DNS lookup. ສິ່ງນີ້ຕ້ອງສຳເລັດເພື່ອໃຫ້ຂັ້ນຕອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳເລັດສົມບູນ ແລະ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ {productname} ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຕາມທີ່ຄາດໄວ້. ມັນເປັນສິ່ງສຳຄັນທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າ hostname ແລະ IP ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:5
msgid ""
"{productname} Server and Proxy instances need to run in a network "
"configuration that provides you control over DNS entries, but cannot be "
"accessed from the internet at large."
msgstr "ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງ {productname} Server ແລະ Proxy ຕ້ອງເຮັດວຽກໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດຄວບຄຸມຂໍ້ມູນ DNS ໄດ້, ແຕ່ບໍ່ຄວນໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຈາກອິນເຕີເນັດທົ່ວໄປ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Within this network configuration DNS resolution must be provided: `hostname "
"-f` must return the fully qualified domain name (FQDN)."
msgstr "ພາຍໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍນີ້ ຕ້ອງມີການກຳນົດການແປຊື່ DNS: `hostname -f` ຕ້ອງສົ່ງຄ່າຄືນເປັນຊື່ໂດເມນທີ່ສົມບູນ (FQDN)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:7
msgid "DNS resolution is also important for connecting clients."
msgstr "ການແປຊື່ DNS ກໍມີຄວາມສຳຄັນສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄຄແອນ (client) ຄືກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:8
msgid ""
"DNS is dependent on the cloud framework you choose.  Refer to the cloud "
"provider documentation for detailed instructions."
msgstr "DNS ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບຄລາວເຟຣມເວີກ (cloud framework) ທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກ. ໃຫ້ອ້າງອີງຈາກເອກະສານຂອງຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຄລາວສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳທີ່ລະອຽດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:9
msgid ""
"We recommend that you locate software repositories, the server database, and "
"the proxy squid cache on an external virtual disk.  This prevents data loss "
"if the instance is unexpectedly terminated.  This section includes "
"instructions for setting up an external virtual disk."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານເກັບຄັງຊອບແວ (repositories), ຖານຂໍ້ມູນເຊີເວີ, ແລະ proxy squid cache ໄວ້ໃນດິສກ໌ສະເໝືອນ (virtual disk) ພາຍນອກ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍປ້ອງກັນຂໍ້ມູນສູນຫາຍຫາກອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຖືກປິດການເຮັດວຽກໂດຍບໍ່ຄາດຄິດ. ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ລວມມີຄຳແນະນຳສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າດິສກ໌ສະເໝືອນພາຍນອກ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:10
msgid ""
"If you are attempting to bootstrap traditional clients, check that you can "
"resolve the host name of the server while you are logged in to the client.  "
"You might need to add the FQDN of the server to [path]``/etc/hosts`` local "
"resolution file on the client.  Check using the [command]``hostname -f`` "
"command with the local IP address of the server."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານກຳລັງພະຍາຍາມ bootstrap ໄຄແອນແບບດັ້ງເດີມ (traditional clients), ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າທ່ານສາມາດແປຊື່ host name ຂອງເຊີເວີໄດ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບໄຄແອນ. ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງເພີ່ມ FQDN ຂອງເຊີເວີເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ [path]``/etc/hosts`` ຢູ່ທີ່ໄຄແອນ. ກວດສອບໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``hostname -f`` ພ້ອມກັບເລກ IP ພາຍໃນຂອງເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Network requirements"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດດ້ານເຄືອຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:12
msgid ""
"When you use {productname} on a public cloud, you must use a restricted "
"network.  We recommend using a VPC private subnet with an appropriate "
"firewall setting.  Only machines in your specified IP ranges must be able to "
"access the instance."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານໃຊ້ {productname} ເທິງຄລາວສາທາລະນະ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງໃຊ້ເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ຖືກຈຳກັດ. ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ VPC private subnet ພ້ອມກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ firewall ທີ່ເໝາະສົມ. ຄວນມີພຽງແຕ່ເຄື່ອງທີ່ຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງ IP ທີ່ທ່ານກຳນົດເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Running {productname} on the public cloud means implementing robust security "
"measures. It is essential to limit, filter, monitor, and audit access to the "
"instance.  {SUSE} strongly advises against a globally accessible "
"{productname} instance that lacks adequate perimeter security."
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ງານ {productname} ເທິງຄລາວສາທາລະນະໝາຍເຖິງການນຳໃຊ້ມາດຕະການຄວາມປອດໄພທີ່ເຂັ້ມງວດ. ມັນຈຳເປັນຫຼາຍທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງຈຳກັດ, ກັ່ນຕອງ, ຕິດຕາມ, ແລະ ກວດສອບການເຂົ້າເຖິງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌. {SUSE} ແນະນຳຢ່າງເດັດຂາດວ່າບໍ່ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຈາກທົ່ວໂລກໂດຍທີ່ບໍ່ມີລະບົບຄວາມປອດໄພຮອບນອກທີ່ພຽງພໍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:14
msgid ""
"To access the {productname} {webui}, allow HTTPS when configuring the "
"network access controls.  This allows you to access the {productname} "
"{webui}."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ອະນຸຍາດ HTTPS ເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າການຄວບຄຸມການເຂົ້າເຖິງເຄືອຂ່າຍ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ {productname} {webui} ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:15
msgid ""
"In EC2 and Azure, create a new security group, and add inbound and outbound "
"rules for HTTPS.  In GCE, check the ``Allow HTTPS traffic`` box under the "
"``Firewall`` section."
msgstr "ໃນ EC2 ແລະ Azure, ໃຫ້ສ້າງ security group ໃໝ່, ແລະ ເພີ່ມກົດ inbound ແລະ outbound ສຳລັບ HTTPS. ໃນ GCE, ໃຫ້ໝາຍຕິກໃສ່ຊ່ອງ ``Allow HTTPS traffic`` ພາຍໃຕ້ພາກສ່ວນ ``Firewall``."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare storage volumes"
msgstr "ກຽມວໍລຸມເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:17
msgid ""
"We recommend that the repositories and the database for {productname} are "
"stored on separate storage devices to the root volume.  This will help to "
"avoid data loss.  Do not use logical volume management (LVM) for public "
"cloud installations."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ເກັບຄັງຊອບແວ ແລະ ຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ {productname} ໄວ້ໃນອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກຈາກ root volume. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼີກເວັ້ນການສູນຫາຍຂອງຂໍ້ມູນ. ຫ້າມໃຊ້ logical volume management (LVM) ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງເທິງຄລາວສາທາລະນະ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:19
msgid ""
"The size of the disk for repositories storage is dependent on the number of "
"distributions and channels you intend to manage with {productname}.  When "
"you attach the virtual disks, they will appear in your instance as Unix "
"device nodes.  The names of the device nodes will vary depending on your "
"provider, and the instance type selected."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງດິສກ໌ສຳລັບເກັບຄັງຊອບແວແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບຈຳນວນ distro ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງ (channels) ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຈັດການດ້ວຍ {productname}. ເມື່ອທ່ານເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ດິສກ໌ສະເໝືອນ, ພວກມັນຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນໃນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງທ່ານເປັນ Unix device nodes. ຊື່ຂອງ device nodes ຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ ແລະ ປະເພດຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທີ່ເລືອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Ensure the root volume of the {productname} Server is 100{nbsp}GB or "
"larger.  Add an additional storage disk of 500{nbsp}GB or more, and choose "
"SSD storage if you can.  The cloud images for {productname} Server use a "
"script to assign this separate volume when your instance is launched."
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ root volume ຂອງ {productname} Server ມີຂະໜາດ 100{nbsp}GB ຫຼື ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ. ເພີ່ມດິສກ໌ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ 500{nbsp}GB ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່າ, ແລະ ເລືອກ SSD ຫາກເປັນໄປໄດ້. Cloud images ສຳລັບ {productname} Server ຈະໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບເພື່ອມອບໝາຍວໍລຸມທີ່ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກນີ້ເມື່ອອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:21
msgid ""
"When you launch your instance, you can log in to the {productname} Server "
"and use this command to find all available storage devices:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານເປີດໃຊ້ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌, ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ {productname} Server ແລະ ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອຫາອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດທີ່ມີ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:23
msgid ""
"If you are not sure which device to choose, use the [command]``lsblk`` "
"command to see the name and size of each device.  Choose the name that "
"matches with the size of the virtual disk you are looking for."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຈະເລືອກອຸປະກອນໃດ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``lsblk`` ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຊື່ ແລະ ຂະໜາດຂອງແຕ່ລະອຸປະກອນ. ເລືອກຊື່ທີ່ກົງກັບຂະໜາດຂອງດິສກ໌ສະເໝືອນທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງຊອກຫາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:24
msgid ""
"You can set up the external disk with the [command]``suma-storage`` "
"command.  This creates an XFS partition mounted at ``/manager_storage`` and "
"uses it as the location for the database and repositories:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າດິສກ໌ພາຍນອກດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``suma-storage``. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະສ້າງພາທິຊັນ XFS ທີ່ເມົາທ໌ (mounted) ຢູ່ ``/manager_storage`` ແລະ ໃຊ້ເປັນບ່ອນເກັບຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ຄັງຊອບແວ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "/usr/bin/suma-storage <devicename>\n"
msgstr "/usr/bin/suma-storage <devicename>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:26
msgid ""
"For more information about setting up storage volumes and partitions, "
"including recommended minimum sizes, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າວໍລຸມເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ພາທິຊັນ, ລວມທັງຂະໜາດຕໍ່າສຸດທີ່ແນະນຳ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Public Cloud Setup"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄລາວສາທາລະນະ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} Server needs to be registered with "
"[command]``registercloudguest`` for in the cloud operation or "
"[command]``SUSEConnect`` for {scc} provided entitlements to receive updates "
"before you can sign in.  For more information, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:public-cloud-guide/byos/byos-overview.adoc[]."
msgstr "{productname} Server ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການລົງທະບຽນດ້ວຍ [command]``registercloudguest`` ສຳລັບການເຮັດວຽກໃນຄລາວ ຫຼື [command]``SUSEConnect`` ສຳລັບສິດທິທີ່ໃຫ້ໂດຍ {scc} ເພື່ອຮັບການອັບເດດກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະສາມາດເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບໄດ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:public-cloud-guide/byos/byos-overview.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:3
msgid ""
"You must have set up the storage devices before you run the YaST "
"{productname} setup procedure.  For more information, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:pubcloud-requirements.adoc[]."
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມຂັ້ນຕອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ YaST {productname}. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:pubcloud-requirements.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Follow the cloud providers instructions to SSH into the instance, and run "
"this command to start set up:"
msgstr "ປະຕິບັດຕາມຄຳແນະນຳຂອງຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຄລາວເພື່ອ SSH ເຂົ້າໄປໃນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌, ແລະ ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອເລີ່ມການຕັ້ງຄ່າ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "yast2 susemanager_setup\n"
msgstr "yast2 susemanager_setup\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:6
msgid "Follow the prompts, and wait for the setup to finish."
msgstr "ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ປະກົດຂຶ້ນ, ແລະ ລໍຖ້າຈົນກວ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈະສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For detailed instructions on setting up {productname} with {yast}, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:server-setup.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳຢ່າງລະອຽດໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ດ້ວຍ {yast}, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:server-setup.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate the public cloud module"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານໂມດູນຄລາວສາທາລະນະ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:9
msgid ""
"To use {productname} on a public cloud instance, you need to activate the "
"public cloud module."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ {productname} ໃນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຄລາວສາທາລະນະ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ງານໂມດູນຄລາວສາທາລະນະ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Activating the public cloud module"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເປີດໃຊ້ງານໂມດູນຄລາວສາທາລະນະ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:11
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, open the {yast} management tool, and navigate "
"to menu:Software[Software Repositories]."
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ {productname} Server, ໃຫ້ເປີດເຄື່ອງມືຈັດການ {yast}, ແລະ ໄປທີ່ menu:Software[Software Repositories]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Add] and select [guimenu]``Extensions and Modules from "
"Registration Server``."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Add] ແລະ ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Extensions and Modules from Registration Server``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Available extensions`` field, select [guimenu]``Public "
"Cloud Module``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Available extensions``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Public Cloud Module``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:14
msgid ""
"If you prefer to use the command line, you can add the module with this "
"command:"
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ command line, ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມໂມດູນດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "SUSEConnect -p sle-module-public-cloud/15.4/x86_64\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:18
msgid "For {productname} Server on a public cloud, the expected modules are:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບ {productname} Server ເທິງຄລາວສາທາລະນະ, ໂມດູນທີ່ຕ້ອງການແມ່ນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:24
msgid "Public Cloud Module"
msgstr "Public Cloud Module"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Complete setup in the {webui}"
msgstr "ເຮັດການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ສຳເລັດໃນ {webui}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Open the {productname} {webui} with a web browser, using an address like "
"this:"
msgstr "ເປີດ {productname} {webui} ດ້ວຍເວັບບຣາວເຊີ, ໂດຍໃຊ້ທີ່ຢູ່ແບບນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://<public_IP>\n"
msgstr "https://<public_IP>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Sign in to the {productname} {webui} with the administrator account.  The "
"username and password varies depending on your provider."
msgstr "ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ {productname} {webui} ດ້ວຍບັນຊີຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ. ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Default Administrator Account Details"
msgstr "ລາຍລະອຽດບັນຊີຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ"

#. type: Table
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Provider              | Default Username  | Default Password\n"
"| Amazon EC2            | ``admin``         | ``<instance-ID>``\n"
"| Google Compute Engine | ``admin``         | ``<instance-ID>``\n"
"| Microsoft Azure       | ``admin``         | ``<instance-name>-suma``\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ              | ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ  | ລະຫັດຜ່ານເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ\n"
"| Amazon EC2            | ``admin``         | ``<instance-ID>``\n"
"| Google Compute Engine | ``admin``         | ``<instance-ID>``\n"
"| Microsoft Azure       | ``admin``         | ``<instance-name>-suma``\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:31
msgid ""
"You can retrieve the instance name or ID from the public cloud instance web "
"console, or from the command prompt:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເອົາຊື່ ຫຼື ID ຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໄດ້ຈາກເວັບຄອນໂຊລຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຄລາວ, ຫຼື ຈາກ command prompt:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:32
msgid "Amazon EC2:"
msgstr "Amazon EC2:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "ec2metadata --instance-id\n"
msgstr "ec2metadata --instance-id\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:34
msgid "Google Compute Engine:"
msgstr "Google Compute Engine:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "gcemetadata --query instance --id\n"
msgstr "gcemetadata --query instance --id\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:36
msgid "Microsoft Azure:"
msgstr "Microsoft Azure:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "azuremetadata --compute --name\n"
msgstr "azuremetadata --compute --name\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:38
msgid ""
"When you sign in to the administrator account for the first time, you are "
"given an automatically generated organization name.  Change this by "
"navigating to menu:Admin[Organizations], and editing the organization name."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບບັນຊີຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຄັ້ງທຳອິດ, ທ່ານຈະໄດ້ຮັບຊື່ອົງກອນທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ປ່ຽນຊື່ນີ້ໂດຍການໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Organizations], ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂຊື່ອົງກອນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:39
msgid ""
"When you have signed in to the administrator account for the first time, "
"change the default password to protect your account."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບບັນຊີຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຄັ້ງທຳອິດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນລະຫັດຜ່ານເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງບັນຊີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:40
msgid ""
"For more information about setting up your {productname} Server, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:server-setup.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Server ຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:server-setup.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adding Products and Starting Repositories Synchronization"
msgstr "ການເພີ່ມຜະລິດຕະພັນ ແລະ ເລີ່ມການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຄັງຊອບແວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:42
msgid ""
"Use the {productname} {webui} to add the required software products, and "
"schedule a repository synchronization.  The best way to do this is to "
"navigate to menu:Admin[Setup Wizard] and follow the prompts."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ {productname} {webui} ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຜະລິດຕະພັນຊອບແວທີ່ຕ້ອງການ, ແລະ ຕັ້ງເວລາການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຄັງຊອບແວ. ວິທີທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Setup Wizard] ແລະ ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:43
msgid ""
"For more information about the setup wizard, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:setup-wizard.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ setup wizard, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:setup-wizard.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:44
msgid ""
"If you are intending to register {ubuntu} or {rhel} clients, you need to set "
"up custom repositories and channels.  For more information, see the relevant "
"section in xref:client-configuration:registration-overview.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການລົງທະບຽນໄຄແອນ {ubuntu} ຫຼື {rhel}, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າຄັງຊອບແວ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງ (channels) ແບບກຳນົດເອງ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງພາກສ່ວນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໃນ xref:client-configuration:registration-overview.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:45
msgid ""
"To synchronize your channels, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Channels].  "
"Click each channel you created, navigate to the menu:Repositories[Sync] tab, "
"and click btn:[Sync Now].  You can also schedule synchronization from this "
"screen."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ່ອງທາງຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Software[Manage > Channels]. ກົດເລືອກແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ທ່ານສ້າງຂຶ້ນ, ໄປທີ່ແຖບ menu:Repositories[Sync], ແລະ ກົດ btn:[Sync Now]. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດຕັ້ງເວລາການຊິງໂຄຣໄນໄດ້ຈາກໜ້ານີ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:46
msgid ""
"Before bootstrapping a client, make sure all the selected channels for that "
"product are synchronized."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເຮັດ bootstrap ໃຫ້ໄຄແອນ, ຕ້ອງແນ່ໃຈວ່າທຸກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເລືອກສຳລັບຜະລິດຕະພັນນັ້ນໄດ້ຖືກຊິງໂຄຣໄນແລ້ວ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:47
msgid ""
"Synchronization can sometimes take several hours, in particular for "
"openSUSE, SLES ES, and RHEL channels."
msgstr "ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນບາງຄັ້ງອາດໃຊ້ເວລາຫຼາຍຊົ່ວໂມງ, ໂດຍສະເພາະສຳລັບຊ່ອງທາງ openSUSE, SLES ES, ແລະ RHEL."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-setup.adoc:48
msgid ""
"When you have your {productname} Server set up, you are ready to start "
"registering clients.  For more information about registering clients on a "
"public cloud, see xref:client-configuration:clients-pubcloud.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Server ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານກໍພ້ອມທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມລົງທະບຽນໄຄແອນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການລົງທະບຽນໄຄແອນເທິງຄລາວສາທາລະນະ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:clients-pubcloud.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-intro-uyuni.adoc:1
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-intro.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upgrade the Server"
msgstr "ອັບເກຣດເຊີເວີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-intro-uyuni.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} uses a rolling release versioning schema.  Check the release "
"notes for information about which upgrade strategy to use to upgrade to the "
"next version:"
msgstr "{productname} ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບເວີຊັນແບບ rolling release. ໃຫ້ກວດສອບ release notes ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບກົນລະຍຸດການອັບເກຣດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເພື່ອອັບເກຣດເປັນເວີຊັນຖັດໄປ:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-intro-uyuni.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Minor Upgrades"
msgstr "ການອັບເກຣດຍ່ອຍ (Minor Upgrades)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-intro-uyuni.adoc:4
msgid ""
"You can consider minor upgrades as regular upgrades.  For more information, "
"see xref:installation-and-upgrade:server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc[]."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຖືວ່າການອັບເກຣດຍ່ອຍແມ່ນການອັບເກຣດປົກກະຕິ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc[]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-intro-uyuni.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Major Upgrades"
msgstr "ການອັບເກຣດໃຫຍ່ (Major Upgrades)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-intro-uyuni.adoc:6
msgid ""
"You can consider major upgrades as special upgrades.  In this case "
"components such as the base operating system, Salt, or the PostgreSQL "
"database will be upgraded.  For more information, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:server-major-upgrade-uyuni.adoc[]."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຖືວ່າການອັບເກຣດໃຫຍ່ແມ່ນການອັບເກຣດແບບພິເສດ. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ນ ອົງປະກອບຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການຫຼັກ, Salt, ຫຼື ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ PostgreSQL ຈະຖືກອັບເກຣດ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:server-major-upgrade-uyuni.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-intro.adoc:3
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/upgrade-intro.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The version numbers below are just examples.  Do not understand them as most "
"recent available options.  {suse} uses these numbers for illustrative "
"purposes only."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລກເວີຊັນຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້ແມ່ນພຽງແຕ່ຕົວຢ່າງເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຢ່າເຂົ້າໃຈວ່າມັນແມ່ນຕົວເລືອກຫຼ້າສຸດທີ່ມີຢູ່. {suse} ໃຊ້ຕົວເລກເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເພື່ອເປັນຕົວຢ່າງປະກອບເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-intro.adoc:5
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/upgrade-intro.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Major upgrade is usually an upgrade from X.Y to X+1.0 or to X+1.1, where Y "
"is the latest minor version of the X series.  For example:"
msgstr "ການອັບເກຣດໃຫຍ່ປົກກະຕິແມ່ນການອັບເກຣດຈາກ X.Y ເປັນ X+1.0 ຫຼື ເປັນ X+1.1, ໂດຍທີ່ Y ແມ່ນເວີຊັນຍ່ອຍຫຼ້າສຸດຂອງຊຸດ X. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-intro.adoc:6
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/upgrade-intro.adoc:10
msgid ""
"From version 3.2 to 4.0 or to 4.1 (upgrading directly from 3.2 to 4.2 or "
"later is not supported)."
msgstr "ຈາກເວີຊັນ 3.2 ເປັນ 4.0 ຫຼື ເປັນ 4.1 (ການອັບເກຣດໂດຍກົງຈາກ 3.2 ເປັນ 4.2 ຫຼື ໃໝ່ກວ່າແມ່ນບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-intro.adoc:7
msgid "See xref:installation-and-upgrade:server-x.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:server-x.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-intro.adoc:9
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/upgrade-intro.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Minor upgrade refers to upgrading to the next minor version, from X.Y to "
"X.Y+1.  This is often referred to as a product migration, service pack "
"migration, or SP migration.  For example:"
msgstr "ການອັບເກຣດຍ່ອຍໝາຍເຖິງການອັບເກຣດເປັນເວີຊັນຍ່ອຍຖັດໄປ, ຈາກ X.Y ເປັນ X.Y+1. ສິ່ງນີ້ມັກຈະຖືກເອີ້ນວ່າ ການຍ້າຍຜະລິດຕະພັນ (product migration), ການຍ້າຍ service pack, ຫຼື ການຍ້າຍ SP. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-intro.adoc:10
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/upgrade-intro.adoc:13
msgid "From 4.2 to 4.3."
msgstr "ຈາກ 4.2 ເປັນ 4.3."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-intro.adoc:11
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/upgrade-intro.adoc:14
msgid "You always upgrade from and to the latest patch level of the minor version."
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງອັບເກຣດຈາກ ແລະ ໄປຫາ patch level ຫຼ້າສຸດຂອງເວີຊັນຍ່ອຍສະເໝີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-intro.adoc:12
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/upgrade-intro.adoc:15
msgid "For example, from 4.2.12 to 4.3.8, or newer."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, ຈາກ 4.2.12 ເປັນ 4.3.8, ຫຼື ໃໝ່ກວ່າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-intro.adoc:13
msgid "See xref:installation-and-upgrade:server-y.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:server-y.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-intro.adoc:15
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/upgrade-intro.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Upgrading within the same minor version.  This is often referred to as a "
"maintenance update or MU.  For example:"
msgstr "ການອັບເກຣດພາຍໃນເວີຊັນຍ່ອຍດຽວກັນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ມັກຈະຖືກເອີ້ນວ່າ maintenance update ຫຼື MU. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-intro.adoc:16
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/upgrade-intro.adoc:18
msgid "From 4.3.7 to 4.3.8."
msgstr "ຈາກ 4.3.7 ເປັນ 4.3.8."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-intro.adoc:17
msgid "See xref:installation-and-upgrade:server-z.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:server-z.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-major-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Server - Major Upgrade"
msgstr "ເຊີເວີ - ການອັບເກຣດໃຫຍ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-major-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:2
msgid ""
"When {productname} core components are upgraded to new major versions, you "
"need to perform a major upgrade on the {productname} Server.  This is the "
"case if a version upgrade of PostgreSQL, Salt, or openSUSE Leap is needed.  "
"openSUSE Leap is the underlying base operating system (OS)."
msgstr "ເມື່ອອົງປະກອບຫຼັກຂອງ {productname} ຖືກອັບເກຣດເປັນເວີຊັນໃຫຍ່ໃໝ່, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເຮັດການອັບເກຣດໃຫຍ່ຢູ່ທີ່ {productname} Server. ນີ້ແມ່ນກໍລະນີທີ່ຕ້ອງມີການອັບເກຣດເວີຊັນຂອງ PostgreSQL, Salt, ຫຼື openSUSE Leap. ໂດຍທີ່ openSUSE Leap ແມ່ນລະບົບປະຕິບັດການພື້ນຖານ (OS)."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-major-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Some additional manual steps might be required, and this information is only "
"available in the release notes.  For important extra information about your "
"upgrade, see the release notes at:"
msgstr "ອາດຈະມີບາງຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ຕ້ອງເຮັດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ມີໃຫ້ພຽງແຕ່ໃນ release notes ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ສຳຄັນກ່ຽວກັບການອັບເກຣດຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ release notes ໄດ້ທີ່:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-major-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:4
msgid "https://www.uyuni-project.org/pages/stable-version.html."
msgstr "https://www.uyuni-project.org/pages/stable-version.html."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-major-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:5
msgid ""
"You will not be able to fix issues that arise during the migration.  Ensure "
"you have created a backup before you start the migration.  If you are "
"running {productname} Server on a virtual machine, we recommend that you "
"create a snapshot before you start."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈະບໍ່ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນລະຫວ່າງການຍ້າຍລະບົບໄດ້. ຕ້ອງແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ (backup) ໄວ້ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມການຍ້າຍລະບົບ. ຫາກທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ {productname} Server ເທິງເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນ (virtual machine), ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານສ້າງ snapshot ໄວ້ກ່ອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-major-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Before the upgrade, ensure that storage requirements are met.  For more "
"information, see xref:uyuni-install-requirements.adoc[].  The migration "
"procedure can fill the root partition if there is not enough space available "
"due to the service pack migration and the download of new software "
"packages.  It is the same for the [path]``/var/lib/pgsql`` when upgrading "
"PostgreSQL.  It takes a copy of the old database, thus be sure to have at "
"least enough space available to cope with a copy of the database."
msgstr "ກ່ອນການອັບເກຣດ, ຕ້ອງແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ມາດຕະຖານດ້ານພື້ນທີ່ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:uyuni-install-requirements.adoc[]. ຂັ້ນຕອນການຍ້າຍລະບົບອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ root partition ເຕັມໄດ້ ຫາກມີພື້ນທີ່ບໍ່ພຽງພໍເນື່ອງຈາກການຍ້າຍ service pack ແລະ ການດາວໂຫຼດແພັກເກດຊອບແວໃໝ່. ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັນກັບ [path]``/var/lib/pgsql`` ເມື່ອອັບເກຣດ PostgreSQL. ມັນຈະມີການສ້າງສຳເນົາຂອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນເກົ່າ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຕ້ອງແນ່ໃຈວ່າມີພື້ນທີ່ພຽງພໍສຳລັບການສຳເນົາຖານຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-major-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The [command]``server-migrator.sh`` script migrates {productname} Server to "
"the latest version.  It also upgrades the underlying operating system to "
"version {opensuse-version}.  The script is part of the "
"[package]``susemanager`` package."
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບ [command]``server-migrator.sh`` ຈະຍ້າຍ {productname} Server ໄປເປັນເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດ. ມັນຍັງອັບເກຣດລະບົບປະຕິບັດການພື້ນຖານໃຫ້ເປັນເວີຊັນ {opensuse-version}. ສະຄຣິບນີ້ແມ່ນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງແພັກເກດ [package]``susemanager``."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-major-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Migrating the {productname} Server"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຍ້າຍລະບົບ {productname} Server"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-major-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Before running the [command]``server-migrator.sh`` script, check whether the "
"most recent version of the [package]``susemanager`` package is installed:"
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບ [command]``server-migrator.sh``, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າແພັກເກດ [package]``susemanager`` ເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດໄດ້ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວຫຼືບໍ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-major-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"zypper ref\n"
"zypper up susemanager\n"
msgstr ""
"zypper ref\n"
"zypper up susemanager\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-major-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Run the [command]``/usr/lib/susemanager/bin/server-migrator.sh`` script to "
"upgrade the base OS and {productname} Server."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບ [command]``/usr/lib/susemanager/bin/server-migrator.sh`` ເພື່ອອັບເກຣດ OS ພື້ນຖານ ແລະ {productname} Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-major-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:12
msgid ""
"To migrate the database to the latest database version run the migrate "
"script:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອຍ້າຍຖານຂໍ້ມູນໄປຫາເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດ ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບ migrate:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-major-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:14
msgid ""
"For more information about PostgreSQL database migration, see "
"xref:db-migration-xy.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຍ້າຍຖານຂໍ້ມູນ PostgreSQL, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:db-migration-xy.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-major-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:15
msgid "After the migration is complete, manually reboot the {productname} Server:"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກການຍ້າຍລະບົບສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ທຳການ reboot ເຄື່ອງ {productname} Server ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ:"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Server - Minor Upgrade"
msgstr "ເຊີເວີ - ການອັບເກຣດຍ່ອຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Several times a year, the {productname} team releases minor upgrades of the "
"{productname} Server.  These updates address bug fixes and feature "
"improvements, and sometimes include new features."
msgstr "ໃນແຕ່ລະປີ, ທີມງານ {productname} ຈະປ່ອຍເວີຊັນອັບເກຣດຍ່ອຍຂອງ {productname} Server ຫຼາຍຄັ້ງ. ການອັບເດດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະແກ້ໄຂບັກ ແລະ ປັບປຸງຄຸນສົມບັດຕ່າງໆ, ແລະ ບາງຄັ້ງກໍລວມມີຟີເຈີໃໝ່ໆ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Some additional manual steps might be required, and this information is only "
"available in the release notes.  For important extra information about your "
"upgrade, see the release notes at "
"https://www.uyuni-project.org/pages/stable-version.html."
msgstr "ອາດຈະມີບາງຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ຕ້ອງເຮັດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ມີໃຫ້ພຽງແຕ່ໃນ release notes ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ສຳຄັນກ່ຽວກັບການອັບເກຣດຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ release notes ໄດ້ທີ່ https://www.uyuni-project.org/pages/stable-version.html."

#.  It is recommended to install them in due time.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Performing a minor upgrade is similar to installing operating system package "
"updates."
msgstr "ການເຮັດການອັບເກຣດຍ່ອຍແມ່ນຄ້າຍຄືກັນກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງອັບເດດແພັກເກດຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:5
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-z.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Updating Packages on the {productname} Server"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການອັບເດດແພັກເກດໃນ {productname} Server"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:6
msgid ""
"By default, several update repositories are configured and enabled for the "
"{productname} Server.  New and updated packages become available "
"automatically."
msgstr "ຕາມຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຄັງຊອບແວອັບເດດຫຼາຍແຫ່ງໄດ້ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ງານສຳລັບ {productname} Server. ແພັກເກດໃໝ່ ແລະ ແພັກເກດທີ່ອັບເດດແລ້ວຈະມີໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:7
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-z.adoc:7
msgid "It is recommended you make a backup of the server before upgrading."
msgstr "ແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານທຳການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ (backup) ເຊີເວີກ່ອນທີ່ຈະທຳການອັບເກຣດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:8
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-z.adoc:8
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, as root, stop the "
"spacewalk services:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ {productname} Server, ທີ່ command prompt, ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ຢຸດການບໍລິການ spacewalk:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:9
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-yast.adoc:6
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-zypper.adoc:5
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-z.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacewalk-service stop\n"
msgstr "spacewalk-service stop\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:10
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-z.adoc:10
msgid "Refresh software repositories:"
msgstr "ຣີເຟຣຊ (Refresh) ຄັງຊອບແວ:"

#.  Zypper list-patches or patch doesn't update Uyuni
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:12
msgid "Update new packages: (Repeat this if prompted by zypper)"
msgstr "ອັບເດດແພັກເກດໃໝ່: (ເຮັດຊ້ຳຫາກ zypper ແຈ້ງເຕືອນ)"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper up \n"
msgstr "zypper up \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:14
msgid ""
"If zypper reports that the Uyuni package won't be upgraded, run the command "
"manually:"
msgstr "ຫາກ zypper ລາຍງານວ່າແພັກເກດ Uyuni ຈະບໍ່ຖືກອັບເກຣດ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper install Uyuni-Server-release\n"
msgstr "zypper install Uyuni-Server-release\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:16
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-z.adoc:17
msgid "Restart the spacewalk services:"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມການບໍລິການ spacewalk ໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:17
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-yast.adoc:21
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-zypper.adoc:19
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-z.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacewalk-service start\n"
msgstr "spacewalk-service start\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:18
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-z.adoc:22
msgid "Reboot the server if a patch update recommends rebooting."
msgstr "ຣີບູດ (Reboot) ເຊີເວີ ຫາກການອັບເດດ patch ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຣີບູດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:19
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-z.adoc:19
msgid ""
"By default, zypper refreshes the repository every ten minutes (see "
"``repo.refresh.delay`` in [path]``/etc/zypp/zypp.conf``).  If "
"``autorefresh`` is disabled, run [command]``zypper ref`` to refresh all "
"repositories."
msgstr "ຕາມຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, zypper ຈະຣີເຟຣຊຄັງຊອບແວທຸກໆສິບນາທີ (ເບິ່ງ ``repo.refresh.delay`` ໃນ [path]``/etc/zypp/zypp.conf``). ຫາກ ``autorefresh`` ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [command]``zypper ref`` ເພື່ອຣີເຟຣຊຄັງຊອບແວທັງໝົດ."

#.  We can remove  the version info when 4.1 / 2020.07 is released
#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Starting with {productname} 4.1, [command]``spacewalk-schema-upgrade`` is "
"not needed anymore."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕັ້ງແຕ່ {productname} 4.1 ເປັນຕົ້ນໄປ, ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ [command]``spacewalk-schema-upgrade`` ອີກແລ້ວ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Starting with {productname} 2020.04 [command]``spacewalk-schema-upgrade`` is "
"not needed anymore."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕັ້ງແຕ່ {productname} 2020.04 ເປັນຕົ້ນໄປ, ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ [command]``spacewalk-schema-upgrade`` ອີກແລ້ວ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:22
msgid ""
"The schema upgrade is run automatically when the spacewalk service is "
"started with [command]``spacewalk-service start``."
msgstr "ການອັບເກຣດ schema ຈະເຮັດວຽກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອການບໍລິການ spacewalk ຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ [command]``spacewalk-service start``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-minor-upgrade-uyuni.adoc:23
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-z.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Services affected by a package update are not automatically restarted after "
"an update.  You need to restart these services manually to avoid potential "
"failures.  Use [command]``zypper ps`` to check for applications that are "
"using old code and require restarting."
msgstr "ການບໍລິການທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກການອັບເດດແພັກເກດຈະບໍ່ຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຫຼັງຈາກການອັບເດດ. ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເລີ່ມການບໍລິການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃໝ່ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນຄວາມຜິດພາດທີ່ອາດເກີດຂຶ້ນ. ໃຊ້ [command]``zypper ps`` ເພື່ອກວດສອບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ຍັງໃຊ້ໂຄ້ດເກົ່າ ແລະ ຕ້ອງການການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "SUSE Manager Server Setup"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ SUSE Manager Server"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:2
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:2
msgid "This section covers {productname} Server setup, using these procedures:"
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ກວມເອົາການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Server, ໂດຍໃຊ້ຂັ້ນຕອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:3
msgid "Start {productname} setup with YaST"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ດ້ວຍ YaST"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:4
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:4
msgid "Create the main administration account with the {productname} {webui}"
msgstr "ສ້າງບັນຊີຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຫຼັກດ້ວຍ {productname} {webui}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:5
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:5
msgid "Name your base organization and add login credentials"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຊື່ອົງກອນຫຼັກຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ເພີ່ມຂໍ້ມູນເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:6
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:6
msgid "Synchronize the {sle} product channel from {scc}"
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ່ອງທາງຜະລິດຕະພັນ {sle} ຈາກ {scc}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:7
msgid ""
"{productname} is part of the {sle} product family and thus compatible with "
"the software shipped with {sles}."
msgstr "{productname} ແມ່ນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຄອບຄົວຜະລິດຕະພັນ {sle} ແລະ ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈຶ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ງານຮ່ວມກັບຊອບແວທີ່ມາພ້ອມກັບ {sles}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:8
msgid ""
"{productname} is a complex system, and therefore installing third party "
"software is not allowed.  Installing monitoring software provided by a third "
"party vendor is allowed only if you do not exchange basic libraries such as "
"SSL, cryptographic software, and similar tools.  As part of providing "
"product support, SUSE reserves the right to ask to remove any third party "
"software (and associated configuration changes) and then to reproduce the "
"problem on a clean system."
msgstr "{productname} ແມ່ນລະບົບທີ່ມີຄວາມຊັບຊ້ອນ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນການຕິດຕັ້ງຊອບແວຈາກພາຍນອກ (third party) ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດ. ການຕິດຕັ້ງຊອບແວຕິດຕາມ (monitoring) ທີ່ສະໜອງໂດຍຜູ້ຂາຍພາຍນອກແມ່ນອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ພຽງແຕ່ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ປ່ຽນແປງ libraries ພື້ນຖານ ເຊັ່ນ SSL, ຊອບແວຖອດລະຫັດ, ແລະ ເຄື່ອງມືທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນ. ໃນສ່ວນຂອງການສະໜັບສະໜູນຜະລິດຕະພັນ, SUSE ຂໍສະຫງວນສິດທີ່ຈະຂໍໃຫ້ຖອນການຕິດຕັ້ງຊອບແວພາຍນອກໃດໆ (ແລະ ການປ່ຽນແປງການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ) ແລ້ວທົດສອບບັນຫາຄືນໃໝ່ໃນລະບົບທີ່ສະອາດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Do not register the {productname} Server to itself.  The {productname} "
"Server must be managed individually or by using another separate "
"{productname} Server.  For more information about using multiple servers, "
"see xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/multi-server.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຢ່າລົງທະບຽນ {productname} Server ໃສ່ກັບຕົວມັນເອງ. {productname} Server ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຈັດການແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ ຫຼື ໂດຍການໃຊ້ {productname} Server ອື່ນທີ່ແຍກກັນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ຫຼາຍເຊີເວີ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/multi-server.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up {productname} with YaST"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ດ້ວຍ YaST"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:11
msgid "This section guides you through {productname} setup using {yast}."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ຈະແນະນຳທ່ານກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ໂດຍໃຊ້ {yast}."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:12
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: {productname} Setup"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:13
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command line, use the [command]``yast2 "
"susemanager_setup`` command to begin setup."
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ {productname} Server, ທີ່ command line, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``yast2 susemanager_setup`` ເພື່ອເລີ່ມການຕັ້ງຄ່າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:14
msgid ""
"From the introduction screen select menu:SUSE Manager Setup[Setup SUSE "
"Manager from scratch] and click btn:[Next] to continue."
msgstr "ຈາກໜ້າແນະນຳ ໃຫ້ເລືອກ menu:SUSE Manager Setup[Setup SUSE Manager from scratch] ແລະ ກົດ btn:[Next] ເພື່ອດຳເນີນການຕໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:15
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Enter an email address to receive status notifications and click btn:[Next] "
"to continue."
msgstr "ໃສ່ທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມລເພື່ອຮັບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນສະຖານະ ແລະ ກົດ btn:[Next] ເພື່ອດຳເນີນການຕໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:16
msgid ""
"{productname} can sometimes send a large volume of notification emails.  You "
"can disable email notifications in the {webui} after setup, if you need to.  "
"For more information on disabling email notifications, see "
"xref:reference:users/user-details.adoc[]."
msgstr "{productname} ບາງຄັ້ງອາດສົ່ງອີເມລແຈ້ງເຕືອນເປັນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ. ທ່ານສາມາດປິດການແຈ້ງເຕືອນທາງອີເມລໄດ້ໃນ {webui} ຫຼັງຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການປິດການແຈ້ງເຕືອນອີເມລ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:reference:users/user-details.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:17
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:15
msgid "Enter your certificate information and a password."
msgstr "ໃສ່ຂໍ້ມູນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ (certificate) ຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:18
msgid ""
"If you intend to use a custom SSL certificate, you need to have set this up "
"first.  For more information about SSL certificates, see "
"xref:administration:ssl-certs.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL ແບບກຳນົດເອງ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າມັນກ່ອນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:ssl-certs.adoc[]."

#.  image::quickstart-mgr-setup5-ncurses.png[scaledwidth=80%]
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:19
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:21
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:23
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:18
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:21
msgid "Click btn:[Next] to continue."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Next] ເພື່ອດຳເນີນການຕໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:20
msgid ""
"From the menu:SUSE Manager Setup[Database Settings] screen, enter a database "
"user and password and click btn:[Next] to continue."
msgstr "ຈາກໜ້າ menu:SUSE Manager Setup[Database Settings], ໃຫ້ໃສ່ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານ ແລ້ວກົດ btn:[Next] ເພື່ອດຳເນີນການຕໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:22
msgid "Click btn:[Yes] to run setup when prompted, and wait for it to complete."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Yes] ເພື່ອເລີ່ມການຕັ້ງຄ່າເມື່ອມີການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ, ແລະ ລໍຖ້າຈົນກວ່າມັນຈະສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:24
msgid "Take a note of the address of the {productname} {webui}."
msgstr "ຈົດບັນທຶກທີ່ຢູ່ຂອງ {productname} {webui} ໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:25
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:25
msgid "Click btn:[Finish] to complete {productname} setup."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Finish] ເພື່ອສິ້ນສຸດການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:26
msgid ""
"When you create your certificate password, ensure it is at least seven "
"characters in length.  It must not contain spaces, single or double "
"quotation marks (``'`` or ``\"``), exclamation marks (``!``), or dollar "
"signs (``$``).  Always store your passwords in a secure location.  Without "
"this password it will not be possible to set up the {productname} Proxy."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງລະຫັດຜ່ານໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ, ຕ້ອງແນ່ໃຈວ່າມັນມີຄວາມຍາວຢ່າງໜ້ອຍເຈັດຕົວອັກສອນ. ມັນຕ້ອງບໍ່ມີຍະຫວ່າງ, ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຄຳເວົ້າດ່ຽວ ຫຼື ຄູ່ (``'`` ຫຼື ``\"``), ເຄື່ອງໝາຍທ້ວງ (``!``), ຫຼື ເຄື່ອງໝາຍໂດລາ (``$``). ໃຫ້ເກັບຮັກສາລະຫັດຜ່ານຂອງທ່ານໄວ້ໃນບ່ອນທີ່ປອດໄພສະເໝີ. ຫາກບໍ່ມີລະຫັດຜ່ານນີ້ ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Proxy ໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "Creating the Main Administration Account"
msgstr "ການສ້າງບັນຊີຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຫຼັກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:28
msgid ""
"This section guides you through creating your organization's main "
"administration account for {productname}."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ຈະແນະນຳທ່ານໃນການສ້າງບັນຊີຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຫຼັກຂອງອົງກອນສຳລັບ {productname}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:29
msgid ""
"The main administration account is the _highest authority account_ within "
"{productname} and therefore account access information should be stored in a "
"secure location."
msgstr "ບັນຊີຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຫຼັກແມ່ນ _ບັນຊີທີ່ມີອຳນາດສູງສຸດ_ ພາຍໃນ {productname} ດັ່ງນັ້ນຂໍ້ມູນການເຂົ້າເຖິງບັນຊີຄວນຖືກເກັບຮັກສາໄວ້ໃນບ່ອນທີ່ປອດໄພ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:30
msgid ""
"For security it is recommended that the main administrator creates _low "
"level admin accounts_ designated for administration of organizations and "
"individual groups."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພ ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຫຼັກສ້າງ _ບັນຊີຜູ້ດູແລລະດັບຮອງ_ ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ສຳລັບການຈັດການອົງກອນ ແລະ ກຸ່ມຕ່າງໆ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:31
msgid ""
"Newer browser versions can block web access to the {productname} Server FQDN "
"in case the user enabled HSTS."
msgstr "ເວີຊັນຂອງບຣາວເຊີທີ່ໃໝ່ກວ່າອາດຈະບລັອກການເຂົ້າເຖິງເວັບໄປຫາ FQDN ຂອງ {productname} Server ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເປີດໃຊ້ HSTS."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Installing the CA certificate from the [path]``pub`` directory via HTTP and "
"importing it to the browser will then allow access to the server:"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ CA ຈາກໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``pub`` ຜ່ານ HTTP ແລະ ນຳເຂົ້າມັນໄປຍັງບຣາວເຊີ ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງເຊີເວີໄດ້:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:33
msgid ""
"On the server, go to "
"**+http://<server>.example.com/pub/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT+**."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:34
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Import the certificate file.  In the browser settings (for Firefox), open "
"menu:Privacy & Security[Certificates > View Certificates], and import the "
"file."
msgstr "ນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ. ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າບຣາວເຊີ (ສຳລັບ Firefox), ໃຫ້ເປີດ menu:Privacy & Security[Certificates > View Certificates], ແລະ ນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:35
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Setting Up the Main Administration Account"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າບັນຊີຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຫຼັກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:36
msgid "In the browser, enter the address provided after completing setup."
msgstr "ໃນບຣາວເຊີ, ໃຫ້ໃສ່ທີ່ຢູ່ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຫຼັງຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:37
msgid "With this address you open the {productname} {webui}."
msgstr "ດ້ວຍທີ່ຢູ່ນີ້ ທ່ານຈະສາມາດເປີດ {productname} {webui} ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:38
msgid ""
"In the {webui}, navigate to the menu:Create Organization[Organization Name] "
"field and enter your organization name."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ຊ່ອງ menu:Create Organization[Organization Name] ແລະ ໃສ່ຊື່ອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:39
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:38
msgid ""
"In the menu:Create Organization[Desired Login] and menu:Create "
"Organization[Desired Password] fields, enter your username and password."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ menu:Create Organization[Desired Login] ແລະ menu:Create Organization[Desired Password], ໃຫ້ໃສ່ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:40
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:39
msgid ""
"Fill in the Account Information fields including an email for system "
"notifications."
msgstr "ຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໃນຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນບັນຊີ ລວມທັງອີເມລສຳລັບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນລະບົບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:41
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:40
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Create Organization] to finish creating your administration "
"account."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Create Organization] ເພື່ອສິ້ນສຸດການສ້າງບັນຊີຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຂອງທ່ານ."

#.  image::quickstart-mgr-setup-admin1.png[scaledwidth=80%]
#.  In the next section you will prepare the server for connecting the first client.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:42
msgid "You are now presented with the {productname} menu:Home[Overview] page."
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ທ່ານຈະເຫັນໜ້າ menu:Home[Overview] ຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "Synchronizing Products from {scc}"
msgstr "ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຜະລິດຕະພັນຈາກ {scc}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:44
msgid ""
"{scc} (SCC) maintains a collection of repositories which contain packages, "
"software and updates for all supported enterprise client systems.  These "
"repositories are organized into channels each of which provide software "
"specific to a distribution, release, and architecture.  After synchronizing "
"with SCC clients may receive updates, and be organized into groups and "
"assigned to specific product software channels."
msgstr "{scc} (SCC) ຈະເກັບຮັກສາຄັງຊອບແວທີ່ບັນຈຸແພັກເກດ, ຊອບແວ ແລະ ການອັບເດດສຳລັບທຸກລະບົບໄຄແອນລະດັບອົງກອນທີ່ຮອງຮັບ. ຄັງຊອບແວເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກຈັດເປັນຊ່ອງທາງ (channels) ເຊິ່ງແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງທາງຈະສະໜອງຊອບແວທີ່ສະເພາະເຈາະຈົງກັບ distro, ເວີຊັນ ແລະ ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ. ຫຼັງຈາກຊິງໂຄຣໄນກັບ SCC ແລ້ວ ໄຄແອນຈະສາມາດຮັບການອັບເດດ, ຖືກຈັດເຂົ້າກຸ່ມ ແລະ ຖືກມອບໝາຍໃຫ້ກັບຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວຂອງຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ສະເພາະເຈາະຈົງໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:45
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:44
msgid ""
"This section covers synchronizing with SCC from the {webui} and adding your "
"first client channel."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ກວມເອົາການຊິງໂຄຣໄນກັບ SCC ຈາກ {webui} ແລະ ການເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງໄຄແອນທຳອິດຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:46
msgid ""
"Before you can synchronize software repositories with SCC, you will need to "
"enter organization credentials in {susemgr}.  In previous versions, "
"so-called mirror credentials were used instead.  The organization "
"credentials give you access to the SUSE product downloads.  You will find "
"your organization credentials in https://scc.suse.com/organizations."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະສາມາດຊິງໂຄຣໄນຄັງຊອບແວກັບ SCC ໄດ້, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃສ່ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງອົງກອນ (organization credentials) ໃນ {susemgr}. ໃນເວີຊັນກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້, ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ mirror credentials ໄດ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ແທນ. ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງອົງກອນຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເຂົ້າເຖິງການດາວໂຫຼດຜະລິດຕະພັນ SUSE ໄດ້. ທ່ານຈະພົບຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານໃນ https://scc.suse.com/organizations."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:47
msgid "Enter your organization credentials in the {susemgr} {webui}:"
msgstr "ໃສ່ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານໃນ {susemgr} {webui}:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:48
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Entering Organization Credentials"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການໃສ່ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງອົງກອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:49
msgid "In the {susemgr} {webui}, select menu:Admin[Setup Wizard]."
msgstr "ໃນ {susemgr} {webui}, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ menu:Admin[Setup Wizard]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:50
msgid ""
"From the [guimenu]``Setup Wizard`` page select the btn:[Organization "
"Credentials] tab."
msgstr "ຈາກໜ້າ [guimenu]``Setup Wizard`` ໃຫ້ເລືອກແຖບ btn:[Organization Credentials]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:51
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:51
msgid "Click btn:[Add a new credential]."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Add a new credential]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:52
msgid ""
"In the dialog, enter [guimenu]``Username`` and [guimenu]``Password``, and "
"confirm with btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ໃນກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ, ໃຫ້ໃສ່ [guimenu]``Username`` ແລະ [guimenu]``Password``, ແລ້ວຍືນຍັນດ້ວຍ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:53
msgid ""
"When the credentials are confirmed with a check-mark icon, proceed with "
"<<proc-quickstart-first-channel-sync>>."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວໄດ້ຮັບການຢືນຍັນດ້ວຍໄອຄອນເຄື່ອງໝາຍຕິກ, ໃຫ້ດຳເນີນການຕໍ່ດ້ວຍ <<proc-quickstart-first-channel-sync>>."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:54
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Synchronizing with {scc}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນກັບ {scc}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:55
msgid "In the {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Setup Wizard]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Setup Wizard]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:56
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:56
msgid "From the [guimenu]``Setup Wizard`` page select the btn:[SUSE Products] tab."
msgstr "ຈາກໜ້າ [guimenu]``Setup Wizard`` ໃຫ້ເລືອກແຖບ btn:[SUSE Products]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:57
msgid ""
"If you previously registered with {scc} a list of products will populate the "
"table.  This operation could take up to a few minutes.  You can monitor the "
"progress of the operation in section on the right ``Refresh the product "
"catalog from SUSE Customer Center``.  The table of products lists "
"architecture, channels, and status information.  For more information, see "
"xref:reference:admin/setup-wizard.adoc[Wizard]."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານເຄີຍລົງທະບຽນກັບ {scc} ມາກ່ອນ, ລາຍຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນໃນຕາຕະລາງ. ການດຳເນີນການນີ້ອາດໃຊ້ເວລາສອງສາມນາທີ. ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕາມຄວາມຄືບໜ້າໄດ້ໃນພາກສ່ວນດ້ານຂວາ ``Refresh the product catalog from SUSE Customer Center``. ຕາຕະລາງຜະລິດຕະພັນຈະສະແດງສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ, ຊ່ອງທາງ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນສະຖານະ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:reference:admin/setup-wizard.adoc[Wizard]."

#.  image::admin_suse_products.png[scaledwidth=80%]
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:58
msgid ""
"Use ``Filter by product description`` and ``Filter by architecture`` to "
"filter the liste of displayed products."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ ``Filter by product description`` ແລະ ``Filter by architecture`` ເພື່ອກັ່ນຕອງລາຍຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ສະແດງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:59
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:59
msgid ""
"If your {sle} client is based on [systemitem]``x86_64`` architecture scroll "
"down the page and select the check box for this channel now."
msgstr "ຫາກໄຄແອນ {sle} ຂອງທ່ານອີງໃສ່ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ [systemitem]``x86_64`` ໃຫ້ເລື່ອນລົງ ແລະ ເລືອກຊ່ອງໝາຍຕິກສຳລັບຊ່ອງທາງນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:60
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:60
msgid ""
"Add channels to {productname} by selecting the check box to the left of each "
"channel."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງໃຫ້ກັບ {productname} ໂດຍການເລືອກຊ່ອງໝາຍຕິກທາງດ້ານຊ້າຍຂອງແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງທາງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:61
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:61
msgid ""
"Click the arrow symbol to the left of the description to unfold a product "
"and list available modules."
msgstr "ກົດທີ່ສັນຍະລັກລູກສອນທາງດ້ານຊ້າຍຂອງຄຳອະທິບາຍເພື່ອຂະຫຍາຍຜະລິດຕະພັນ ແລະ ເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ໂມດູນທີ່ມີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:62
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:62
msgid "Click btn:[Add Products] to start product synchronization."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Add Products] ເພື່ອເລີ່ມການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຜະລິດຕະພັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:63
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:63
msgid ""
"After adding the channel, {productname} will schedule the channel to be "
"synchronized.  This can take a long time as {productname} will copy channel "
"software sources from the {suse} repositories located at {scc} to local "
"[path]``/var/spacewalk/`` directory of your server."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງແລ້ວ, {productname} ຈະຕັ້ງເວລາໃຫ້ຊ່ອງທາງນັ້ນຖືກຊິງໂຄຣໄນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດໃຊ້ເວລາດົນ ເພາະ {productname} ຈະຄັດລອກແຫຼ່ງຊອບແວຈາກຄັງຂອງ {suse} ທີ່ຢູ່ {scc} ໄປຍັງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/var/spacewalk/`` ພາຍໃນເຊີເວີຂອງທ່ານ."

#. .PostgreSQL and Transparent Huge Pages
#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:64
msgid ""
"In some environments, _Transparent Huge Pages_ provided by the kernel may "
"slow down PostgreSQL workloads significantly."
msgstr "ໃນບາງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ, _Transparent Huge Pages_ ທີ່ໃຫ້ໂດຍ kernel ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ PostgreSQL ຊ້າລົງຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:65
msgid ""
"To disable _Transparant Huge Pages_ set the [option]``transparent_hugepage`` "
"kernel parameter to [option]``never``.  This has to be changed in "
"[path]``/etc/default/grub`` and added to the line "
"[option]``GRUB_CMDLINE_LINUX_DEFAULT``, for example:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອປິດໃຊ້ງານ _Transparent Huge Pages_ ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າພາຣາມີເຕີ kernel [option]``transparent_hugepage`` ເປັນ [option]``never``. ສິ່ງນີ້ຕ້ອງຖືກປ່ຽນແປງໃນ [path]``/etc/default/grub`` ແລະ ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນແຖວ [option]``GRUB_CMDLINE_LINUX_DEFAULT``, ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:66
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:66
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"GRUB_CMDLINE_LINUX_DEFAULT=\"resume=/dev/sda1 splash=silent quiet showopts "
"elevator=none transparent_hugepage=never\"\n"
msgstr "GRUB_CMDLINE_LINUX_DEFAULT=\"resume=/dev/sda1 splash=silent quiet showopts elevator=none transparent_hugepage=never\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:67
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:67
msgid ""
"To write the new configuration run [command]``grub2-mkconfig -o "
"/boot/grub2/grub.cfg``."
msgstr "ເພື່ອບັນທຶກການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່ ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``grub2-mkconfig -o /boot/grub2/grub.cfg``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:68
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:68
msgid ""
"Monitor the channel synchronization process in real-time by viewing channel "
"log files located in the directory [path]``/var/log/rhn/reposync``:"
msgstr "ຕິດຕາມຂະບວນການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ່ອງທາງແບບ real-time ໂດຍການເບິ່ງໄຟລ໌ log ທີ່ຢູ່ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/var/log/rhn/reposync``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:69
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "tail -f /var/log/rhn/reposync/<CHANNEL_NAME>.log\n"
msgstr "tail -f /var/log/rhn/reposync/<CHANNEL_NAME>.log\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-setup.adoc:70
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:70
msgid ""
"When the channel synchronization process is complete, you can continue with "
"client registration.  For more instructions, see "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-overview.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຂະບວນການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ່ອງທາງສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດດຳເນີນການລົງທະບຽນໄຄແອນຕໍ່ໄດ້. ສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:registration-overview.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-x.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Server - Major version upgrade (X upgrade)"
msgstr "ເຊີເວີ - ການອັບເກຣດເວີຊັນໃຫຍ່ (X upgrade)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-x.adoc:2
msgid "This type of upgrade applies for an upgrade from 3.2 to 4.0."
msgstr "ການອັບເກຣດປະເພດນີ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການອັບເກຣດຈາກ 3.2 ເປັນ 4.0."

#. For older documentation and instructions on major version upgrade, see https://documentation.suse.com/external-tree/en-us/suma/4.1/suse-manager/upgrade/server-x.html.
#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-yast.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Server - Minor Version Upgrade with {yast}"
msgstr "ເຊີເວີ - ການອັບເກຣດເວີຊັນຍ່ອຍດ້ວຍ {yast}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-yast.adoc:2
msgid "To perform the upgrade with {yast}, use the Online Migration tool."
msgstr "ເພື່ອທຳການອັບເກຣດດ້ວຍ {yast}, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື Online Migration."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-yast.adoc:3
msgid ""
"If {yast} does not have the Online Migration tool available, install the "
"[package]``yast2-migration`` package and all the required packages.  After "
"installing, restart {yast} to ensure the tool is available within {yast}."
msgstr "ຫາກ {yast} ບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງມື Online Migration, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ [package]``yast2-migration`` ແລະ ທຸກແພັກເກດທີ່ຈຳເປັນ. ຫຼັງຈາກຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມ {yast} ໃໝ່ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເຄື່ອງມືດັ່ງກ່າວມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພາຍໃນ {yast}."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-yast.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Upgrading with {yast}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການອັບເກຣດດ້ວຍ {yast}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-yast.adoc:5
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-zypper.adoc:4
msgid ""
"From the command prompt, as root, ensure the spacewalk services are not "
"running:"
msgstr "ຈາກ command prompt, ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າການບໍລິການ spacewalk ບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-yast.adoc:7
msgid "Launch the {yast} online migration tool:"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື {yast} online migration:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-yast.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "yast2 migration\n"
msgstr "yast2 migration\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-yast.adoc:9
msgid ""
"If there are older updates available, {yast} will notify you and ask to "
"install them first.  You must install all package updates before performing "
"the migration.  For more information, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:server-z.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຫາກມີການອັບເດດທີ່ເກົ່າກວ່າມີຢູ່, {yast} ຈະແຈ້ງເຕືອນ ແລະ ຂໍໃຫ້ທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງພວກມັນກ່ອນ. ທ່ານຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງການອັບເດດແພັກເກດທັງໝົດກ່ອນທີ່ຈະທຳການຍ້າຍລະບົບ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:server-z.adoc[]."

#.  I've removed the graphical option, because we tell people to use a text console. LKB 2019-08-21
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-yast.adoc:10
msgid "{yast} will show the possible migration targets with detailed summaries."
msgstr "{yast} ຈະສະແດງປາຍທາງການຍ້າຍລະບົບທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້ພ້ອມກັບບົດສະຫຼຸບທີ່ລະອຽດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-yast.adoc:11
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-zypper.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Select the appropriate target, and follow the prompts to complete the "
"migration."
msgstr "ເລືອກປາຍທາງທີ່ເໝາະສົມ, ແລະ ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນເພື່ອເຮັດການຍ້າຍລະບົບໃຫ້ສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-yast.adoc:12
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-zypper.adoc:10
msgid "Reboot the server."
msgstr "ຣີບູດ (Reboot) ເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-yast.adoc:13
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-zypper.adoc:11
msgid ""
"When rebooted the {productname} spacewalk services are not running until you "
"have migrated the PostgreSQL database to version{nbsp}14."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຣີບູດແລ້ວ ການບໍລິການ spacewalk ຂອງ {productname} ຈະຍັງບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກຈົນກວ່າທ່ານຈະໄດ້ຍ້າຍຖານຂໍ້ມູນ PostgreSQL ໄປເປັນເວີຊັນ{nbsp}14."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-yast.adoc:14
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-zypper.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Log in on the text console as root.  If you are upgrading from 4.1 or 4.2 to "
"4.3, run the database migration script:"
msgstr "ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບຜ່ານ text console ໃນນາມ root. ຫາກທ່ານກຳລັງອັບເກຣດຈາກ 4.1 ຫຼື 4.2 ເປັນ 4.3, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບຍ້າຍຖານຂໍ້ມູນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-yast.adoc:15
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-zypper.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "/usr/lib/susemanager/bin/pg-migrate-13-to-14.sh\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-yast.adoc:16
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-zypper.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Upgrade the PostgreSQL server to version{nbsp}14, in case it is not done "
"automatically, with command:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-yast.adoc:17
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-zypper.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in postgresql14 postgresql14-contrib postgresql14-server\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-yast.adoc:18
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-zypper.adoc:16
msgid "Remove PostgreSQL old version{nbsp}13 with command:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-yast.adoc:19
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-zypper.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper rm postgresql13 postgresql13-contrib postgresql13-server\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-yast.adoc:20
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-zypper.adoc:18
msgid "Ensure the spacewalk services are running:"
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າການບໍລິການ spacewalk ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກ:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-yast.adoc:22
msgid ""
"[command]``spacewalk-schema-upgrade`` is not needed anymore.  It will be run "
"during [command]``spacewalk-service start`` automatically."
msgstr "ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ [command]``spacewalk-schema-upgrade`` ອີກແລ້ວ. ມັນຈະເຮັດວຽກໃນລະຫວ່າງ [command]``spacewalk-service start`` ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#.  Does this also apply if you use zypper?  If yes, we must repeat this
#.  sentence below.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-yast.adoc:23
msgid ""
"During the upgrade, {yast} will install all recommended packages.  This can "
"significantly increase the installation size of the system.  To only install "
"required packages, open the [path]``/etc/zypp/zypp.conf`` configuration file "
"and set these variables:"
msgstr "ໃນລະຫວ່າງການອັບເກຣດ, {yast} ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງທຸກແພັກເກດທີ່ແນະນຳ. ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດຈະເພີ່ມຂະໜາດການຕິດຕັ້ງຂອງລະບົບຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ. ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງພຽງແຕ່ແພັກເກດທີ່ຈຳເປັນ, ໃຫ້ເປີດໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [path]``/etc/zypp/zypp.conf`` ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວແປເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-yast.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"solver.onlyRequires = true\n"
"installRecommends = false\n"
msgstr ""
"solver.onlyRequires = true\n"
"installRecommends = false\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-yast.adoc:25
msgid "This changes the behavior of all future package operations."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະປ່ຽນແປງພຶດຕິກຳຂອງການຈັດການແພັກເກດທັງໝົດໃນອະນາຄົດ."

#.  FIXME: server-migrator.sh???
#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-zypper.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Server - Minor version upgrade with ``zypper``"
msgstr "ເຊີເວີ - ການອັບເກຣດເວີຊັນຍ່ອຍດ້ວຍ ``zypper``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-zypper.adoc:2
msgid "To perform the upgrade with Zypper, use the Zypper migration tool."
msgstr "ເພື່ອທຳການອັບເກຣດດ້ວຍ Zypper, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື Zypper migration."

#.  FIXME: Adjust version numbers
#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-zypper.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Upgrading with ``zypper``"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການອັບເກຣດດ້ວຍ ``zypper``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-zypper.adoc:6
msgid "Launch the Zypper migration tool:"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື Zypper migration:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-zypper.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper migration\n"
msgstr "zypper migration\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-zypper.adoc:8
msgid "Zypper will show the possible migration targets with detailed summaries."
msgstr "Zypper ຈະສະແດງປາຍທາງການຍ້າຍລະບົບທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້ພ້ອມກັບບົດສະຫຼຸບທີ່ລະອຽດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-zypper.adoc:20
msgid "If the process fails, check these issues first:"
msgstr "ຫາກຂະບວນການຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບບັນຫາເຫຼົ່ານີ້ກ່ອນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-zypper.adoc:21
msgid ""
"If Zypper does not have the migration tool available, install the "
"[package]``zypper-migration-plugin`` package."
msgstr "ຫາກ Zypper ບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງມື migration, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ [package]``zypper-migration-plugin``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y-zypper.adoc:22
msgid ""
"If there are older updates available, Zypper will notify you and ask to "
"install them first.  You must install all updates before performing the "
"upgrade."
msgstr "ຫາກມີການອັບເດດທີ່ເກົ່າກວ່າມີຢູ່, Zypper ຈະແຈ້ງເຕືອນ ແລະ ຂໍໃຫ້ທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງພວກມັນກ່ອນ. ທ່ານຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງການອັບເດດທັງໝົດກ່ອນທີ່ຈະທຳການອັບເກຣດ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Server - Minor Version Upgrade (Y Upgrade)"
msgstr "ເຊີເວີ - ການອັບເກຣດເວີຊັນຍ່ອຍ (Y Upgrade)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y.adoc:2
msgid ""
"You can upgrade {productname} to the next minor version using either the "
"{yast} online migration tool or the Zypper command line tool.  This is often "
"referred to as a product migration, service pack migration, or SP "
"migration.  This procedure does not replace the server with an updated "
"copy.  It is an in-place upgrade."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດອັບເກຣດ {productname} ເປັນເວີຊັນຍ່ອຍຖັດໄປໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື {yast} online migration ຫຼື ເຄື່ອງມື Zypper command line. ສິ່ງນີ້ມັກຈະຖືກເອີ້ນວ່າ ການຍ້າຍຜະລິດຕະພັນ, ການຍ້າຍ service pack, ຫຼື ການຍ້າຍ SP. ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ແທນທີ່ເຊີເວີດ້ວຍສຳເນົາໃໝ່ ແຕ່ເປັນການອັບເກຣດຢູ່ໃນລະບົບເດີມ (in-place upgrade)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y.adoc:3
msgid "Examples:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y.adoc:4
msgid ""
"[literal]``4.2.x`` → [literal]``4.3.0`` or [literal]``4.1.x`` → "
"[literal]``4.3.0`"
msgstr "[literal]``4.2.x`` → [literal]``4.3.0`` ຫຼື [literal]``4.1.x`` → [literal]``4.3.0`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The upgrade from version 4.1 to 4.3 will also upgrade the base OS from "
"{sles} 15 SP2 to {sles} 15 SP4, and the PostgreSQL database from "
"version{nbsp}12 to 14 with an additional step.  For more information about "
"the database upgrade, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:db-migration-xy.adoc[]."
msgstr "ການອັບເກຣດຈາກເວີຊັນ 4.1 ເປັນ 4.3 ຈະທຳການອັບເກຣດ OS ພື້ນຖານຈາກ {sles} 15 SP2 ເປັນ {sles} 15 SP4 ພ້ອມກັນ, ແລະ ອັບເກຣດຖານຂໍ້ມູນ PostgreSQL ຈາກເວີຊັນ{nbsp}12 ເປັນ 14 ດ້ວຍຂັ້ນຕອນເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການອັບເກຣດຖານຂໍ້ມູນ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:db-migration-xy.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Upgrades should be run from a text console, rather than a graphical "
"interface like GNOME.  If you are logged into a GNOME session running on the "
"machine you are going to migrate, you will need to switch to a text "
"console.  This does not apply if you are logged in from a remote machine "
"(unless you are running a VNC session with GNOME)."
msgstr "ການອັບເກຣດຄວນເຮັດຜ່ານ text console ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນ graphical interface ເຊັ່ນ GNOME. ຫາກທ່ານເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ GNOME ຢູ່ໃນເຄື່ອງທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງຈະຍ້າຍລະບົບ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສະຫຼັບໄປໃຊ້ text console. ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ລວມເຖິງກໍລະນີທີ່ທ່ານເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບຈາກເຄື່ອງອື່ນຜ່ານທາງໄກ (ຍົກເວັ້ນແຕ່ທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ VNC ເພື່ອເປີດ GNOME)."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Before the upgrade, ensure that storage requirements are met.  For more "
"information, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc[].  The migration "
"procedure can fill the root partition if there is not enough space available "
"due to the service pack migration and the download of new software "
"packages.  It is the same for the [path]``/var/lib/pgsql`` when upgrading "
"PostgreSQL.  It takes a copy of the old database, thus be sure to have at "
"least enough space available to cope with a copy of the database."
msgstr "ກ່ອນການອັບເກຣດ, ຕ້ອງແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ມາດຕະຖານດ້ານພື້ນທີ່ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc[]. ຂັ້ນຕອນການຍ້າຍລະບົບອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ root partition ເຕັມໄດ້ ຫາກມີພື້ນທີ່ບໍ່ພຽງພໍເນື່ອງຈາກການຍ້າຍ service pack ແລະ ການດາວໂຫຼດແພັກເກດຊອບແວໃໝ່. ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັນກັບ [path]``/var/lib/pgsql`` ເມື່ອອັບເກຣດ PostgreSQL. ມັນຈະສ້າງສຳເນົາຂອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນເກົ່າ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຕ້ອງແນ່ໃຈວ່າມີພື້ນທີ່ພຽງພໍສຳລັບການສຳເນົາຖານຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. // FIXME: For 5.0/5.1, this could probably be deleted
#. //        server-migrator.sh ???
#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Preparing the upgrade to 4.3"
msgstr "ການກຽມການອັບເກຣດເປັນ 4.3"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Before you start the upgrade process you must deactive the Python 2 module "
"([package]``sle-module-python2``) on the old 4.1.x or 4.2.x {productname} "
"Server.  In case of 4.1.x, on the command line, as root, run:"
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເລີ່ມຂະບວນການອັບເກຣດ ທ່ານຕ້ອງປິດໃຊ້ງານໂມດູນ Python 2 ([package]``sle-module-python2``) ໃນ {productname} Server ເວີຊັນ 4.1.x ຫຼື 4.2.x ເກົ່າ. ໃນກໍລະນີຂອງ 4.1.x, ທີ່ command line, ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "SUSEConnect -d -p sle-module-python2/15.2/x86_64\n"
msgstr "SUSEConnect -d -p sle-module-python2/15.2/x86_64\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y.adoc:11
msgid "In case of 4.2.x, on the command line, as root, run:"
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີຂອງ 4.2.x, ທີ່ command line, ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "SUSEConnect -d -p sle-module-python2/15.3/x86_64\n"
msgstr "SUSEConnect -d -p sle-module-python2/15.3/x86_64\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y.adoc:13
msgid ""
"This deactivation step is necessary because the Python 2 module is no longer "
"available on the new {productname} 4.3.  On {productname} Server 4.3, the "
"Python 3 module ([package]``sle-module-python3``) will get installed."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນການປິດໃຊ້ງານນີ້ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນ ເພາະວ່າໂມດູນ Python 2 ຈະບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ອີກຕໍ່ໄປໃນ {productname} 4.3 ໃໝ່. ໃນ {productname} Server 4.3, ໂມດູນ Python 3 ([package]``sle-module-python3``) ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງແທນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-y.adoc:14
msgid "For more information, see the {productname} 4.3 release notes."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ {productname} 4.3 release notes."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-z.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Server - Patch Level Upgrade (Z Upgrade)"
msgstr "ເຊີເວີ - ການອັບເກຣດລະດັບ Patch (Z Upgrade)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-z.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This update procedure covers simple package updates or a concerted micro "
"update, which is also known as a maintenance update (MU).  During a MU the "
"user stops services, updates packages, runs the script to update the "
"database, and restarts services."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນການອັບເດດນີ້ກວມເອົາການອັບເດດແພັກເກດທົ່ວໄປ ຫຼື ການອັບເດດຍ່ອຍທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ maintenance update (MU). ໃນລະຫວ່າງ MU ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະຢຸດການບໍລິການ, ອັບເດດແພັກເກດ, ໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບເພື່ອອັບເດດຖານຂໍ້ມູນ, ແລະ ເລີ່ມການບໍລິການໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-z.adoc:3
msgid "Example: [literal]``4.3.0`` → [literal]``4.3.1``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: [literal]``4.3.0`` → [literal]``4.3.1``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-z.adoc:4
msgid ""
"This means first you ensure that you have the latest version of all "
"installed packages installed.  Then you can upgrade the database schema."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ ທຳອິດທ່ານຕ້ອງແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດທັງໝົດເປັນເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດແລ້ວ. ຈາກນັ້ນທ່ານຈຶ່ງສາມາດອັບເກຣດ database schema ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-z.adoc:6
msgid ""
"By default, several update channels are configured and enabled for the "
"{productname} Server.  New and updated packages will become available "
"automatically."
msgstr "ຕາມຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຊ່ອງທາງອັບເດດຫຼາຍແຫ່ງໄດ້ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ງານສຳລັບ {productname} Server. ແພັກເກດໃໝ່ ແລະ ແພັກເກດທີ່ອັບເດດແລ້ວຈະມີໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-z.adoc:12
msgid "List available patches:"
msgstr "ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ patch ທີ່ມີ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-z.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper list-patches\n"
msgstr "zypper list-patches\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-z.adoc:14
msgid "Apply all available patches:"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ patch ທັງໝົດທີ່ມີ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-z.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper patch\n"
msgstr "zypper patch\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-z.adoc:16
msgid ""
"This command only applies patches.  To apply all outstanding updates, use "
"[command]``zypper up`` instead."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງສະເພາະ patch ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງທຸກການອັບເດດທີ່ຍັງຄ້າງຢູ່, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [command]``zypper up`` ແທນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/server-z.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Command [command]``spacewalk-schema-upgrade`` is not needed anymore.  It "
"will run automatically during [command]``spacewalk-service start``."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``spacewalk-schema-upgrade`` ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ອີກແລ້ວ. ມັນຈະເຮັດວຽກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນລະຫວ່າງ [command]``spacewalk-service start``."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/setup-intro.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/setup-intro.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section describes the initial steps you need to take after installation "
"to make your {productname} environment ready to use."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ອະທິບາຍເຖິງຂັ້ນຕອນທຳອິດທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງເຮັດຫຼັງຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/setup-wizard.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setup Wizard"
msgstr "ຕົວຊ່ວຍໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ (Setup Wizard)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/setup-wizard.adoc:2
msgid ""
"When you have completed your {productname} installation, you can use the "
"setup wizard to complete the last few steps.  The setup wizard allows you to "
"configure the HTTP proxy, organization credentials, and {suse} products."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ setup wizard ເພື່ອເຮັດຂັ້ນຕອນສຸດທ້າຍໃຫ້ສຳເລັດ. setup wizard ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າ HTTP proxy, ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງອົງກອນ, ແລະ ຜະລິດຕະພັນ {suse}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/setup-wizard.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The setup wizard is displayed by default when you log in the {productname} "
"{webui} for the first time.  You can access the setup wizard directly by "
"navigating to menu:Admin[Setup Wizard]."
msgstr "setup wizard ຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອທ່ານເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ {productname} {webui} ຄັ້ງທຳອິດ. ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ setup wizard ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງໂດຍການໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Setup Wizard]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/setup-wizard.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure the HTTP Proxy"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ HTTP Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/setup-wizard.adoc:5
msgid ""
"{productname} can connect to the {scc} (SCC) or other remote servers using a "
"proxy.  Navigate to the [guimenu]``HTTP Proxy`` tab to configure the proxy."
msgstr "{productname} ສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາ {scc} (SCC) ຫຼື ເຊີເວີອື່ນໆ ໂດຍໃຊ້ proxy. ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ແຖບ [guimenu]``HTTP Proxy`` ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/setup-wizard.adoc:6
msgid ""
"You will need to provide the hostname of the proxy.  Use the syntax "
"``<hostname>:<port>``.  For example: ``<example.com>:8080``."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງລະບຸ hostname ຂອງ proxy. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ ``<hostname>:<port>``. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ``<example.com>:8080``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/setup-wizard.adoc:7
msgid "You can disable use of the proxy by clearing the fields."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດປິດການໃຊ້ງານ proxy ໄດ້ໂດຍການລຶບຂໍ້ມູນໃນຊ່ອງຕ່າງໆອອກ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/setup-wizard.adoc:8
msgid ""
"When choosing a username or password for your {productname} Proxy, ensure it "
"does not contain an ``@`` or ``:`` character.  These characters are "
"reserved."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເລືອກຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ຫຼື ລະຫັດຜ່ານສຳລັບ proxy {productname} ຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າມັນບໍ່ມີຕົວອັກສອນ ``@`` ຫຼື ``:``. ຕົວອັກສອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນຖືກສະຫງວນໄວ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/setup-wizard.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure Organization Credentials"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງອົງກອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/setup-wizard.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Your {scc} account is associated with the administration account of your "
"organization.  You can share your {scc} access with other users within your "
"organization.  Navigate to the [guimenu]``Organization Credentials`` tab to "
"grant users within your organization access to your {scc} account."
msgstr "ບັນຊີ {scc} ຂອງທ່ານມີຄວາມກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບບັນຊີຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຂອງອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ. ທ່ານສາມາດແບ່ງປັນການເຂົ້າເຖິງ {scc} ກັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ອື່ນໆພາຍໃນອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານໄດ້. ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ແຖບ [guimenu]``Organization Credentials`` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສິດຜູ້ໃຊ້ພາຍໃນອົງກອນເຂົ້າເຖິງບັນຊີ {scc} ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/setup-wizard.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Add a new credential], enter the username and password of the "
"user to grant access to, and click btn:[Save].  A new credential card is "
"shown for the user you have granted access to.  Use these buttons on the "
"card to edit or revoke access:"
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Add a new credential], ປ້ອນຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ສິດ, ແລ້ວກົດ btn:[Save]. ບັດຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວໃໝ່ຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ໃຫ້ສິດ. ໃຊ້ປຸ່ມເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃນບັດເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂ ຫຼື ຍົກເລີກການເຂົ້າເຖິງ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/setup-wizard.adoc:12
msgid "Check credential validation status (green tick or red cross icon)."
msgstr "ກວດສອບສະຖານະຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ (ໄອຄອນເຄື່ອງໝາຍຕິກສີຂຽວ ຫຼື ກາກບາດສີແດງ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/setup-wizard.adoc:13
msgid "To re-check the credential with SCC, click the icon."
msgstr "ເພື່ອທຳການກວດສອບຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວກັບ SCC ຄືນໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ກົດທີ່ໄອຄອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/setup-wizard.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Set the primary credentials for inter-server synchronization (yellow star "
"icon)."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຫຼັກສຳລັບການຊິງໂຄຣໄນລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ (ໄອຄອນດາວສີເຫຼືອງ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/setup-wizard.adoc:15
msgid "List the subscriptions related to a certain credential (list icon)."
msgstr "ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວນັ້ນໆ (ໄອຄອນລາຍການ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/setup-wizard.adoc:16
msgid "Edit the credential (pencil icon)."
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ (ໄອຄອນສໍ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/setup-wizard.adoc:17
msgid "Delete the credential (trash can icon)."
msgstr "ລຶບຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ (ໄອຄອນຖັງຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອ)."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/setup-wizard.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure Products"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຜະລິດຕະພັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/setup-wizard.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Your {suse} subscription entitles you to access a range of products.  "
"Navigate to the [guimenu]``Products`` tab to browse the products available "
"to you and synchronize {productname} with {scc}."
msgstr "ການສະໝັກນຳໃຊ້ {suse} ຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ສິດທ່ານໃນການເຂົ້າເຖິງຜະລິດຕະພັນຕ່າງໆ. ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ແຖບ [guimenu]``Products`` ເພື່ອເລືອກເບິ່ງຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ມີໃຫ້ທ່ານ ແລະ ຊິງໂຄຣໄນ {productname} ກັບ {scc}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/setup-wizard.adoc:20
msgid "Filters help you search for products by description or architecture."
msgstr "ຕົວຊ່ວຍກັ່ນຕອງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຄົ້ນຫາຜະລິດຕະພັນຕາມຄຳອະທິບາຍ ຫຼື ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/setup-wizard.adoc:21
msgid ""
"The list is organized by product name showing products on top which have a "
"subscription.  Freely available products appear at the end of the list.  For "
"each product, you can see the architecture it can be used on.  Click the "
"arrow next to the product name to see associated channels and extensions.  "
"Click the btn:[Channels] icon to see the complete list of channels "
"associated with each product."
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ຖືກຈັດລຽງຕາມຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນ ໂດຍສະແດງຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ມີການສະໝັກໃຊ້ໄວ້ທາງເທິງ. ຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຟຣີຈະປະກົດຢູ່ທ້າຍລາຍການ. ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຜະລິດຕະພັນ, ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳທີ່ຮອງຮັບໄດ້. ກົດທີ່ລູກສອນຂ້າງຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນເພື່ອເບິ່ງຊ່ອງທາງ ແລະ ສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ. ກົດໄອຄອນ btn:[Channels] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງທັງໝົດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບແຕ່ລະຜະລິດຕະພັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/setup-wizard.adoc:22
msgid ""
"For products based on {sle}{nbsp}15 and above, you can choose to only "
"synchronize required packages, or to also include recommended products.  "
"Toggle the btn:[include recommended] switch on to synchronize all products, "
"and toggle the switch off to synchronize only required products."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ອີງໃສ່ {sle}{nbsp}15 ຂຶ້ນໄປ, ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກທີ່ຈະ synchronize ສະເພາະແພັກເກດທີ່ຈຳເປັນ ຫຼື ລວມເອົາຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ແນະນຳນຳ. ເປີດສະວິດ btn:[include recommended] ເພື່ອ synchronize ທຸກຜະລິດຕະພັນ, ແລະ ປິດສະວິດເພື່ອ synchronize ສະເພາະຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ຈຳເປັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/setup-wizard.adoc:23
msgid ""
"You can further refine which products you want to synchronize by selecting "
"or deselecting individual product."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ຕ້ອງການ synchronize ໄດ້ລະອຽດຂຶ້ນໂດຍການເລືອກ ຫຼື ຍົກເລີກການເລືອກແຕ່ລະຜະລິດຕະພັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/setup-wizard.adoc:24
msgid ""
"When you have completed your selection, click btn:[Add products], and click "
"btn:[Refresh] to schedule the synchronization."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານເລືອກສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ກົດ btn:[Add products], ແລະ ກົດ btn:[Refresh] ເພື່ອຕັ້ງເວລາການ synchronize."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/setup-wizard.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Synchronization progress for each product is shown in a progress bar next to "
"the product name.  Depending on the products you have chosen, "
"synchronization can take up to several hours.  New products will be "
"available for you to use in {productname} when synchronization is complete."
msgstr "ຄວາມຄືບໜ້າການ synchronize ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຜະລິດຕະພັນຈະສະແດງໃນແຖບຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຂ້າງຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນ. ຂຶ້ນກັບຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກ, ການ synchronize ອາດໃຊ້ເວລາຫຼາຍຊົ່ວໂມງ. ຜະລິດຕະພັນໃໝ່ຈະພ້ອມໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານໃນ {productname} ເມື່ອການ synchronize ສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/setup-wizard.adoc:26
msgid ""
"If your synchronization fails, it could be because of a third party GPG key "
"or your company firewall blocking access to the download server.  Please "
"check the notification details for the error.  For more information about "
"troubleshooting product synchronization, see "
"xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຫາກການ synchronize ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ, ມັນອາດຈະເກີດຈາກ GPG key ພາຍນອກ ຫຼື firewall ຂອງບໍລິສັດທ່ານປິດກັ້ນການເຂົ້າເຖິງເຊີເວີດາວໂຫຼດ. ກະລຸນາກວດສອບລາຍລະອຽດການແຈ້ງເຕືອນສຳລັບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການ synchronize ຜະລິດຕະພັນ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/upgrade-intro.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upgrade introduction"
msgstr "ແນະນຳການອັບເກຣດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/upgrade-intro.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{productname} has three main components, all of which need regular updates.  "
"This guide covers updating the {productname} Server, Proxy, and clients, as "
"well as some underlying components, such as the database."
msgstr "{productname} ມີສາມອົງປະກອບຫຼັກ ເຊິ່ງທັງໝົດຕ້ອງການການອັບເດດເປັນປະຈຳ. ຄູ່ມືນີ້ກວມເອົາການອັບເດດ {productname} Server, Proxy, ແລະ ໄຄແອນ, ລວມທັງອົງປະກອບພື້ນຖານບາງຢ່າງ ເຊັ່ນ ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/upgrade-intro.adoc:4
msgid ""
"It is possible to automate some of the upgrades, but others need to be "
"performed manually."
msgstr "ມັນເປັນໄປໄດ້ທີ່ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ບາງການອັບເກຣດເປັນແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ແຕ່ສ່ວນອື່ນໆແມ່ນຕ້ອງເຮັດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/upgrade-intro.adoc:5
msgid ""
"This guide is not intended to be read cover to cover.  Instead, navigate to "
"the component you want to upgrade, then identify the versions you are "
"upgrading from and to."
msgstr "ຄູ່ມືນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ອອກແບບມາໃຫ້ອ່ານຕັ້ງແຕ່ຕົ້ນຈົນຈົບ. ແຕ່ໃຫ້ທ່ານໄປທີ່ອົງປະກອບທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການອັບເກຣດ, ແລ້ວກວດສອບເວີຊັນທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງອັບເກຣດຈາກ ແລະ ເວີຊັນທີ່ຈະອັບເກຣດໄປຫາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/upgrade-intro.adoc:19
msgid ""
"If you are upgrading the {productname} Server, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:server-intro.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານກຳລັງອັບເກຣດ {productname} Server, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:server-intro.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/upgrade-intro.adoc:20
msgid ""
"{productname} uses an [literal]``YYYY.MM`` versioning schema suitable for "
"rolling releases."
msgstr "{productname} ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບເວີຊັນແບບ [literal]``YYYY.MM`` ທີ່ເໝາະສຳລັບ rolling releases."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/upgrade-intro.adoc:21
msgid ""
"If you are upgrading the {productname} Server, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:server-intro-uyuni.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານກຳລັງອັບເກຣດ {productname} Server, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:server-intro-uyuni.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/upgrade-intro.adoc:22
msgid ""
"If you are upgrading the {productname} Proxy, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:proxy-intro.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານກຳລັງອັບເກຣດ {productname} Proxy, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:proxy-intro.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/upgrade-intro.adoc:23
msgid ""
"If you are upgrading clients, see "
"xref:client-configuration:client-upgrades.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານກຳລັງອັບເກຣດໄຄແອນ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:client-upgrades.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/upgrade-intro.adoc:24
msgid ""
"In addition to upgrading the server, you need to upgrade other underlying "
"technologies, including the database.  For more information about upgrading "
"the database, see xref:installation-and-upgrade:db-intro.adoc[]."
msgstr "ນອກຈາກການອັບເກຣດເຊີເວີແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຍັງຕ້ອງອັບເກຣດເຕັກໂນໂລຊີພື້ນຖານອື່ນໆ ລວມທັງຖານຂໍ້ມູນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການອັບເກຣດຖານຂໍ້ມູນ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:db-intro.adoc[]."

