#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-registration.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{productname} Proxy Registration"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນ {productname} Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-registration.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Proxy systems are registered as {salt} clients using bootstrap script or "
"{webui}."
msgstr "ລະບົບ Proxy ຈະຖືກລົງທະບຽນເປັນ {salt} ໄຄແອນ ໂດຍໃຊ້ bootstrap script ຫຼື {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-registration.adoc:5
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, create openSUSE Leap and the {productname} "
"Proxy channels with the [command]``spacewalk-common-channels`` command."
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ {productname} Server, ໃຫ້ສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງ openSUSE Leap ແລະ {productname} Proxy ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``spacewalk-common-channels``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-registration.adoc:6
msgid ""
"[command]``spacewalk-common-channels`` is part of the "
"[package]``spacewalk-utils`` package:"
msgstr "[command]``spacewalk-common-channels`` ແມ່ນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງແພັກເກດ [package]``spacewalk-utils``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-registration.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"spacewalk-common-channels \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4 \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-non-oss \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-non-oss-updates \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-updates \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-backports-updates \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-sle-updates \\\n"
"uyuni-proxy-stable-leap-154\n"
msgstr ""
"spacewalk-common-channels \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4 \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-non-oss \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-non-oss-updates \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-updates \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-backports-updates \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-sle-updates \\\n"
"uyuni-proxy-stable-leap-154\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-registration.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Instead of [systemitem]``uyuni-proxy-stable-leap-154`` you can also try "
"[systemitem]``uyuni-proxy-devel-leap`` which is the current development "
"version."
msgstr "ແທນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ [systemitem]``uyuni-proxy-stable-leap-154`` ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດລອງໃຊ້ [systemitem]``uyuni-proxy-devel-leap`` ເຊິ່ງເປັນເວີຊັນກຳລັງພັດທະນາໃນປະຈຸບັນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-registration.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Before you can select the correct child channels while creating the "
"activation key, ensure you have properly synchronized the {opensuse} Leap "
"channel with all the needed child channels and the {productname} Proxy "
"channel."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະສາມາດເລືອກ child channels ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໃນລະຫວ່າງການສ້າງ activation key, ຕ້ອງແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ່ອງທາງ {opensuse} Leap ພ້ອມກັບ child channels ທີ່ຈຳເປັນທັງໝົດ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງ {productname} Proxy ຮຽບຮ້ອຍແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-registration.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Create an activation key with {opensuse} Leap as a base channel and the "
"other channels as child channels.  For more information about activation "
"keys, see xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສ້າງ activation key ໂດຍມີ {opensuse} Leap ເປັນ base channel ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງອື່ນໆເປັນ child channels. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ activation keys, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-registration.adoc:11
msgid "Create a bootstrap script for the proxy, and adjust it."
msgstr "ສ້າງ bootstrap script ສຳລັບ proxy, ແລະ ປັບແຕ່ງມັນ."

#.     For more information, see xref:client-configuration:clients-opensuseleap.adoc[].
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-registration.adoc:12
msgid "Add the GPG key to the [systemitem]``ORG_GPG_KEY=`` parameter."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມ GPG key ເຂົ້າໃນພາຣາມີເຕີ [systemitem]``ORG_GPG_KEY=``."

#.     For more information about bootstrap scripts, see xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[].
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-registration.adoc:13
msgid "Bootstrap the client using the script."
msgstr "ເຮັດ Bootstrap ໃຫ້ໄຄແອນໂດຍໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-registration.adoc:14
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-registration.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Salt[Keys] and accept the key.  When the key is accepted, "
"the new proxy will show in menu:Systems[Overview] in the [guimenu]``Recently "
"Registered Systems`` section."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ menu:Salt[Keys] ແລະ ກົດຍອມຮັບ (accept) key. ເມື່ອ key ຖືກຍອມຮັບແລ້ວ, proxy ໃໝ່ຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນໃນ menu:Systems[Overview] ພາຍໃຕ້ພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Recently Registered Systems``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-registration.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Alternatively, in the {productname} {webui}, navigate to "
"menu:System[Bootstrapping]."
msgstr "ຫຼື ອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງ, ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:System[Bootstrapping]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-registration.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:System Details[Software > Software Channels], and check "
"that the proxy channel is selected."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ menu:System Details[Software > Software Channels], ແລະ ກວດສອບວ່າຊ່ອງທາງ proxy ໄດ້ຖືກເລືອກແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-registration.adoc:18
msgid ""
"For setting up a registered {productname} Proxy, see "
"xref:uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Proxy ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Uyuni Proxy Setup"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Uyuni Proxy"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the [path]``uyuni_proxy`` pattern"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ [path]``uyuni_proxy`` pattern"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Check that the Proxy pattern is installed correctly.  This step is part of "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-proxy-uyuni.adoc[].  To verify a "
"successful installation, on the server select the "
"[package]``pattern_uyuni_proxy`` package for installation."
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າ Proxy pattern ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ແມ່ນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-proxy-uyuni.adoc[]. ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ສຳເລັດ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກແພັກເກດ [package]``pattern_uyuni_proxy`` ຢູ່ທີ່ເຊີເວີເພື່ອທຳການຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The salt-broker service will be automatically started after installation is "
"complete.  This service forwards the Salt interactions to the {productname} "
"server."
msgstr "ການບໍລິການ salt-broker ຈະຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຫຼັງຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງສຳເລັດ. ການບໍລິການນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຕໍ່ການໂຕ້ຕອບຂອງ Salt ໄປຍັງ {productname} server."

#.  REMARK 2019-08-23, ke: Is this a Salt proxy-only feature?
#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Proxy Chains"
msgstr "Proxy Chains"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use SSL"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ SSL"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:23
msgid "For safety reasons, press ``Y``."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພ, ໃຫ້ກົດ ``Y``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:65
msgid ""
"It can also be done after a change within {cobbler} that needs to be "
"synchronized immediately.  Otherwise {cobbler} synchronization will run "
"automatically when needed.  For more information about PXE booting, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-pxeboot.adoc[Install via the Network]."
msgstr "ມັນຍັງສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ຫຼັງຈາກການປ່ຽນແປງພາຍໃນ {cobbler} ທີ່ຕ້ອງການການຊິງໂຄຣໄນທັນທີ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຂອງ {cobbler} ຈະເຮັດວຽກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອຈຳເປັນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ PXE booting, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-pxeboot.adoc[Install via the Network]."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure DHCP for PXE through Proxy"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ DHCP ສຳລັບ PXE ຜ່ານ Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:67
msgid ""
"{productname} uses {cobbler} for client provisioning.  PXE (tftp) is "
"installed and activated by default.  Clients must be able to find the PXE "
"boot on the {productname} Proxy using DHCP.  Use this DHCP configuration for "
"the zone which contains the clients to be provisioned:"
msgstr "{productname} ໃຊ້ {cobbler} ສຳລັບການຈັດກຽມໄຄແອນ. PXE (tftp) ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ງານໄວ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ໄຄແອນຕ້ອງສາມາດຊອກຫາ PXE boot ໃນ {productname} Proxy ໂດຍໃຊ້ DHCP. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ DHCP ນີ້ສຳລັບ zone ທີ່ມີໄຄແອນທີ່ຈະຖືກຈັດກຽມ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:70
msgid ""
"A proxy does not contain any information about the clients that are "
"connected to it.  Therefore, a proxy can be replaced by a new one at any "
"time.  The replacement proxy must have the same name and IP address as its "
"predecessor."
msgstr "Proxy ບໍ່ໄດ້ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໃດໆກ່ຽວກັບໄຄແອນທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບມັນ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, Proxy ສາມາດຖືກແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍຕົວໃໝ່ໄດ້ທຸກເວລາ. Proxy ຕົວໃໝ່ຕ້ອງມີຊື່ ແລະ ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຄືກັນກັບຕົວເກົ່າ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:72
msgid ""
"The reactivation key is only needed if you do not want to lose the history "
"of the machine.  If you do not use a reactivation key, the replacement proxy "
"will become a \"new\" one with a new ID."
msgstr "Reactivation key ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອທ່ານບໍ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ປະຫວັດຂອງເຄື່ອງນັ້ນສູນຫາຍ. ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ໃຊ້ reactivation key, Proxy ຕົວໃໝ່ຈະກາຍເປັນເຄື່ອງ \"ໃໝ່\" ທີ່ມີ ID ໃໝ່."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:73
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Replacing a Proxy and Keeping the Clients Registered"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປ່ຽນແທນ Proxy ໂດຍທີ່ຍັງຄົງການລົງທະບຽນຂອງໄຄແອນໄວ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:74
msgid ""
"Before starting the actual migration procedure, save the data from the old "
"proxy, if needed."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມຂັ້ນຕອນການຍ້າຍລະບົບຕົວຈິງ, ໃຫ້ບັນທຶກຂໍ້ມູນຈາກ Proxy ເກົ່າໄວ້ ຫາກຈຳເປັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:75
msgid ""
"Consider copying important or manually created data to a central place that "
"can also be accessed by the new proxy."
msgstr "ພິຈາລະນາການຄັດລອກຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສຳຄັນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໄປໄວ້ໃນບ່ອນກາງທີ່ Proxy ຕົວໃໝ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:77
msgid "Install a new {productname} Proxy."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} Proxy ຕົວໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:78
msgid ""
"For installation instructions, see xref:install-proxy-unified.adoc[Proxy "
"Installation]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:install-proxy-unified.adoc[Proxy Installation]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:80
msgid ""
"In the {webui}, create a reactivation key for the old proxy system: On the "
"System Details tab of the old proxy click [guimenu]``Reactivation``."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui}, ໃຫ້ສ້າງ reactivation key ສຳລັບລະບົບ Proxy ເກົ່າ: ຢູ່ແຖບ System Details ຂອງ Proxy ເກົ່າ ໃຫ້ກົດ [guimenu]``Reactivation``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:81
msgid ""
"Click [guimenu]``Generate New Key``, and make a note of the new key, as you "
"will need it later.  For more information about reactivation keys, see "
"xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-reactivation.adoc[Reactivation "
"Keys]."
msgstr "ກົດ [guimenu]``Generate New Key``, ແລະ ຈົດບັນທຶກ key ໃໝ່ໄວ້ ເພາະທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ມັນໃນພາຍຫຼັງ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ reactivation keys, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-reactivation.adoc[Reactivation Keys]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-proxy-setup.adoc:82
msgid "OPTIONAL: After the installation of the new proxy, you might also need to:"
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ຫຼັງຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງ Proxy ຕົວໃໝ່ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງໄດ້:"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Uyuni Server Setup"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Uyuni Server"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:3
msgid "Start {productname} setup with {yast}"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ດ້ວຍ {yast}"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up {productname} with {yast}"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ດ້ວຍ {yast}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:8
msgid "This section will guide you through {productname} setup procedures."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ຈະແນະນຳທ່ານກ່ຽວກັບຂັ້ນຕອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:10
msgid "Log in to the {productname} Server and start {yast}."
msgstr "ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ {productname} Server ແລະ ເລີ່ມ {yast}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:11
msgid ""
"In {yast}, navigate to menu:Network Services[Uyuni Setup] to begin the "
"setup."
msgstr "ໃນ {yast}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Network Services[Uyuni Setup] ເພື່ອເລີ່ມການຕັ້ງຄ່າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:12
msgid ""
"From the introduction screen select menu:Uyuni Setup[Set up Uyuni from "
"scratch] and click btn:[Next] to continue."
msgstr "ຈາກໜ້າແນະນຳ ໃຫ້ເລືອກ menu:Uyuni Setup[Set up Uyuni from scratch] ແລະ ກົດ btn:[Next] ເພື່ອດຳເນີນການຕໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:14
msgid ""
"{productname} can sometimes send a large volume of notification emails.  You "
"can disable email notifications in the {webui} after setup, if you need to."
msgstr "{productname} ບາງຄັ້ງອາດສົ່ງອີເມລແຈ້ງເຕືອນເປັນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ. ທ່ານສາມາດປິດການແຈ້ງເຕືອນທາງອີເມລໄດ້ໃນ {webui} ຫຼັງຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:16
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Passwords must be at at least seven characters in length, and must not "
"contain spaces, single or double quotation marks (``'`` or ``\"``), "
"exclamation marks (``!``), or dollar signs (``$``).  Always store your "
"passwords in a secure location."
msgstr "ລະຫັດຜ່ານຕ້ອງມີຄວາມຍາວຢ່າງໜ້ອຍເຈັດຕົວອັກສອນ, ແລະ ຕ້ອງບໍ່ມີຍະຫວ່າງ, ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຄຳເວົ້າດ່ຽວ ຫຼື ຄູ່ (``'`` ຫຼື ``\"``), ເຄື່ອງໝາຍທ້ວງ (``!``), ຫຼື ເຄື່ອງໝາຍໂດລາ (``$``). ໃຫ້ເກັບຮັກສາລະຫັດຜ່ານຂອງທ່ານໄວ້ໃນບ່ອນທີ່ປອດໄພສະເໝີ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:17
msgid "You must have the certificate password to set up the {productname} Proxy."
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງມີລະຫັດຜ່ານໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Proxy."

#.  image::quickstart-mgr-setup4-ncurses.png[scaledwidth=80%]
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:19
msgid ""
"From the menu:Uyuni Setup[Database Settings] screen, enter a database user "
"and password and click btn:[Next] to continue."
msgstr "ຈາກໜ້າ menu:Uyuni Setup[Database Settings], ໃຫ້ໃສ່ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານ ແລ້ວກົດ btn:[Next] ເພື່ອດຳເນີນການຕໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:22
msgid "Click btn:[Yes] to run setup when prompted."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Yes] ເພື່ອເລີ່ມການຕັ້ງຄ່າເມື່ອມີການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:23
msgid "When setup is complete, click btn:[Next] to continue."
msgstr "ເມື່ອການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳເລັດ, ໃຫ້ກົດ btn:[Next] ເພື່ອດຳເນີນການຕໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:24
msgid "You will see the address of the {productname} {webui}."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈະເຫັນທີ່ຢູ່ຂອງ {productname} {webui}."

#.  In the next section you will create the administrator's account and synchronize with {scc}.
#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create the Main Administration Account"
msgstr "ການສ້າງບັນຊີຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຫຼັກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:27
msgid ""
"This section covers how to create your organization's main administration "
"account for {productname}."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ອະທິບາຍເຖິງວິທີສ້າງບັນຊີຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຫຼັກຂອງອົງກອນສຳລັບ {productname}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:28
msgid ""
"The main administration account has the highest authority within "
"{productname}.  Ensure you keep access information for this account secure."
msgstr "ບັນຊີຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຫຼັກມີອຳນາດສູງສຸດພາຍໃນ {productname}. ຕ້ອງແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານເກັບຮັກສາຂໍ້ມູນການເຂົ້າເຖິງບັນຊີນີ້ຢ່າງປອດໄພ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:29
msgid ""
"We recommend that you create lower level administration accounts for "
"organizations and groups.  Do not share the main administration access "
"details."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານສ້າງບັນຊີຜູ້ດູແລລະດັບຮອງສຳລັບອົງກອນ ແລະ ກຸ່ມຕ່າງໆ. ຢ່າແບ່ງປັນລາຍລະອຽດການເຂົ້າເຖິງຂອງຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຫຼັກ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Newer browser versions can block web access to the {productname} Server FQDN "
"because of HSTS."
msgstr "ເວີຊັນຂອງບຣາວເຊີທີ່ໃໝ່ກວ່າອາດຈະບລັອກການເຂົ້າເຖິງເວັບໄປຫາ FQDN ຂອງ {productname} Server ເນື່ອງຈາກ HSTS."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:31
msgid ""
"Installing the CA certificate from the [path]``pub`` directory via HTTP and "
"importing it to the browser will allow access to the server."
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ CA ຈາກໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``pub`` ຜ່ານ HTTP ແລະ ນຳເຂົ້າມັນໄປຍັງບຣາວເຊີ ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງເຊີເວີໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:32
msgid ""
"On the server, go to "
"http://<server>.example.com/pub/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT."
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ເຊີເວີ, ໄປທີ່ http://<server>.example.com/pub/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:35
msgid "In your web browser, enter the address for the {productname} {webui}."
msgstr "ໃນເວັບບຣາວເຊີຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ໃສ່ທີ່ຢູ່ສຳລັບ {productname} {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:36
msgid ""
"This address was provided after you completed setup.  For more information, "
"see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:uyuni-server-setup.adoc#server-setup-yast[]."
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ນີ້ໄດ້ມາຫຼັງຈາກທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳເລັດ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:uyuni-server-setup.adoc#server-setup-yast[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:37
msgid ""
"Log in to the {webui}, navigate to the menu:Create Organization[Organization "
"Name] field, and enter your organization name."
msgstr "ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ {webui}, ໄປທີ່ຊ່ອງ menu:Create Organization[Organization Name], ແລະ ໃສ່ຊື່ອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ."

#.  image::quickstart-mgr-setup-admin1.png[scaledwidth=80%]
#.  In the next section you will prepare the server for connecting the first client.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:41
msgid ""
"When you have completed the {productname} {webui} setup, you are taken to "
"the menu:Home[Overview] page."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} {webui} ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະຖືກພາຍັງໜ້າ menu:Home[Overview]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "Optional: Synchronizing Products from {scc}"
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຜະລິດຕະພັນຈາກ {scc}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:43
msgid ""
"{scc} (SCC) maintains a collection of repositories which contain packages, "
"software and updates for all supported enterprise client systems.  These "
"repositories are organized into channels each of which provide software "
"specific to a distribution, release, and architecture.  After synchronizing "
"with SCC, clients can receive updates, be organized into groups, and "
"assigned to specific product software channels."
msgstr "{scc} (SCC) ຈະເກັບຮັກສາຄັງຊອບແວທີ່ບັນຈຸແພັກເກດ, ຊອບແວ ແລະ ການອັບເດດສຳລັບທຸກລະບົບໄຄແອນລະດັບອົງກອນທີ່ຮອງຮັບ. ຄັງຊອບແວເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກຈັດເປັນຊ່ອງທາງ (channels) ເຊິ່ງແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງທາງຈະສະໜອງຊອບແວທີ່ສະເພາະເຈາະຈົງກັບ distro, ເວີຊັນ ແລະ ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ. ຫຼັງຈາກຊິງໂຄຣໄນກັບ SCC ແລ້ວ ໄຄແອນຈະສາມາດຮັບການອັບເດດ, ຖືກຈັດເຂົ້າກຸ່ມ ແລະ ຖືກມອບໝາຍໃຫ້ກັບຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວຂອງຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ສະເພາະເຈາະຈົງໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:45
msgid "For Uyuni, synchronizing products from {scc} is optional."
msgstr "ສຳລັບ Uyuni, ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຜະລິດຕະພັນຈາກ {scc} ແມ່ນເປັນທາງເລືອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:46
msgid ""
"Before you can synchronize software repositories with SCC, you will need to "
"enter organization credentials in {productname}.  The organization "
"credentials give you access to the {suse} product downloads.  You will find "
"your organization credentials in https://scc.suse.com/organizations."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະສາມາດຊິງໂຄຣໄນຄັງຊອບແວກັບ SCC ໄດ້, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃສ່ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງອົງກອນໃນ {productname}. ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງອົງກອນຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເຂົ້າເຖິງການດາວໂຫຼດຜະລິດຕະພັນ {suse} ໄດ້. ທ່ານຈະພົບຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານໃນ https://scc.suse.com/organizations."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:47
msgid "Enter your organization credentials in the {productname} {webui}:"
msgstr "ໃສ່ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານໃນ {productname} {webui}:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:49
msgid "In the {susemgr} {webui}, navigate to menu:Main Menu[Admin > Setup Wizard]."
msgstr "ໃນ {susemgr} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Main Menu[Admin > Setup Wizard]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:50
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Setup Wizard`` page, navigate to the btn:[Organization "
"Credentials] tab."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າ [guimenu]``Setup Wizard``, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ແຖບ btn:[Organization Credentials]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:52
msgid "Enter a username and password, and click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ໃສ່ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານ, ແລ້ວກົດ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:53
msgid ""
"A check mark icon is shown when the credentials are confirmed.  When you "
"have successfully entered the new credentials, you can synchronize with "
"{scc}."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນເຄື່ອງໝາຍຕິກຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນເມື່ອຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວໄດ້ຮັບການຢືນຍັນ. ເມື່ອທ່ານໃສ່ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວໃໝ່ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານກໍສາມາດຊິງໂຄຣໄນກັບ {scc} ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:55
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Setup Wizard]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Setup Wizard]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:57
msgid ""
"Wait a moment for the products list to populate.  If you previously "
"registered with {scc} a list of products will populate the table.  This "
"table lists architecture, channels, and status information.  For more "
"information, see xref:reference:admin/setup-wizard.adoc[Wizard]."
msgstr "ລໍຖ້າຈັກໜ້ອຍເພື່ອໃຫ້ລາຍຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນສະແດງຂຶ້ນ. ຫາກທ່ານເຄີຍລົງທະບຽນກັບ {scc} ມາກ່ອນ, ລາຍຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນໃນຕາຕະລາງ. ຕາຕະລາງນີ້ຈະສະແດງສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ, ຊ່ອງທາງ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນສະຖານະ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:reference:admin/setup-wizard.adoc[Wizard]."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "admin_suse_products.png"
msgstr "admin_suse_products.png"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:64
msgid ""
"In some environments, transparent huge pages provided by the kernel can slow "
"down PostgreSQL workloads significantly."
msgstr "ໃນບາງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ, transparent huge pages ທີ່ໃຫ້ໂດຍ kernel ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ PostgreSQL ຊ້າລົງຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-server-setup.adoc:65
msgid ""
"To disable transparent huge pages, set the "
"[parameter]``transparent_hugepage`` kernel parameter to ``never``.  You will "
"also need to open the [path]``/etc/default/grub`` file and add or edit the "
"line [option]``GRUB_CMDLINE_LINUX_DEFAULT``.  For example:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອປິດໃຊ້ງານ transparent huge pages, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າພາຣາມີເຕີ kernel [parameter]``transparent_hugepage`` ເປັນ ``never``. ທ່ານຍັງຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເປີດໄຟລ໌ [path]``/etc/default/grub`` ແລະ ເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂແຖວ [option]``GRUB_CMDLINE_LINUX_DEFAULT``. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Web Interface Setup"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເວັບອິນເຕີເຟດ (Web Interface)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:2
msgid ""
"To use the {productname} {webui}, navigate to your {productname} URL in a "
"browser.  Sign in to the {webui} using your {productname} Administration "
"account."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ງານ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ URL ຂອງ {productname} ໃນບຣາວເຊີ. ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ {webui} ໂດຍໃຊ້ບັນຊີຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:3
msgid ""
"While you are using the {webui}, click the "
"icon:question-circle[role=\"blue\"] icon to access the documentation for "
"that section."
msgstr "ໃນຂະນະທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ {webui}, ໃຫ້ກົດທີ່ໄອຄອນ icon:question-circle[role=\"blue\"] ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເບິ່ງເອກະສານຂອງພາກສ່ວນນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The first time you sign in to the {webui}, complete the setup wizard to set "
"your user preferences.  You can access the setup wizard at any time by "
"navigating to menu:Admin[Setup Wizard]."
msgstr "ຄັ້ງທຳອິດທີ່ທ່ານເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ {webui}, ໃຫ້ເຮັດການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນ setup wizard ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄ່າທີ່ທ່ານມັກ. ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ setup wizard ໄດ້ທຸກເວລາໂດຍການໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Setup Wizard]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:5
msgid ""
"After the initial setup is complete, signing in will take you the "
"menu:Home[Overview] section.  This section contains summary panes that "
"provide important information about your systems."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າເບື້ອງຕົ້ນສຳເລັດ, ການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບຈະພານທ່ານໄປຍັງພາກສ່ວນ menu:Home[Overview]. ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍແຖບສະຫຼຸບທີ່ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນສຳຄັນກ່ຽວກັບລະບົບຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Tasks`` pane provides shortcuts to the most common {webui} "
"tasks."
msgstr "ແຖບ [guimenu]``Tasks`` ຈະໃຫ້ທາງລັດໄປຫາໜ້າວຽກທີ່ໃຊ້ເລື້ອຍທີ່ສຸດໃນ {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Inactive Systems`` pane shows any clients that have stopped "
"checking in to the {productname} Server.  You will need to check these "
"clients."
msgstr "ແຖບ [guimenu]``Inactive Systems`` ຈະສະແດງໄຄແອນທີ່ຢຸດການຕິດຕໍ່ກັບ {productname} Server. ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກວດສອບໄຄແອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:8
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Most Critical Systems`` pane shows any clients that require "
"software updates.  Click the name of a client in the list to be taken to the "
"menu:Systems[System Details] section for that client.  From this page, you "
"can apply any required updates."
msgstr "ແຖບ [guimenu]``Most Critical Systems`` ຈະສະແດງໄຄແອນທີ່ຕ້ອງການການອັບເດດຊອບແວ. ກົດທີ່ຊື່ຂອງໄຄແອນໃນລາຍຊື່ເພື່ອໄປຍັງພາກສ່ວນ menu:Systems[System Details] ຂອງໄຄແອນນັ້ນ. ຈາກໜ້ານີ້, ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງການອັບເດດທີ່ຈຳເປັນໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:9
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Recently Scheduled Actions`` pane shows all recent actions "
"that have been run, and their status.  Click the label of an action to see "
"more detail."
msgstr "ແຖບ [guimenu]``Recently Scheduled Actions`` ຈະສະແດງການກະທຳທັງໝົດທີ່ຫາກໍຖືກສັ່ງງານ ແລະ ສະຖານະຂອງພວກມັນ. ກົດທີ່ປ້າຍຊື່ຂອງການກະທຳເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:10
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Relevant Security Patches`` pane shows all available security "
"patches that need to be applied to your clients.  It is critical that you "
"apply security patches as soon as possible to keep your clients secure."
msgstr "ແຖບ [guimenu]``Relevant Security Patches`` ຈະສະແດງ patch ຄວາມປອດໄພທັງໝົດທີ່ມີ ແລະ ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງໃຫ້ກັບໄຄແອນຂອງທ່ານ. ມັນເປັນສິ່ງສຳຄັນຫຼາຍທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງ patch ຄວາມປອດໄພໃຫ້ໄວທີ່ສຸດເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄຄແອນຂອງທ່ານປອດໄພ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:11
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``System Groups`` pane shows any system groups you have "
"created, and if the clients in those groups are fully updated."
msgstr "ແຖບ [guimenu]``System Groups`` ຈະສະແດງກຸ່ມລະບົບໃດໆທີ່ທ່ານສ້າງຂຶ້ນ, ແລະ ສະແດງວ່າໄຄແອນໃນກຸ່ມເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໄດ້ຮັບການອັບເດດຄົບຖ້ວນແລ້ວຫຼືບໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:12
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Recently Registered Systems`` pane shows all clients "
"registered in the past thirty days.  Click the name of a client in the list "
"to be taken to the menu:Systems[System Details] section for that client."
msgstr "ແຖບ [guimenu]``Recently Registered Systems`` ຈະສະແດງໄຄແອນທັງໝົດທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໃນ 30 ວັນທີ່ຜ່ານມາ. ກົດທີ່ຊື່ຂອງໄຄແອນໃນລາຍຊື່ເພື່ອໄປຍັງພາກສ່ວນ menu:Systems[System Details] ຂອງໄຄແອນນັ້ນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Web Interface Navigation"
msgstr "ການນຳທາງໃນເວັບອິນເຕີເຟດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:14
msgid ""
"The {productname} {webui} uses some standard elements to help you navigate.  "
"While you are using the {webui}, click the "
"icon:question-circle[role=\"blue\"] icon to access the documentation for "
"that section."
msgstr "{productname} {webui} ໃຊ້ອົງປະກອບມາດຕະຖານບາງຢ່າງເພື່ອຊ່ວຍທ່ານໃນການນຳທາງ. ໃນຂະນະທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ {webui}, ໃຫ້ກົດທີ່ໄອຄອນ icon:question-circle[role=\"blue\"] ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເບິ່ງເອກະສານຂອງພາກສ່ວນນັ້ນ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Top Navigation Bar"
msgstr "ແຖບນຳທາງດ້ານເທິງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:16
msgid "The top navigation bar gives access to system-wide functions."
msgstr "ແຖບນຳທາງດ້ານເທິງໃຫ້ການເຂົ້າເຖິງຟັງຊັນຕ່າງໆທົ່ວທັງລະບົບ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Notifications"
msgstr "ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:18
msgid ""
"The notification bell icon displays the number of unread notification "
"messages in a circle.  Click the notification icon to go to "
"menu:Home[Notification Messages]."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນລະຄັງແຈ້ງເຕືອນຈະສະແດງຈຳນວນຂໍ້ຄວາມແຈ້ງເຕືອນທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ອ່ານໃນວົງມົນ. ກົດທີ່ໄອຄອນແຈ້ງເຕືອນເພື່ອໄປຍັງ menu:Home[Notification Messages]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:19
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "Search"
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Click the search magnifying glass icon to open the search box.  You can "
"search for systems (clients), packages, patches, or documentation.  Click "
"btn:[Search] to go to the relevant [guimenu]``Advanced Search`` page, and "
"see your search results."
msgstr "ກົດທີ່ໄອຄອນແວ່ນຂະຫຍາຍຄົ້ນຫາເພື່ອເປີດຊ່ອງຄົ້ນຫາ. ທ່ານສາມາດຄົ້ນຫາລະບົບ (ໄຄແອນ), ແພັກເກດ, patch, ຫຼື ເອກະສານ. ກົດ btn:[Search] ເພື່ອໄປຍັງໜ້າ [guimenu]``Advanced Search`` ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ ແລະ ເບິ່ງຜົນການຄົ້ນຫາຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Systems Selected"
msgstr "ລະບົບທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:22
msgid ""
"The systems selected icon displays the number of currently selected systems "
"in a circle.  Click the systems selected icon to go to menu:Systems[System "
"Set Manager > Overview].  Click the eraser icon to unselect all systems.  "
"For more information about the system set manager, see "
"xref:client-configuration:system-set-manager.adoc[]."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນລະບົບທີ່ຖືກເລືອກຈະສະແດງຈຳນວນລະບົບທີ່ຖືກເລືອກໃນປະຈຸບັນໃນວົງມົນ. ກົດທີ່ໄອຄອນລະບົບທີ່ຖືກເລືອກເພື່ອໄປຍັງ menu:Systems[System Set Manager > Overview]. ກົດທີ່ໄອຄອນຢາງລຶບເພື່ອຍົກເລີກການເລືອກທຸກລະບົບ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ system set manager, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:system-set-manager.adoc[]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "User Account"
msgstr "ບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:24
msgid ""
"The user account icon is displayed with the name of the currently signed-in "
"user.  Click the user account icon to go to menu:Home[User Account > My "
"Account]."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະສະແດງພ້ອມກັບຊື່ຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ກຳລັງເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ. ກົດທີ່ໄອຄອນບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອໄປຍັງ menu:Home[User Account > My Account]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:26
msgid ""
"The organization icon is displayed with the name of the currently active "
"organization.  Click the organization icon to go to menu:Home[My "
"Organization > Configuration]."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນອົງກອນຈະສະແດງພ້ອມກັບຊື່ອົງກອນທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່. ກົດທີ່ໄອຄອນອົງກອນເພື່ອໄປຍັງ menu:Home[My Organization > Configuration]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "Preferences"
msgstr "ຄ່າທີ່ມັກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:28
msgid "Click the cogs icon to go to menu:Home[My Preferences]."
msgstr "ກົດທີ່ໄອຄອນເຟືອງເພື່ອໄປຍັງ menu:Home[My Preferences]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Sign Out"
msgstr "ອອກຈາກລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Click the exit icon to sign out the current user and return to the sign in "
"screen."
msgstr "ກົດທີ່ໄອຄອນອອກເພື່ອອອກຈາກລະບົບຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ປະຈຸບັນ ແລະ ກັບໄປຍັງໜ້າເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:31
msgid ""
"If you add a distribution, newly synchronize channels, or register a system "
"to the {productname} Server, it can take several minutes for it to be "
"indexed and appear in search results.  If you need to force a rebuild of the "
"search index, use this command at the command prompt:"
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານເພີ່ມ distro, ຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ່ອງທາງໃໝ່, ຫຼື ລົງທະບຽນລະບົບເຂົ້າກັບ {productname} Server, ມັນອາດຈະໃຊ້ເວລາສອງສາມນາທີເພື່ອໃຫ້ລະບົບທຳການຈັດດັດຊະນີ (indexed) ແລະ ປະກົດຂຶ້ນໃນຜົນການຄົ້ນຫາ. ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການບັງຄັບໃຫ້ສ້າງດັດຊະນີການຄົ້ນຫາໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ທີ່ command prompt:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "rhn-search cleanindex\n"
msgstr "rhn-search cleanindex\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Left Navigation Bar"
msgstr "ແຖບນຳທາງດ້ານຊ້າຍ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:34
msgid "The left navigation bar is the main menu to the {productname} {webui}."
msgstr "ແຖບນຳທາງດ້ານຊ້າຍແມ່ນເມນູຫຼັກຂອງ {productname} {webui}."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Expand"
msgstr "ຂະຫຍາຍ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:36
msgid ""
"If you click the icon or the down-arrow of a menu entry, it expands this "
"part of the menu tree without actually loading a page."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານກົດທີ່ໄອຄອນ ຫຼື ລູກສອນລົງຂອງລາຍການເມນູ, ມັນຈະຂະຫຍາຍສ່ວນນັ້ນຂອງເມນູອອກໂດຍທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ໂຫຼດໜ້າໃໝ່."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Collapse"
msgstr "ຫຍໍ້ເຂົ້າ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:38
msgid ""
"To collapse an open part of the menu system, click the up-arrow of a menu "
"entry."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຫຍໍ້ສ່ວນຂອງເມນູທີ່ເປີດຢູ່ເຂົ້າ, ໃຫ້ກົດທີ່ລູກສອນຂຶ້ນຂອງລາຍການເມນູ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "Autoload"
msgstr "ໂຫຼດອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:40
msgid ""
"If you click the name of a menu entry, the first available page of that menu "
"entry will get loaded and displayed automatically."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານກົດທີ່ຊື່ຂອງລາຍການເມນູ, ໜ້າທຳອິດທີ່ມີໃຫ້ຂອງເມນູນັ້ນຈະຖືກໂຫຼດ ແລະ ສະແດງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:42
msgid ""
"Enter a search string in the [guimenu]``Search page`` field to find an entry "
"of the menu tree.  Available menu entries depend on the roles of the user."
msgstr "ໃສ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມຄົ້ນຫາໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Search page`` ເພື່ອຫາລາຍການໃນເມນູ. ລາຍການເມນູທີ່ມີໃຫ້ຈະຂຶ້ນກັບບົດບາດ (roles) ຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:43
msgid "Only {productname} Administrators can access these sections:"
msgstr "ສະເພາະຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ {productname} ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງພາກສ່ວນເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:44
msgid "[guimenu]``Images``"
msgstr "[guimenu]``Images``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:45
msgid "[guimenu]``Users``"
msgstr "[guimenu]``Users``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:46
msgid "[guimenu]``Admin```"
msgstr "[guimenu]``Admin```"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tables"
msgstr "ຕາຕະລາງ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:48
msgid ""
"Many sections present information in tables.  You can navigate through most "
"tables by clicking the back and next arrows above and below the right side "
"of the table.  Change the default number of items shown on each page by "
"navigating to menu:Home[My Preferences]."
msgstr "ຫຼາຍໆພາກສ່ວນຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນໃນຮູບແບບຕາຕະລາງ. ທ່ານສາມາດເລື່ອນເບິ່ງຕາຕະລາງສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ໄດ້ໂດຍການກົດລູກສອນກັບຄືນ ແລະ ຖັດໄປ ທີ່ຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງ ແລະ ດ້ານລຸ່ມຂອງຕາຕະລາງເບື້ອງຂວາ. ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນຈຳນວນລາຍການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ຈະສະແດງໃນແຕ່ລະໜ້າໄດ້ໂດຍການໄປທີ່ menu:Home[My Preferences]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:49
msgid ""
"You can filter the content in most tables using the search bar at the top of "
"the table.  Sort table entries by clicking on the column header you want to "
"sort by.  Click the column header again to reverse the sort."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດກັ່ນຕອງເນື້ອຫາໃນຕາຕະລາງສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ແຖບຄົ້ນຫາຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງຂອງຕາຕະລາງ. ຈັດລຽງລາຍການໃນຕາຕະລາງໂດຍການກົດທີ່ຫົວຂໍ້ຄໍລຳທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຈັດລຽງ. ກົດທີ່ຫົວຂໍ້ຄໍລຳອີກຄັ້ງເພື່ອຈັດລຽງແບບປີ້ນກັບ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "Patch Alert Icons"
msgstr "ໄອຄອນການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ Patch"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:51
msgid ""
"Patches are represented by three main icons, depending on the type of "
"patch.  Icons are coloured either green, yellow, or red, depending on the "
"severity."
msgstr "Patch ຈະຖືກສະແດງດ້ວຍສາມໄອຄອນຫຼັກ ຂຶ້ນກັບປະເພດຂອງ patch. ໄອຄອນຈະມີສີຂຽວ, ສີເຫຼືອງ, ຫຼື ສີແດງ ຂຶ້ນກັບລະດັບຄວາມຮຸນແຮງ."

#. type: Table
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"|                             |  \n"
"|icon:shield-alt[role=\"none\"] | The shield icon is a security alert.\n"
"|                             | A red shield is the highest priority "
"security alert.\n"
"|icon:bug[role=\"none\"]        | The bug icon is a bug fix alert.\n"
"|image:spacewalk-icon-enhancement.svg[Enhancement Alert,scaledwidth=1.4em] | "
"The squares icon is an enhancement alert.\n"
msgstr ""
"|                             |  \n"
"|icon:shield-alt[role=\"none\"] | ໄອຄອນໂລ່ແມ່ນການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຄວາມປອດໄພ.\n"
"|                             | ໂລ່ສີແດງແມ່ນການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຄວາມປອດໄພລະດັບສູງສຸດ.\n"
"|icon:bug[role=\"none\"]        | ໄອຄອນແມງໄມ້ແມ່ນການແຈ້ງເຕືອນການແກ້ໄຂບັກ (bug fix).\n"
"|image:spacewalk-icon-enhancement.svg[Enhancement Alert,scaledwidth=1.4em] | ໄອຄອນຮູບສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມແມ່ນການແຈ້ງເຕືອນການເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບ (enhancement).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:53
msgid "Some additional icons are used to give extra information:"
msgstr "ມີບາງໄອຄອນເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນເສີມ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"|icon:sync[role=\"none\"]       | The circling arrows icon indicates that "
"applying a patch will require a reboot.\n"
"|icon:archive[role=\"none\"]    | The archive box icon indicates that a "
"patch will have an effect on package management.\n"
msgstr ""
"|icon:sync[role=\"none\"]       | ໄອຄອນລູກສອນໝູນວົນບົ່ງບອກວ່າການຕິດຕັ້ງ patch ນີ້ຕ້ອງມີການຣີບູດເຄື່ອງ.\n"
"|icon:archive[role=\"none\"]    | ໄອຄອນກ່ອງເກັບເອກະສານບົ່ງບອກວ່າ patch ນີ້ຈະມີຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ການຈັດການແພັກເກດ.\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "Interface Customization"
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງອິນເຕີເຟດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:56
msgid ""
"By default, the {productname} {webui} uses the theme appropriate to the "
"product you have installed.  You can change the theme to reflect the {uyuni} "
"or {susemgr} colors.  The {susemgr} theme also has a dark option available.  "
"To change the theme using the {webui}, navigate to menu:Home[My Preferences] "
"and locate the [guimenu]``Style Theme`` section."
msgstr "ຕາມຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, {productname} {webui} ຈະໃຊ້ທີມ (theme) ທີ່ເໝາະສົມກັບຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງ. ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນທີມເພື່ອສະແດງສີຂອງ {uyuni} ຫຼື {susemgr} ໄດ້. ທີມຂອງ {susemgr} ຍັງມີຕົວເລືອກແບບສີເຂັ້ມ (dark mode) ນຳຄືກັນ. ເພື່ອປ່ຽນທີມໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Home[My Preferences] ແລະ ຫາພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Style Theme``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:57
msgid ""
"For information about changing the default theme, see "
"xref:administration:users.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການປ່ຽນແປງທີມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:users.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "Request Timeout Value"
msgstr "ຄ່າໝົດເວລາການຮ້ອງຂໍ (Request Timeout Value)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:59
msgid ""
"As you are using the {webui}, you are sending requests to the {productname} "
"Server.  In some cases, these requests can take a long time, or fail "
"completely.  By default, requests will time out after 30 seconds, and a "
"message is displayed in the {webui} with a link to try sending the request "
"again."
msgstr "ໃນຂະນະທີ່ທ່ານໃຊ້ {webui}, ທ່ານກຳລັງສົ່ງຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍ (requests) ໄປຍັງ {productname} Server. ໃນບາງກໍລະນີ, ຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອາດໃຊ້ເວລາດົນ ຫຼື ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວໄດ້. ຕາມຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍຈະໝົດເວລາຫຼັງຈາກ 30 ວິນາທີ, ແລະ ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະສະແດງໃນ {webui} ພ້ອມກັບລິ້ງເພື່ອລອງສົ່ງຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍອີກຄັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/webui-setup.adoc:60
msgid ""
"You can configure the default timeout value in the ``etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` "
"configuration file, by adjusting the ``web.spa.timeout`` parameter.  Restart "
"the tomcat service after you change this parameter.  Changing this setting "
"to a higher number could be useful if you have a slow internet connection, "
"or regularly perform actions on many clients at once."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໝົດເວລາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄດ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ``etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` ໂດຍການປັບປຸງພາຣາມີເຕີ ``web.spa.timeout``. ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມການບໍລິການ tomcat ໃໝ່ຫຼັງຈາກປ່ຽນແປງພາຣາມີເຕີນີ້ນ. ການປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໃຫ້ເປັນຕົວເລກທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນອາດຈະມີປະໂຫຍດຫາກທ່ານມີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອິນເຕີເນັດທີ່ຊ້າ, ຫຼື ຕ້ອງເຮັດການກະທຳກັບໄຄແອນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍພ້ອມກັນເປັນປະຈຳ."
